INSERT INTO `busniss` VALUES (27,0,13,'Haris & Co, Glasgow','Haris Ahmed','','info@harisandco.com','Haris & Co','<div>\r\n	We work closely with our clients and act for a wide range of corporate and personal clients.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Apart from the general accounting services, we also can help with business development and specialist tax services...</div>\r\n','We work closely with our clients and act for a wide range of corporate and personal clients. Apart from the general accounting services, we also can help with business...','United Kingdom','Glasgow','22 Milnpark Street  Glasgow. G41 1BB','0044+141 420 3753','http://www.harisandco.com/','','We work closely with our clients and act for a wide range of corporate and personal clients. Apart from the general accounting services, we also can help with business...','',1,0,'busniss_img/large_27.jpg','busniss_img/orgsize_27Haris and Co.jpg','-4.2784551','55.8518630'),(28,0,13,'K. A. Javid & Co, Glasgow','Khalid A. Javid','','info@kajavid.com','K. A. Javid & Co','<p>\r\n	K.A. Javid &amp; Co. was established in 1990 as a firm of accountants in Glasgow, Scotland, United Kingdom by young and veteran professionals to provide accounting, taxation, management and computer consultancy services. Since January 2000, we have set up...</p>\r\n','K.A. Javid & Co. was established in 1990 as a firm of accountants in Glasgow, Scotland, United Kingdom by young and veteran professionals to provide accounting...','United Kingdom','Glasgow','115 Bath Street, Glasgow. G2 2SZ','0044+141 248 8666','http://www.kajavid.com/','','K.A. Javid & Co. was established in 1990 as a firm of accountants in Glasgow, Scotland, United Kingdom by young and veteran professionals to provide accounting...','Glasgow, Scotland, management and computer.',1,0,'busniss_img/large_28.jpg','busniss_img/orgsize_28K A Javid & Co.jpg','-4.2594036','55.8639563'),(29,0,12,'House of Suleman, Glasgow','Imtiaz Suleman','','imtiazsuleman@hotmail.com','M. Suleman Group Ltd','<div>\r\n	House of Suleman is one of Scotland&rsquo;s leading cash-and-carry operators. The first M. Suleman cash-and-carry clothing warehouse was set up in 1976 &nbsp;in Glasgow. Since then, the company has gone from strength to strength</div>\r\n','House of Suleman is one of Scotland’s leading cash-and-carry operators. The first M. Suleman cash-and-carry clothing warehouse was set up in 1976  in Glasgow...','Scotland, United Kingdom','Glasgow','House Of Suleman, 32-36 Stromness Street, Glasgow. G5 8HS','0044+141 429 5883','http://www.houseofsuleman.co.uk/','','House of Suleman is one of Scotland’s leading cash-and-carry operators. The first M. Suleman cash-and-carry clothing warehouse was set up in 1976  in Glasgow...','',1,0,'busniss_img/large_29.jpg','busniss_img/orgsize_29M Suleman Group.jpg','-4.2639167','55.8476843'),(30,0,12,'United Wholesale, Glasgow','Mohammad Ramzan','','info@uwgl.co.uk','United Wholesale Glasgow Ltd','<p>\r\n	<b>United Wholesale Grocers Ltd is a family owned and run business. UWG, the brand that exists today in Glasgow, is the result of over thirty five years of hard work by my father, Mr Mohammad Ramzan, who started out with a fiver in his pocket, and is today the owner of a multi-million pound empire that we operate today.</b></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	My father arrived in Glasgow from Pakistan in 1974 and was always destined to work in Retail and Wholesale. His first venture was selling clothes door-to-door which included travelling to places such as Dunoon in which he had to take a bus, train then ferry to reach his destination. He would carry a suitcase and cover more than six miles of land by foot.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	My father had a lot of friends in the Grocery Sector and took major interest in this market. In 1975, after saving up enough money, he opened his first convenience store, an empty property that needed a complete renovation whilst continuing the door-to-door business. His efforts paid off and in the first year his turn over was &pound;4,500 a week.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	A year later he purchased a second shop nearby, and it was here that the opportunity came along to enter the wholesale industry.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	A regular dairy products supplier went out of business so my father saw the opportunity to fill this gap and supply all the local stores in the area. In 1977 he opened a small 2,000 sq ft premises and soon added more ranges like confectionery, snacks and tobacco. The business thrived to achieve a &pound;16 million turnover.</p>\r\n','United Wholesale Grocers ltd is a family run wholesale cash and carry business selling food, drink and tobacco goods to Independent Retailers, Caterers...','Scotland, United Kingdom','Glasgow','246 Flemington Street, Springburn, Glasgow. G21 4BY','0044+141 557 2255','http://www.uwgl.co.uk/','','United Wholesale Grocers ltd is a family run wholesale cash and carry business selling food, drink and tobacco goods to Independent Retailers, Caterers...','cash and carry business, selling food, drink, tobacco',1,0,'busniss_img/large_30.jpg','busniss_img/orgsize_30United Springburn.jpg','-4.2270425','55.8798885'),(31,0,9,'Continental House, Islamabad','Manager','','continentalhouse@hotmail.com','Continental House','<p>\r\n	Established in 1990, being a pioneer guest house in Islamabad, and serving since last two decades, Continental House undoubtedly claims to be the best guest house in Islamabad.&nbsp;Continental has a history &amp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n','Established in 1990, being a pioneer guest house in Islamabad, and serving since last two decades, Continental House undoubtedly claims to be the best guest...','Pakistan','Islamabad','94-A Nazimuddin Road, F-8/4 Islamabad','92 51 2256670, 2256671','http://www.continentalhouse.org/','','Established in 1990, being a pioneer guest house in Islamabad, and serving since last two decades, Continental House undoubtedly claims to be the best guest...','',1,0,'busniss_img/large_31.jpg','busniss_img/orgsize_31Continental House.jpg','72.917