INSERT INTO `site_contents` VALUES (1,'Advertise','<p>\r\n	Your advertisement is your investment, so advertise where you will get the maximum benefit at amazingly cost effective rates. Advertising on the internet is the new and smart way to reach millions.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<strong>Pride of Pakistan</strong> website is targeting the millions of Pakistanis home and abroad and will provide the main source of information, communication and debate.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	This site will feature a series of profiles of well known individuals from business, finance, education, politics, media, law, accountancy, medicine and arts etc. It is expected that this will build into the most detailed and the largest database which will fully express the lives and major contribution of Pakistanis home and abroad.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan website is the most popular website and is growing continuously. Whether you own a global business or a small enterprise, we will get your message across.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	For more information, please feel free to contact us at:</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	<a href=\"mailto:marketing@prideofpakistan.com\">marketing@prideofpakistan.com</a></p>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n','','',''),(2,'Contact Us ','','','',''),(3,'About Us','<div>\r\n	(Pride of Pakistan &ndash; &quot;About the Founder&quot;)</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		Imtiaz Ahmad, founder of Pride of Pakistan, is a seasoned journalist and media professional with decades of experience dedicated to promoting the positive image of Pakistan and its people. Over the course of his career, he has interviewed several influential figures, including the late Zulfikar Ali Bhutto, former Prime Minister of Pakistan.</div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		&nbsp;</div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		Imtiaz has also had the honour of engaging with notable international personalities, including receiving an award from HRH Prince Charles (now King Charles III) and meeting former UK Prime Ministers Tony Blair and John Major at official events. These experiences have helped shape his global perspective and reinforce his commitment to building bridges between Pakistan and the wider world.</div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		&nbsp;</div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		With Pride of Pakistan, Imtiaz set out to challenge widespread misconceptions about Pakistan &mdash; particularly those related to extremism and intolerance &mdash; by showcasing the country&rsquo;s true character: one rooted in diversity, progress, resilience, and hospitality.</div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		&nbsp;</div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		Through inspiring stories and real-life achievements, Pride of Pakistan aims to foster understanding, unity, and national pride, while serving as a meaningful link between Pakistan, its global diaspora, and the international community.</div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		&nbsp;</div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		To support this mission, Imtiaz is building the Pride Team &mdash; a growing network of individuals, communities, businesses, and organizations who believe in a brighter future for Pakistan. Together, they are working to amplify voices of positivity, hope, and change.</div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		&nbsp;</div>\r\n	<div>\r\n		Join us. Share your story. Be part of a movement that redefines how the world sees Pakistan.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&quot;Let&rsquo;s change the narrative &mdash; together.&quot;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Explore, support, and become a part of the movement at <a href=\"https://www.prideofpakistan.com\">https://www.prideofpakistan.com</a></div>\r\n','','',''),(4,'Our Mission','<div>\r\n	Pride is a term, which we should cherish. Pride in the achievements of a people, their actions, and their views are something we should welcome when those activities are enhancing and benefiting the world. Pride of Pakistan seeks to highlight those individuals who have become celebrated in their respective fields and made successes of them across the globe. Having pride in such achievements is worthwhile, is a useful way of celebrating the many good, law abiding, talented and hard working individuals who have taken what it means to be a Pakistani and shown the world the best parts of what Pakistan stands for.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	We want to highlight and recognize these individuals so that others can see the diverse range of abilities and characters that have gone to represent Pakistan. We want to emphasize those who have done well, have established businesses for themselves and others, and have created wealth and developed enterprise wherever they are, equally those who have become renowned figures in their chosen field. This is not about meaningless self-promotion but about highlighting the very best that Pakistanis has given the world and showing a positive side to what we do, and what we give to the communities in which we settle.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	This website is intended to reflect these developments by highlighting the achievements of those individuals who have enhanced the life where ever they are through their work, their actions and their lives. These are the people, who are proud of what they have done and we, in highlighting what they have done, are proud of them and want to ensure their activities are recognized.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n','','',''),(5,'Pride Team','<p>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan team will be working to ensure this website is by, for and about Pakistan and its people with&nbsp;a two-fold mission:</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	1]&nbsp; At the international level, it aims to portray a realistic and constructive image by involving the concerned expatriates.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	2]&nbsp; At the domestic level it aims to encourage participation of citizens in building a strong, confident and moderate socio-political society.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	If you love Pakistan, you are welcome to work with our passionate team with a goal to depict the true image of Pakistan and to dispel the false impressions about religious extremism and anti-western sentiments in Pakistan by helping people develop a deeper understanding of Pakistan and its people. It is your site and we hope you participate and help build this into a centre of excellence reflecting the best of Pakistan.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	If you are interested please contact us at: <a href=\"mailto:info@prideofpakistan.com\">info@prideofpakistan.com</a></p>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n','','',''),(6,'Terms of Use','<p>\r\n	<strong>1. Agreement between you and Pride of Pakistan</strong></p>\r\n<div>\r\n	This is an Agreement between you and Pride of Pakistan website. Your use of the Pride of Pakistan website constitutes your acceptance of this Agreement and any information that you submit is correct.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<strong>2. Pride of Pakistan may modify this Agreement</strong></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan reserves the right to change the terms and conditions under which it offers the Pride of Pakistan website.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<strong>3. No unlawful use of the Pride of Pakistan website</strong></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	You may not use the Pride of Pakistan website in any way that breaches any code of conduct or policy applicable to the Pride of Pakistan website. You may not use the Pride of Pakistan website in any manner that could damage, disable, overburden, or impair Pride of Pakistan web Site or interfere with any other</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;party&#39;s use of the Pride of Pakistan website.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<strong>4. Materials you post or provide</strong></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Any material you post or provide for Pride of Pakistan website, you grant permission to use, copy, edit, modify, translate and reformat your submission. Pride of Pakistan will not pay you for your submission and may remove your submission at any time.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<strong>5. Copyright and trademark notices</strong></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	All contents of the Pride of Pakistan website are Copyright. The names of actual companies and products mentioned herein may be the trademarks of their respective owners.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	<strong>6. Other Acknowledgements</strong></div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan may change or delete features in any way, at any time and for any reason. Pride of Pakistan will not guarantee that it will be error free and will not be liable for any omissions, inaccuracies, deletion, negligence, computer virus, delay or interruption in the transmission to the users or under any other cause of action.</div>\r\n','','',''),(7,'Privacy Policy','<p>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan is committed to protecting your privacy and has developed this policy because we want you to feel confident about the privacy of your personal details.</p>\r\n<div>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan is a general audience web site, intended for users of all ages and this Privacy Policy applies to data collection and usage on Pride of Pakistan web site.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	General information gathered from your given data is displayed on the Pride of Pakistan web site, but personal information, such as your date of birth, home or business address, telephone number and e-mail address will not be displayed, shared or disclosed to any other party unless we have your permission to do so.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan does not sell, rent or lease its profile list to third parties, however Pride of Pakistan may, from time to time, contact you about a particular offering that may be of interest to you.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Personal information collected on this site may be stored and processed in Pakistan or any other country for hosting purposes only and you consent to any such transfer of information, and retention of data.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan will occasionally update this Privacy Policy with the passage of time and will not be obligatory to inform you about the updating in the policy.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan welcomes your comments regarding this Privacy Policy. If you believe that Pride of Pakistan has not adhered to this policy, please contact Pride of Pakistan by info@prideofpakistan.com</div>\r\n','','',''),(8,'Disclaimer','<p>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan website is for information and social entertainment purposes only. Content posted on this site may contain errors or inaccuracies, as it is based on gossip, news, rumours and personal opinions.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	We do not endorse the quality of any services, products, information or materials displayed, purchased, or obtained by you as a result of an advertisement or any other information on the Pride of Pakistan website. The Pride of Pakistan website reserves the right, without any obligation whatsoever to make improvements, to remove any listing / material or correct any error or omissions in any part of the website.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	All images, videos, news and articles that appear on this website are copyright to their respective owners. If you own the rights to any of the images, videos, news, articles or any other material and do not wish them to appear on this site, please do not hesitate to contact info@prideofpakistan.com for immediate removal.</p>\r\n<p>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan website may contain links to other websites and the owner assumes no responsibility for the content of such websites. The owner of Pride of Pakistan website is not responsible for the accuracy, copyright compliance, legality or decency of material posted in any section of this site.</p>\r\n','','',''),(9,'Sponsor','<div>\r\n	We are greatly thankful to our worthy sponsors. It is due to their support that we have been able to produce this website.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	We really wish that you use the businesses of our sponsors and encourage others to do the same.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	We would also like to invite you to sponsor this website and enjoy the perfect opportunity to show your support for Pakistan and its people and publicize the activities and services of your organization.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	For details Please contact: <a href=\"mailto:marketing@prideofpakistan.com\">marketing@prideofpakistan.com</a></div>\r\n','','',''),(10,'Awards','<div>\r\n	We notice there have recently been some negative impressions floating about Pakistan and its people. We do not believe Pakistan is the home of despair and negativity. We believe Pakistan is the home of countless individuals who have enhanced the life of others through their work, their actions but go unnoticed and unacknowledged. Pride of Pakistan aims to change that.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Pride of Pakistan Awards date and venue will be announced soon but nominations are open right now! Please forward your nominations to <a href=\"mailto:info@prideofpakistan.com\">info@prideofpakistan.com</a>.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n','','',''),(11,'Award Category text','<div>\r\n	Do you know someone to be nominated for Pride of Pakistan Awards?</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>\r\n	Nominations are welcome for the following categories:</div>\r\n','','','');
