INSERT INTO `videos` VALUES (99,'Galawati Kabab Recipe ','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Ghee Â¼ cup<br>-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) 7-8<br>-Pani (Water) 1 & Â½ Cups<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1/3 Cup or to taste<br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â½ tsp<br>-Kewra water 2-3 drops<br>-Sawaiyan (Vermicelli) 150 gms (1 packet)<br><br>Directions:<br>-In wok,add ghee and let it melt,add cardamom and fry until fragrant.<br>-Add water,sugar,yellow food color and kewra water,mix well & cook until sugar dissolves.<br>-Add vermicelli and mix well.<br>-Cover and put it on simmer for 10-12 minutes.<br>-Garnish with pistachio and almonds.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Ghee Â¼ cup<br>-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) 7-8<br>-Pani (Water) 1 & Â½ Cups<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1/3 Cup or to taste<br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â½ tsp<br>-Kewra water 2-3 drops<br>-Sawaiyan (Vermicelli) 150 gms (1 packet)<br><br>Directions:<br>-Karhai mein ghee dal ker melt karein,hari elaichi dal ker khusbhu anay tak fry ker lein.<br>-Pani,cheeni,zarda ka rang aur kewra water dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur cheeni ghul janay tak paka lein.<br>-Sawaiyan dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Dhak dein aur 10-12 minutes kliya dum per rakh dein.<br>-Pista aur badam sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'Dqi2jQVmzfY','','active','normal','2017-07-13 14:54:03','Galawati Kabab Recipe ','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Ghee Â¼ cup\r\n-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) 7-8\r\n-Pani (Water) 1 & Â½ Cups\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 1/3 Cup or to taste\r\n-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â½ tsp\r\n-Kewra water 2-3 drops\r\n-Sawaiyan (Vermicelli) 150 gms (1 packet)\r\n\r',16,'youtube',''),(100,'Kulfi Falooda Recipe','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>Prepare Kulfi:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 & Â½ litre<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup<br>-Elaichi powder (Cardamom powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Rose water 1 tbs<br>-Badam (Almonds) 50 gms (blanched,peeled and chopped)<br>-Khoa 100 gms<br>-Cream 6 tbs<br>Falooda Sev/Corn flour vermicelli:<br>-Pani (Water) 1 & Â½ Cups<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Corn flour Â½ Cup<br>-Tukh malanga (Basil leaves) 1 & Â½ tbs soaked in water<br>-Pani (Water) as required<br>Assembling:<br>-Chopped almonds <br>-Kulfi <br>-Falooda sev<br>-Rose syrup<br>-Chilled thick milk <br>-Colored jelly <br>-Falooda sev<br>-Rose syrup<br>-Tukh malanga (basil leaves)<br>-Kulfa slices<br>-Chilled thick milk <br>-Dry fruit <br><br>Directions:<br>Prepare Kulfi:<br>-In pot,add milk,sugar and cook until milk is reduced to half and keep stirring in between.<br>-Take out half of the milk and refrigerate.<br>-Add cardamom powder,rose water,almonds and khoa,mix well & cook for 5 minutes.<br>-Put the mixture in jar,add cream and mix well.<br>-Let the mixture cool and refrigerate for 2 hours.<br>-Pour the mixture in container,cover and freeze for 6-8 hours.<br>-Pour the mixure into kulfi molds and freeze for 6-8 hours.<br>Falooda Sev/Corn flour vermicelli:<br>-In saucepan,add water,sugar,corn flour and mix well.<br>-Turn on the flame and keep stirring until it becomes transparent,thick and glossy.<br>-Put the cornflour mixture in squeeze bottle/piping bag,press the hot corn flour mixture though squeeze bottle into ice chilled water such that the strands of noodles are immersed completely in the cold water.<br>-In glass,add basil leaves and soak in water for 30 minutes.<br>Assembling:<br>-On serving plate,add chopped almonds,kulfi,falooda sev,rose syrup,chilled thick milk & serve.<br>-On serving glass,add colored jelly cubes,falooda sev,drizzle rose syrup,basil seeds,kulfa slices, pistachio, chilled thick milk and garnish with dry fruit & serve.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Prepare Kulfi:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 & Â½ litre<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup<br>-Elaichi powder (Cardamom powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Rose water 1 tbs<br>-Badam (Almonds) 50 gms (blanched,peeled and chopped)<br>-Khoa 100 gms<br>-Cream 6 tbs<br>Falooda Sev/Corn flour vermicelli:<br>-Pani (Water) 1 & Â½ Cups<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Corn flour Â½ Cup<br>-Tukh malanga (Basil leaves) 1 & Â½ tbs soaked in water<br>-Pani (Water) as required<br>Assembling:<br>-Chopped almonds <br>-Kulfi <br>-Falooda sev<br>-Rose syrup<br>-Chilled thick milk <br>-Colored jelly <br>-Falooda sev<br>-Rose syrup<br>-Tukh malanga (basil leaves)<br>-Kulfa slices<br>-Chilled thick milk <br>-Dry fruit <br><br>Directions:<br>-Pot mein doodh aur cheeni dal ker paka lein yahan tak ka doodh adha reh jaye aur musalsal chamcha chalatay rahein.<br>-Adha doodh nikla ker lein aur refrigerate ker lein.<br>-Elaichi powder,rose water,badam aur khoa dal ker ache tarha mix ker lein aur 5 miutes kliya paka lein.<br>-Mixture ko jar mein dal dein,cream shamil karein aur ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Mixture ko thanda ker lein aur 2 hour kliya refrigerate ker lein.<br>-Mixture ko container mein dal dein,dhak ker 6-8 hours kliya freeze ker lein.<br>-Mixture ko kulfi molds mein pour ker dein aur 6-8 hour kliya freeze ker lein.<br>-Glass mein tukh malanga dal ker 30 minutes kliya pani mein bheego dein.<br>-Saucepan mein pani,cheeni aur corn flour dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>Falooda Sev/Corn flour vermicelli:<br>-Chulhay ko on ker lein aur musalsal chamcha chalatay rahein yahan tak ka mixture transparent,garha aur glossy ho jaye.<br>-Corn flour mixture ko squeeze bottle/piping bag mein dal dein,bottle ko press ker ka hot corn flour mixture ko thanday pani mein squeeze ker lein aur noodles strands ko thanday pani mein bheega rehnay dein.<br>-Glass mein tukh malanga dal ker 30 minutes kliya pani mein bheego dein.<br>Assembling:<br>-Serving palte mein chopped badam,kulfi,falooda sev,rose syrup aur chilled thick milk dal ker serve karein.<br>-Serving glass mein colored jelly cubes,falooda sev,rose syrup,tukh malanga,kulfa slices,pista aur chilled thick milk dal dein aur dry fruit sa garnish ker ka serve karein.</p>','',26,'B2WGiBci0pI','','active','normal','2017-07-13 14:58:45','Kulfi Falooda Recipe','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nPrepare Kulfi:\r\n-Doodh (Milk) 1 & Â½ litre\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup\r\n-Elaichi powder (Cardamom powder) Â½ tsp\r\n-Rose water 1 tbs\r\n-Badam (Almonds) 50 gms (blanched,peeled and chopped)\r\n-Khoa 100 gms\r\n-Cream 6 tbs\r\nFalood',10,'youtube',''),(101,'Rasmalai recipe with milk powder','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 litre<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup<br>-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) crushed 6-7<br>-Dry milk powder 1 Cup<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 tbs<br>-Baking powder 1 tsp<br>-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) seeds Â½ tsp<br>-Ghee 1 tbs<br>-Anda (Egg) beaten 3 tbs<br>-Badam (Almonds)<br>-Pista (Pistachio)<br><br>Directions:<br>-In pot,add milk,sugar and cardamom seeds,mix well and cook until sugar is dissolved (approx.5 minutes) and set aside.<br>-In bowl,add dry milk powder,all-purpose flour,baking powder,cardamom seeds and mix well.<br>-Add ghee and mix well.<br>-Gradually add egg and knead until dough is formed & refrigerate for 5-8 minutes.<br>-Take a mixture,make a small balls of equal sizes and press it (makes 7-8).<br>-Heat milk and add the balls one by one,cover and cook on low flame for 10 minutes.Do not stir or use any spoon.<br>-Garnish with almonds and pistachio & serve chilled.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 litre<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup<br>-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) crushed 6-7<br>-Dry milk powder 1 Cup<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 tbs<br>-Baking powder 1 tsp<br>-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) seeds Â½ tsp<br>-Ghee 1 tbs<br>-Anda (Egg) beaten 3 tbs<br>-Badam (Almonds)<br>-Pista (Pistachio<br><br>Directions:<br>-Pot mein doodh,cheeni aur hari elaichi seeds dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur cheeni ghul janay tak paka lein (approx. 5 minutes) aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Bowl mein dry milk powder,maida,baking powder aur hari elaichi seeds dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Ghee shamil karein aur mix ker lein.<br>-Thora thora ker ka anda shamil karein aur ghond ker dough tayyar ker lein & 5-8 minutes kliya refrigerate ker lein.<br>-Mixture ko lein aur ek size ki choti balls bana lein aur press ker lein (makes 7-8).<br>-Doodh garam karein aur ek ek ker ka balls shamil kertay jayein,dhak ker halki ancch per 10 minutes kliya pata lein.Stir nahi kerna hai aur na he sppon use kerna hai.<br>-Badam aur pista sa garnish karein aur thanda serve karein.</p>','',26,'Def7oXvQhw0','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:01:36','Rasmalai recipe with milk powder','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Doodh (Milk) 1 litre\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup\r\n-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) crushed 6-7\r\n-Dry milk powder 1 Cup\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 tbs\r\n-Baking powder 1 tsp\r\n-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) seeds Â½ tsp\r\n-Ghee 1 tbs\r\n-A',11,'youtube',''),(102,'RASMALAI ','<p>Ras malai or rossomalai is a dessert originating from the Indian subcontinent. The name ras malai comes from two words in Hindi: ras, meaning \"juice\", and malai, meaning \"cream\".</p>','',26,'32QUW-B-aCI','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:02:40','RASMALAI ','','Ras malai or rossomalai is a dessert originating from the Indian subcontinent. The name ras malai comes from two words in Hindi: ras, meaning \"juice\", and malai, meaning \"cream\".\r\n',10,'youtube',''),(103,'Mahallabia (Milk Pudding)','<p>Serving: 3-4 People</p><p><br>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>Mahallabia (Milk Pudding):<br>-Doodh (Milk) Â½ litre<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 3 tbs<br>-Corn flour 3 tbs<br>-Rose water Â½ tbs<br>Roof Afza Cream:<br>-Cream 3-4 tbs<br>-Rooh afza 3-4 tbs<br>Topping:<br>-Pani (Water) Â¼ Cup<br>-Corn flour 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Rooh afza 2 tbs<br>-Piping bag <br>Assembling:<br>-Dry fruits chopped<br>-Pink milk pudding<br>-Topping<br>-Dry fruits chopped<br>-Rooh afza cream<br>-Milk pudding<br>-Topping<br><br>Directions:<br>For Milk Pudding:<br>-In saucepan,add milk,sugar,corn flour and mix well.<br>-Turn on the flame,add rose water and mix continuously.<br>-Cook on low flame until milk is thickens & set aside.<br>For Rooh Afza Cream:<br>-In cream,add rooh afza,mix well and set aside.<br>For Topping:<br>-In water,corn flour,rooh afza and mix well.<br>-In small frying pan,add mixture and cook on low flame until thick paste is formed and stir continuously.<br>-In piping bag,add topping mixture and set aside.<br>-In bowl,pour half milk pudding,add 2 tbs rooh afza cream or to taste and mix well.<br>Assembling:<br>-In serving glass,add dry fruits,pour pink thickened milk pudding,garnish with topping and dry fruits & refrigerate for 2 hours.<br>-In serving glass,add dry fruits,pour reserved rooh afza cream & milk pudding,garnish with topping and sprinkle dry fruits & refrigerate for 2 hours.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Mahallabia (Milk Pudding):<br>-Doodh (Milk) Â½ litre<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 3 tbs<br>-Corn flour 3 tbs<br>-Rose water Â½ tbs<br>Roof Afza Cream:<br>-Cream 3-4 tbs<br>-Rooh afza 3-4 tbs<br>Topping:<br>-Pani (Water) Â¼ Cup<br>-Corn flour 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Rooh afza 2 tbs<br>-Piping bag <br>Assembling:<br>-Dry fruits chopped<br>-Pink milk pudding<br>-Topping<br>-Dry fruits chopped<br>-Rooh afza cream<br>-Milk pudding<br>-Topping<br><br>Directions:<br>For Milk Pudding:<br>-Saucepan mein doodh,cheeni aur corn flour dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Chulhay ko on karein aur rose water dal dein aur musalsal chamcha chalatay rahein.<br>-Halki ancch per doodh garha hunay tak paka lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>ker lein.<br>For Rooh Afza Cream:<br>-Cream mein rooh afza dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur side per rakh dein.<br>For Topping:<br>-Pani mein corn flour aur rooh afza dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Chotay frying pan mein mixture dal dein aur garha paste bannay tak halki ancch per paka lein aur musalsal chamcha chalatay rahien.<br>-Topping mixture ko piping bag mein dal dein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Bowl mein milk pudding half dal dein, 2 tbs rooh afza cream or to taste dal ker ache tarhan mix<br>Assembling:<br>-Serving dish mein dry fruits aur pink thickened milk pudding dal dein,topping aur dry fruits sa garnish karein aur 2 hours refrigerate ker lein.<br>-Serving dish mein dry fruits dal dein,reserved rooh afza cream & milk pudding,topping sa garnish karein aur dry fruits sprinkle karein aur 2 hours refrigerate ker lein.</p>','',26,'JOxEesXQRBk','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:04:16','Mahallabia (Milk Pudding)','','Serving: 3-4 People\r\n\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nMahallabia (Milk Pudding):\r\n-Doodh (Milk) Â½ litre\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 3 tbs\r\n-Corn flour 3 tbs\r\n-Rose water Â½ tbs\r\nRoof Afza Cream:\r\n-Cream 3-4 tbs\r\n-Rooh afza 3-4 tbs\r\nTopping:\r\n-Pani (Water) Â¼ C',11,'youtube',''),(104,'Lab e Shireen Recipe','<p>Lab-e-Shireen Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients: <br>-Pani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Banana jelly 1 packet <br>-Pani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Strawberry jelly 1 packet <br>-Olperâ€™s cream 1 Cup<br>-Mixed fruit cocktail 1 Cup or as desired (strained)<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 liter<br>-Sawaiyan (Vermicelli) colored Â½ Cup<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup or to taste<br>-Vanilla custard powder 3-4 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) Â¼ Cup<br>-Dry fruits chopped as required<br><br>Directions:<br>-In saucepan,add water and bring it to boil,add banana jelly and cook until dissolved,pour in a dish and refrigerate until set then cut in desired shape.<br>-In saucepan,add water and bring it to boil,add strawberry jelly and cook until dissolved,pour in a dish and refrigerate until set then cut in desired shape.<br>-In bowl,add Olperâ€™s cream,mixed fruit cockatil,mix well and set aside.<br>-In pot,add milk and heat it,add vermicelli colored and mix well.<br>-Add sugar and cook until sugar dissolves.<br>-In bowl,add vanilla custard powder and water,mix well.<br>-Gradually add dissolve vanilla custard,stir continuously and cook until milk is thickened.<br>-Put off from flame and let it cool,add cream & fruits and mix well.<br>-In serving dish,add jelly cubes and lab-e-shireen.<br>-Garnish with strawberry jelly,banana jelly,dry fruits and serve.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Pani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Banana jelly 1 packet <br>-Pani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Strawberry jelly 1 packet <br>-Olperâ€™s cream 1 Cup<br>-Mixed fruit cocktail 1 Cup or as desired (strained)<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 liter<br>-Sawaiyan (Vermicelli) colored Â½ Cup<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup or to taste<br>-Vanilla custard powder 3-4 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) Â¼ Cup<br>-Dry fruits chopped as required<br>Directions:<br>-Saucepan mein pani dal ker ubal lein,banana jelly dal dein aur dissolve hunay tak paka lein,dish mein nikal lein aur set hunay tak refrigerate ker lein phir desired shape mein cut ker lein.<br>-Saucepan mein pani dal ker ubal lein,strawberry jelly dal dein aur dissolve hunay tak paka lein,dish mein nikla lein aur set hunay tak refrigerate ker lein phir desired shape mein cut ker lein.<br>-Bowl mein Olperâ€™s cream aur mixed fruit cocktail dal ker mix ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Pot mein doodh dal ker garam karein,sawaiyan colored dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Cheeni shamil karein aur cheeni ghul janay tak paka lein.<br>-Bowl mein vanilla custard powder aur pani dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Thora thora ker ka dissolve vanilla custard daltey jayein aur musalsal chamcha chalatay rahein aur doodh garha hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Chulhay sa hata lein aut thanda ker lein,cream & fruits dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Serving dish mein jelly cubes aur lab-e-shireen dal dein.<br>-Strawberry jelly,banana jelly aur dry fruits sa garnish ker ka serve karein.</p>','',26,'8joMg3S7-W0','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:06:36','Lab e Shireen Recipe','','Lab-e-Shireen Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients: \r\n-Pani (Water) 1 Cup\r\n-Banana jelly 1 packet \r\n-Pani (Water) 1 Cup\r\n-Strawberry jelly 1 packet \r\n-Olperâ€™s cream 1 Cup\r\n-Mixed fruit cocktail 1 Cup or as desired (strained)\r\n-Doodh (Milk) 1 liter\r\n-Sawaiy',14,'youtube',''),(110,'Shahi Tukray Recipe','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>â€¢ Milk 1 liter<br>â€¢ Sugar 3-4 tbs or to taste<br>â€¢ Green cardamom powder Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Saffron strands 1-2 pinch<br>â€¢ Cream Â¾ cup<br>â€¢ Water Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Sugar Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Green cardamom powder Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Rosewater Â¼ tsp<br>â€¢ Oil <br>â€¢ Bread slices 6-8<br>â€¢ Desiccated coconut for garnishing<br>â€¢ Almonds chopped 2-3 tbs (for garnishing)<br>â€¢ Pistachio chopped 2-3 tbs (for garnishing)<br>Directions:<br>Thickened milk (Rabri):<br>â€¢ In a saucepan, add milk and sugar, mix it.<br>â€¢ Add green cardamom powder, mix well.<br>â€¢ Now add saffron, cook on low flame until milk thickens (20-30 minutes) and keep stirring in between until milk is reduced to desire thickness.<br>â€¢ Add cream and give it a good mix.<br>â€¢ Remove from heat and set aside.<br>Sugar syrup:<br>â€¢ In a sauce pan, add water and sugar, cook until it comes to a one string consistency.<br>â€¢ Add cardamom powder and stir, cook until sugar syrup is thickened.<br>â€¢ Add rosewater, mix it and cook for 1-2 minutes, remove from flame and set aside.<br>Bread:<br>â€¢ Trim the brown sides of the bread, cut to triangles or any shape of your choice.<br>â€¢ Heat oil in a deep fry pan and fry the bread slices in the hot oil until light brown, drain on a plate lined with paper towels. <br>â€¢ If you donâ€™t want to fry, just toast them until crispy.<br>Assembling:<br>â€¢ Now dip the bread slice in the sugar syrup for 10-15 seconds.<br>â€¢ Arrange the sugar syrup coated bread pieces in a dish, pour the thickened milk (rabri) on the sugar coated bread slices.<br>â€¢ Garnish with desiccated coconut, almonds and pistachios.<br>â€¢ Serve and enjoy.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br>Ingredients:<br>â€¢ Doodh 1 liter <br>â€¢ Cheeni 3-4 tbs or hasb e zaroorat <br>â€¢ Elaichi powder Â½ tsp <br>â€¢ Zafran 1-2 pinch <br>â€¢ Cream Â¾ cup<br>â€¢ Pani Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Sugar Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Elaichi powder Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Rosewater Â¼ tsp<br>â€¢ Oil for frying<br>â€¢ Bread slices 6-8<br>â€¢ Khopra (for garnishing)<br>â€¢ Badaam chopped 2-3 tbs (for garnishing)<br>â€¢ Pistey chopped 2-3 tbs (for garnishing)<br>Directions:<br>For Rabri:<br>â€¢ Sauce pan mein doodh aur cheeni shamil ker k mix karein.<br>â€¢ Elaichi powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>â€¢ Ab is mein zafran dal dein aur doodh ko halki ancch per garhan hunay tak 20-30 minutes kliya paka lein, chamcha chatay rahein.<br>â€¢ Cream shamil karein aur ache tarhan mix kerlein, side per rakh dein.<br>For Sheera:<br>â€¢ Sauce pan mein pani aur cheeni dal ker itna paka lein k cheeni ghul jaye.<br>â€¢ Ab is mein elaichi powder dal ker mix karein, sheera ko itna paka lein k garha ho jaye.<br>â€¢ Rosewater dal ker mix lein aur 1-2minute kliya paka lein, side per rakh dein.<br>Bread:<br>â€¢ Bread slices ko trim karain aur triangles shapes mein kat lein.<br>â€¢ Fry pan mein tel garam ker lein aur bread slice ko halka sunhairi hunay tak fry karein.<br>â€¢ Fry na karna chahen tu bread slices of toast karlain.<br><br>Assembling:<br>â€¢ Bread slices ko sheera mein 10-15 seconds kliya dip kerlain.<br>â€¢ Ab tamam bread slices ko dish mein rakh ker upper sa rabri doodh dal dein.<br>â€¢ Kopray,badaam aur pistey sa garnish ker k serve karein.</p>','',26,'S0N5GoRTs1U','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:13:57','Shahi Tukray Recipe','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nâ€¢ Milk 1 liter\r\nâ€¢ Sugar 3-4 tbs or to taste\r\nâ€¢ Green cardamom powder Â½ tsp\r\nâ€¢ Saffron strands 1-2 pinch\r\nâ€¢ Cream Â¾ cup\r\nâ€¢ Water Â½ cup\r\nâ€¢ Sugar Â½ cup\r\nâ€¢ Green cardamom powder Â½ tsp\r\nâ€¢ Rosewater Â¼ ',12,'youtube',''),(111,'Caramel Shahi Tukray Recipe','<p>Caramel Shahi Tukray Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>Prepare Caramel Sauce:<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 cup<br>-Pani (Water) 1/3 cup<br>-Olperâ€™s cream Â¾ cup<br>-Makhan (Butter) 3 tbs<br>-Vanilla essence Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 pinch<br>-Doodh (Milk) 2 if required<br>Prepare Milk:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 & Â½ cups<br>-Condensed milk Â½ cup<br>-Olperâ€™s cream 1 cup<br>-Elaichi powder (Cardamom powder) Â½ tsp<br>Prepare Bread:<br>-Bread 6-8 slices<br>-Oil for frying<br>Assembling:<br>-Prepared milk <br>-Bread<br>-Milk <br>-Caramel sauce <br>-Chopped nuts as required <br><br>Directions:<br>For Caramel Sauce:<br>-In saucepan,add sugar and water and bring it to boil and keep stirring.<br>-When it comes to boil,lower the flame,let it simmer until its color changes to golden brown.<br>-Take off from the heat,add Olperâ€™s cream and whisk well until combined.<br>-Now add butter,vanilla essence and salt,mix well.<br>-Add milk if sauce is too thick and mix well.Caramel sauce is ready & let it cool.<br>-Can be stored up to 2 weeks in refrigerator.<br>For Milk:<br>-In sauce pan,add milk,condensed milk and mix well.<br>-Add cardamom powder and mix.<br>-Turn off the flame,add Olperâ€™s cream,whisk well and let it cool & set side.<br>For Bread:<br>-Cut bread slices in desired shape.<br>-In frying pan,add oil and fry bread slices until golden and set aside.<br>Assembling:<br>-In serving dish,pour prepared milk,set fried bread slices and pour prepared milk again.<br>-Add caramel sauce and garnish with nuts.<br>-Caramel shahi tukray is ready to serve.<br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Prepare Caramel Sauce:<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 cup<br>-Pani (Water) 1/3 cup<br>-Olperâ€™s cream Â¾ cup<br>-Makhan (Butter) 3 tbs<br>-Vanilla essence Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 pinch<br>-Doodh (Milk) 2 if required<br>Prepare Milk:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 & Â½ cups<br>-Condensed milk Â½ cup<br>-Olperâ€™s cream 1 cup<br>-Elaichi powder (Cardamom powder) Â½ tsp<br>Prepare Bread:<br>-Bread 6-8 slices<br>-Oil for frying<br>Assembling:<br>-Prepared milk <br>-Bread<br>-Milk <br>-Caramel sauce <br>-Chopped nuts as required <br><br>Directions:<br>For Caramel sauce:<br>-Sauce pan mein cheeni aur pani dal dein,ubal anay dein aur chamcha chalatay rahein.<br>-Jab ubal ajaye to halki ancch per paka lein yahan tak ka color golden brown hojaye.<br>-Chulha bund ker lein,Olperâ€™s cream dal ker ache tarhan whisk ker lein.<br>-Ab is mein makhan,vanilla essence aur namak dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Agar sauce garha ho tou doodh dal ker mix ker lein.Caramel sauce tayyar hai & thanda ker lein.<br>-2 weeks tak refrigerator mein store ker saktay han.<br>For Milk:<br>-Sauce pan mein doodh aur condensed milk dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Elaichi powder dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Chulha bund ker k Olperâ€™s cream shamil karein aur ache tarhan whisk ker lein aur thanda ker lein & side per rakh dein.<br>For Bread:<br>-Bread slices ko desired shape mein cut ker lein.<br>-Frying pan mein oil dal ker bread slice ko golden fry ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>Assembling:<br>-Serving dish mein prepared milk dal ker fried bread slices rakh dein aur dubara prepared milk dal dein.<br>-Caramel sauce dal ker nuts sa garnish karein.<br>-Caramel shahi tukray serve kerna kliya tayyar han.</p>','',26,'7J8zoonbGm8','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:16:50','Caramel Shahi Tukray Recipe','','Caramel Shahi Tukray Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nPrepare Caramel Sauce:\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 cup\r\n-Pani (Water) 1/3 cup\r\n-Olperâ€™s cream Â¾ cup\r\n-Makhan (Butter) 3 tbs\r\n-Vanilla essence Â½ tsp\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 pinch\r\n-Doodh (Milk) 2 if required\r\nPr',10,'youtube',''),(112,'Sawaiyon ka Zarda ','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Ghee Â¼ cup<br>-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) 7-8<br>-Pani (Water) 1 & Â½ Cups<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1/3 Cup or to taste<br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â½ tsp<br>-Kewra water 2-3 drops<br>-Sawaiyan (Vermicelli) 150 gms (1 packet)<br><br>Directions:<br>-In wok,add ghee and let it melt,add cardamom and fry until fragrant.<br>-Add water,sugar,yellow food color and kewra water,mix well & cook until sugar dissolves.<br>-Add vermicelli and mix well.<br>-Cover and put it on simmer for 10-12 minutes.<br>-Garnish with pistachio and almonds.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Ghee Â¼ cup<br>-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) 7-8<br>-Pani (Water) 1 & Â½ Cups<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1/3 Cup or to taste<br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â½ tsp<br>-Kewra water 2-3 drops<br>-Sawaiyan (Vermicelli) 150 gms (1 packet)<br><br>Directions:<br>-Karhai mein ghee dal ker melt karein,hari elaichi dal ker khusbhu anay tak fry ker lein.<br>-Pani,cheeni,zarda ka rang aur kewra water dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur cheeni ghul janay tak paka lein.<br>-Sawaiyan dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Dhak dein aur 10-12 minutes kliya dum per rakh dein.</p>','',26,'yWzTwfhA2Vc','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:19:27','Sawaiyon ka Zarda ','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Ghee Â¼ cup\r\n-Hari elaichi (Cardamom) 7-8\r\n-Pani (Water) 1 & Â½ Cups\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 1/3 Cup or to taste\r\n-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â½ tsp\r\n-Kewra water 2-3 drops\r\n-Sawaiyan (Vermicelli) 150 gms (1 packet)\r\n\r',11,'youtube',''),(113,'Chicken Cheese Seekh Kabab','<p>Recipe in English:&nbsp;</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Chicken (cubes) Â½ kg<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Pyaz (Onion) fried 2-3 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Dhania (Coriander seeds) roasted & crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Lal mirch (Red chili) crushed Â½ tbs<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) roasted & crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Chanay ka powder (Chickpeas powder) roasted 1-2 tbs<br>-Hara dhania (Coriander) Chopped 2 tbs<br>-Cheddar cheese grated 4 tbs<br>-Oil 2 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>-In chopper,add chicken,ginger garlic paste,fried onion,salt,coriander seeds,red chili crushed,whole spice powder,cumin seeds,turmeric powder,chickpeas powder,coriander and chop until well combined.<br>-Add cheddar cheese,mix well and refrigerate for 30 minutes.<br>-Grease your hands with oil,take a mixture and make kebabs on metal skewers.<br>-In frying pan,add oil and fry on low flame until well cooked.<br>-To store: half cook seekh kebabs & freeze (up to 1 month).<br>-Chicken cheese seekh kebab is ready,serve with chutney or ketchup.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Chicken (cubes) Â½ kg<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Pyaz (Onion) fried 2-3 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Dhania (Coriander seeds) roasted & crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Lal mirch (Red chili) crushed Â½ tbs<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) roasted & crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Chanay ka powder (Chickpeas powder) roasted 1-2 tbs<br>-Hara dhania (Coriander) Chopped 2 tbs<br>-Cheddar cheese grated 4 tbs<br>-Oil 2 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>-Chopper mein chicken,adrak lehsan paste,fried pyaz,namak,dhania,lal mirch crushed,garam masala powder,zeera,haldee powder,chanay ka powder aur hara dhania dal ker ache tarhan chop ker lein.<br>-Cheddar cheese dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur 30 minutes kliya refrigerate ker lein.<br>-Haathon ko oil sa grease karein,metal skewers per mixture ka kebabs bana lein.<br>-Frying pan mein oil dal dein aur halki ancch per pak janay tak fry ker lein.<br>-To store: seekh kebabs ko half cook ker ka freeze ker lein (up to 1 month).<br>-Chicken cheese seekh kebab tayyar han,chutney or ketchup ka saath serve karein.</p>','',26,'6s2T3LlpsUc','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:20:33','Chicken Cheese Seekh Kabab','','Recipe in English: \r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Chicken (cubes) Â½ kg\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) fried 2-3 tbs\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste\r\n-Dhania (Coriander seeds) roasted & crushed Â½ tsp\r\n-Lal mirch (Red chili) crushed ',9,'youtube',''),(114,'Chicken Haleem','<p>Chicken Haleem Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Water 2-3 liters <br>-Jau (Barley) Â¾ cup soaked overnight<br>-Gandum /Gehu (Wheat) 1 & Â¼ cup soaked overnight<br>-Baking soda Â½ tsp<br>-Oil 2-3 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tsp<br>-Boneless chicken Â½ kg<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tbs or to taste<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) Â½ tbs<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) 1 tsp<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) Chopped 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 & Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) 1 cup<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Fried 3 tbs<br>-Chicken cubes 2<br>-Namak (Salt) If required<br>-Pani (Water) Boiled (optional)<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) 1 tsp<br>-Jaifil & javitri powder (Nutmeg & mace powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Chat masala as required<br>-Oil <br>-Pyaz (Onion) Sliced 1<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Fried<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili)<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander)<br>-Adrak (Ginger) julienne <br>-Chaat masala 1 tsp or as required<br>-Leemo (Lemon)<br><br>Direction:<br>-In pot,add water,barley,wheat and bring it to boil,let it simmer for 30 minutes.<br>-Add baking soda,cover and cook till tender (approximately: 1 & Â½ hour).<br>-In wok,add oil,ginger garlic paste,boneless chicken,fry until it changes color.<br>-Add red chili powder,coriander powder,turmeric powder,green chili,salt,yogurt and cook until chicken is done.<br>-Add fried onion,mix well,shred cooked chicken and set aside.<br>-Blend barley and wheat mixture until smooth,add cooked chicken and chicken cubes,mix until well combined.<br>-Add salt and boiled water if haleem is too thick (optional) and blend again.<br>-Add whole spice powder,nutmeg & mace powder and chaat masala.<br>-In frying pan,add oil and onion,fry until golden brown,add fried onion in haleem mixture and mix well.<br>-For garnishing,add fried onion,green chili,green coriander,ginger,chaat masala and lemon juice.<br><br><br>Chicken Haleem Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Water 2-3 liters <br>-Jau (Barley) Â¾ cup soaked overnight<br>-Gandum /Gehu (Wheat) 1 & Â¼ cup soaked overnight<br>-Baking soda Â½ tsp<br>-Oil 2-3 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tsp<br>-Boneless chicken Â½ kg<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tbs or to taste<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) Â½ tbs<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) 1 tsp<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) Chopped 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 & Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) 1 cup<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Fried 3 tbs<br>-Chicken cubes 2<br>-Namak (Salt) If required<br>-Pani (Water) Boiled (optional)<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) 1 tsp<br>-Jaifil & javitri powder (Nutmeg & mace powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Chat masala as required<br>-Oil <br>-Pyaz (Onion) Sliced 1<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Fried<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili)<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander)<br>-Adrak (ginger) Julienne <br>-Chaat masala 1 tsp or as required<br>-Leemo (Lemon)<br><br>Directions:<br>-Pot mein pani,jau,gandum/gehu dal ker ubal anay dein,halki ancch per 30 minute kliya paka lein.<br>-Baking soda dal dein aur dhak ker paka lein (approximately: 1 & Â½ hour).<br>-Karhai mein oil,adrak lehsan paste,bonless chicken dal ker rang tabdeel hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Lal mirch powder,dhania powder,haldee powder,hari mirch,namak aur dahi dal ker chicken pak janay tak paka lein.<br>-Fried pyaz dal ker ache tarhan mix kerlein,chicken ko resha ker ka side per rakh dein.<br>-Jau aur gandum ka mixture ko smooth blend ker lein, cooked chicken aur chicken cubes dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Namak aur boiled pani (optional) dal ker dubara sa blend ker lein.<br>-Garam masala powder,jaifil & javitri powder aur chaat masala shamil karein.<br>-Frying pan mein oil aur pyaz dal ker golden brown hunay tak fry ker lein,fried pyaz ko haleem mixture mein dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Fried pyaz,hari mirch,hara dhania,adrak,chaat masala aur lemon juice sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'8NnEogb5IuI','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:21:45','Chicken Haleem','','Chicken Haleem Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Water 2-3 liters \r\n-Jau (Barley) Â¾ cup soaked overnight\r\n-Gandum /Gehu (Wheat) 1 & Â¼ cup soaked overnight\r\n-Baking soda Â½ tsp\r\n-Oil 2-3 tbs\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tsp\r\n-Boneless ',10,'youtube',''),(115,'Raita 5 ways','<p>Boondi raita, Onion tomato raita, zeera raita, bangan ka raita, aloo ka raita.</p>','',26,'4gcC5Bo98lg','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:22:52','Raita 5 ways','','Boondi raita, Onion tomato raita, zeera raita, bangan ka raita, aloo ka raita.\r\n',10,'youtube',''),(117,'Top 4 Biryani Recipes ','<p>Top 4 Biryani Recipes&nbsp;</p>','',26,'VTsvX6oUpq8','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:27:12','Top 4 Biryani Recipes ','','Top 4 Biryani Recipes ',10,'youtube',''),(118,'Smokey Chicken Biryani','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Chicken (Biryani cut) 12 pieces<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ kg<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tbs<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 tbs<br>-Zeera (Cumin) roasted & crushed Â½ tbs<br>-Garam masala 1 tsp<br>-Jaifil powder (Nutmeg powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Javitri powder (Mace powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tbs or to taste<br>-Lemon juice 4 tbs<br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â¼ tsp<br>-Oil 1 Cup<br>-Pyaz (Onion) sliced Â½ kg<br>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) sliced 2-3 medium<br>-Aloo bukhara (Dried plums) 6-8<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) slit 5-6<br>-Koyla (Coal) for smoke <br>-Podina (Mint leaves) 1 bunch<br>-Chawal (Rice) Basmati sella 1 kg (soaked 30 minutes) (Parboiled with lemon juice,salt,whole spices)<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 2 tbs<br>-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 2 <br>-Tez paat (Bay leaf) 2<br>-Laung (Cloves) 2-3<br>-Pyaz (Onion) fried <br>-Adrak (Ginger) julienne <br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â½ tsp dissolve in 2-3 tbs water<br><br>Directions:<br>-Boil rice with lemon juice,salt,cinnamon sticks,bay leaf and cloves,boil until Â¾ th done,strain and set aside.<br>-In bowl,add chicken pieces,yogurt,ginger garlic paste,red chili powder,coriander powder,cumin,garam masala,nutmeg powder,mace powder,salt,lemon juice,yellow food color,mix well and marinate for 2 hours.<br>-In pot,add oil,onion and fry until brown,take out half of the fried onions and set aside.<br>-Add tomatoes and mix well.<br>-Add dried plums,green chilies and mix well.<br>-Now add marinated chicken,turn off the heat and give a coal smoke for 3 minutes then remove coal.<br>-Turn on heat,mix well and cover & cook on low flame until chicken is done (8-10 minutes).<br>-Add mint leaves,mix well and cook on high flame until oil separates.<br>-Add boiled rice half,fried onion,remaining boiled rice,fried onion,food color dissolve in water and ginger,cover and steam cook on low flame for 10-15 minutes.<br>-Smokey chicken biryani is ready,serve with raita.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Chicken (Biryani cut) 12 pieces<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ kg<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tbs<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 tbs<br>-Zeera (Cumin) roasted & crushed Â½ tbs<br>-Garam masala 1 tsp<br>-Jaifil powder (Nutmeg powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Javitri powder (Mace powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tbs or to taste<br>-Lemon juice 4 tbs<br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â¼ tsp<br>-Oil 1 Cup<br>-Pyaz (Onion) sliced Â½ kg<br>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) sliced 2-3 medium<br>-Aloo bukhara (Dried plums) 6-8<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) slit 5-6<br>-Koyla (Coal) for smoke <br>-Podina (Mint leaves) 1 bunch<br>-Chawal (Rice) Basmati sella 1 kg (soaked 30 minutes) (Parboiled with lemon juice,salt,whole spices)<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 2 tbs<br>-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 2 <br>-Tez paat (Bay leaf) 2<br>-Laung (Cloves) 2-3<br>-Pyaz (Onion) fried <br>-Adrak (Ginger) julienne <br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â½ tsp dissolve in 2-3 water<br><br>Directions:<br>-Chawal ko lemon juice,namak,darchini,tez paat aur laung ka saath Â¾ th boil ker lein aur strain ker ka side per rakh dein.<br>-Bowl mein chicken pieces,dahi,adrak lehsan paste,lal mirch powder,dhania powder,zeera,garam masala,jaifil powder,javatri powder,namak,lemon juice aur zarda ka rang dal ker ache tarhan mix ke lein aur 2 hours kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Pot mein oil aur pyaz dal ker brown fry ker lein,adhe fried pyaz bahir nikal lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Tamatar dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Aloo bukhara aur hari mirch dal ker mix karein.<br>-Ab is mein marinated chicken dal dein,chulha bund ker dein aur 3 minutes kliya koyla ka dhuwan dein aur phir koyla ko hata lein.<br>-Chulha on karein aur ache tarhan mix karein,dhak dein aur halki ancch per chicken gul janay tak paka lein (8-10 minutes).<br>-Podina dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur tez ancch per oil alag hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Chawal boiled adhay dal dein,fried pyaz,baqi bachay hoye chawal,fried pyaz,zarda ka rang pani mein dissolve ker ka dal dein,adrak dal ker dhak dein aur 10-15 minutes kliya steam cook ker lein.<br>-Smokey chicken biryani tayyar hai,raita ka saath serve karein.</p>','',26,'_NmDq_ZbrC0','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:28:29','Smokey Chicken Biryani','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Chicken (Biryani cut) 12 pieces\r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ kg\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tbs\r\n-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 & Â½ tbs\r\n-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 tbs\r\n-Zeera (Cumin) roasted &',9,'youtube',''),(119,'Gulab Jamun quick  easy','<p>Gulab Jamun Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>â€¢ Lassa khoya 250 grams<br>â€¢ Baking soda 1 pinch<br>â€¢ Salt 1 pinch<br>â€¢ Flour 1/3 cup<br>â€¢ Egg Â½ <br>Syrup: <br>â€¢ Water 2 cups <br>â€¢ Sugar 1 & Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Kewra water 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Cardamom powder 1/2 tsp<br>â€¢ Lemon juice 1 tsp<br><br>Directions:<br>To make syrup, in a pan add water and sugar and cook until it becomes a sticky syrup. Now turn off the flame and add kewra water, cardamom powder, lemon juice and mix well.<br>In a bowl take lassa khoya and crumble it well with your hands. Add flour, baking soda, salt, and egg and mix well to a smooth dough. It needs kneading for at least 6-8 minutes.<br>Now make small balls of same size. Make sure they are smooth and have no cracks. <br>Heat ghee, and add balls and fry gently and stir continuously. Make sure ghee is not very hot otherwise gulab jamun will not cook well from inside or will burn. <br>When gulab jamuns becomes golden, add them directly to hot syrup. Make sure syrup is hot (not burning hot). <br>Repeat frying process. Add all gulab jamuns in syrup and leave them for 60 minutes<br>Garnish with pistachios and serve ïŠ<br><br>Gulab Jamun Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>â€¢ lassa khoya 250 grams<br>â€¢ Baking soda 1 pinch<br>â€¢ namak 1 pinch<br>â€¢ Maida 1/3 cup<br>â€¢ Anda Â½ adha<br>Syrup: <br>â€¢ Paani 2 cups <br>â€¢ Cheeni 1 & Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Kewra arq 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Elaichi powder 1/2 tsp<br>â€¢ lemon juice 1 tsp<br><br>Banane ka tareeka:<br>Ek pan main pani len aur cheeni shamil kar ke pakayen. Jab tak ke garha sheera banjaye. Ab choolhay se utaar len aur kewra arq, elaichi powder and lemon juice shamil kar ke achi tarah mix karlen.<br>Ek bowl main lassa khoya lekar achi tarah hathon se choora choora kar len. Maida, baking soda , namak, aur anda shamil karke mix Karen. 6-8 minutes tak goondhen taake acha sa paira banjaye. Ab is main se ek hi size ki choti choti golian banalen. Dhiyan rahe ke golian smooth hon aur cracks na hon.<br>Ab ghee garam kar lain aur ek ek karke golian daalen aur medium aanch par fry Karen. Aanch tez na ho warna gulab jamun jal jayenge ya ander se kache reh jayenge. Jese hi gulab jamun golden hojayen garam sheere main shamil karte jaye. Sheera garam hona chahiye. Ek ghante keliye sheere main hi rehne den aur phir garnish karke serve karen.</p>','',26,'5MUQ840KTHY','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:29:45','Gulab Jamun quick, easy','','Gulab Jamun Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nâ€¢ Lassa khoya 250 grams\r\nâ€¢ Baking soda 1 pinch\r\nâ€¢ Salt 1 pinch\r\nâ€¢ Flour 1/3 cup\r\nâ€¢ Egg Â½ \r\nSyrup: \r\nâ€¢ Water 2 cups \r\nâ€¢ Sugar 1 & Â½ cup\r\nâ€¢ Kewra water 1 tsp\r\nâ€¢ Cardamom powder 1/2 tsp\r\nâ€¢',11,'youtube',''),(122,'Mirchon / Mirchi Ka Salan - Chili Curry Recipe','<p>Mircho ka salan Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>â€¢ Khopra (desiccated coconut) 1 cup<br>â€¢ Safed til (sesame seeds) 1 cup<br>â€¢ Sabit dhania (coriander seeds) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Sabit zeera (cumin seeds) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Methi danna (fenugreek seeds) Â¼ tsp<br>â€¢ Kalonji (nigella seeds) Â¼ tsp <br>â€¢ Pyaz (onion) medium size 2 <br>â€¢ Mong phalli (roasted peanuts) Â¾ cup<br>â€¢ Pani (water) 2 & Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Oil 2 tsp<br>â€¢ Hari mirch (green chilies) slit vertically 15 - 20 <br>â€¢ Oil Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Sabit zeera (cumin seeds) 2 tsp <br>â€¢ Rai dana (mustard seeds) 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Adrak lehsan paste (ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Haldee (turmeric) 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Namak (salt) 2 tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Dahi (yogurt) beaten 2 cups<br>â€¢ Pani (water) Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Kari pata (curry leaves) 8-10 <br>â€¢ Lemon juice 1 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>- Dry roast desiccated coconut and sesame seeds in a pan until fragrant and set aside.<br>- Dry roast coriander seeds, cumin seeds, fenugreek seeds and nigella seeds in the same pan for 1 min and set aside.<br>- Dry roast onion in the pan until it changes color to brown and set aside <br>- Now add all roasted ingredients in a bowl, add roasted peanuts and mix. Add in a blender, add water and blend until all ingredients are well combined to form a thick paste. Set Aside <br>- In same pan add 2 tsp of oil and sautÃ© slit green chilies for 2-3 mins on medium flame. Set aside.<br>- Add Â½ cup oil in the pan and add cumin seeds and mustard seeds, fry until fragrant, add ginger garlic paste and sautÃ©. Add prepared mixture of all roasted ingredients. Add turmeric, salt and mix well. Add yogurt and bring it to boil and then cover and cook on low medium flame for 15 minutes or until oil separates. <br>- Add sautÃ©ed green chilies, Â½ cup water and curry leaves ad let it cook for another 8 mins. Add lemon. Let it simmer for 2 mins. <br>- Delicious Chili curry is ready to serve.<br><br>Mirchon ka Salan Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>â€¢ Khopra (desiccated coconut) 1 cup<br>â€¢ Safed til (sesame seeds) 1 cup<br>â€¢ Sabit dhania (coriander seeds) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Sabit zeera (cumin seeds) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Methi danna (fenugreek seeds) Â¼ tsp<br>â€¢ Kalonji (nigella seeds) Â¼ tsp <br>â€¢ Pyaz (onion) medium size 2 <br>â€¢ Mong phalli (roasted peanuts) Â¾ cup<br>â€¢ Pani (water) 2 & Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Oil 2 tsp<br>â€¢ Hari mirch (green chilies) slit vertically 15 - 20 <br>â€¢ Oil Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Sabit zeera (cumin seeds) 2 tsp <br>â€¢ Rai dana (mustard seeds) 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Adrak lehsan paste (ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Haldee (turmeric) 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Namak (salt) 2 tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Dahi (yogurt) beaten 2 cups<br>â€¢ Pani (water) Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Kari pata (curry leaves) 8-10 <br>â€¢ Lemon juice 1 tbs<br><br>Banane ka Tareeka:<br>- Khopra aur til to fry pan may khushbo anay tak bhoon lain. Bowl main nikal lain. <br>- Ussi pan main sabit zeera, Sabit dhania, methi Dana, Sabit kalonji ko bhoon lain. Ek bowl main nikal lain.<br>- Pan main pyaz ko brown hone tak bhoon lain. Ek bowl main nikal lain.<br>- Ab saare bhune hue ajza ko blender main mongphali aur pani shamil karke blend karke paste bana ke rakh dain.<br>- Ek karhai main 2 tsp oil lain aur mircho ko 2 minute k liye paka lain. yaad rakhain color zida change na hoo. Ab ek bowl main nikal lain.<br>- Issi karhai may Â½ cup oil dalain garam hojanay per zeera aur rai dana dalain jab khushboo anay lagy tou adrak lehsan ka paste dalain aur bhonain ab ismay bhunay hoye masalao ka white paste shamil karain. Ab haldi aur namak bhi shamil kar dain, sath hi phantii hoi dahi bhi shamil kar dain ab 15 min k liye dhak kar halki anch per pakayain.<br>- jab salan garha hojyee aur oil uper anay lagy then 1/2 cup pani dalain aur sath hi hari mirch bhi dal dain ab mazeed 10-15 minute dhak kar halki anch par paka lain. ( bech bech may chamach chalaty rahain)<br>- ab karhi patay aur lemon juic shamil karain aur 2-3 mimute k liye bareek acnh per paka lain. <br>- Mazedaar hari mirchon ka salan tyar hai.</p>','',26,'MO7UZZLyx1U','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:33:56','Mirchon / Mirchi Ka Salan - Chili Curry Recipe','','Mircho ka salan Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nâ€¢ Khopra (desiccated coconut) 1 cup\r\nâ€¢ Safed til (sesame seeds) 1 cup\r\nâ€¢ Sabit dhania (coriander seeds) 1 tbs\r\nâ€¢ Sabit zeera (cumin seeds) 1 tbs\r\nâ€¢ Methi danna (fenugreek seeds) Â¼ tsp\r\nâ€¢ Kal',11,'youtube',''),(124,'Palak Paneer','<p>Palak Paneer Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>â€¢ Spinach 6 cups (1 medium Bunch) <br>â€¢ Water 7-8 cups<br>â€¢ Onion 1 cup sliced<br>â€¢ Cashew nuts Â¼ cup (optional)<br>â€¢ Green chilies 4-5<br>â€¢ Paneer/cottage cheese 200grams <br>â€¢ Oil 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Cumin 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Ginger paste 1 teaspoon<br>â€¢ Garlic paste 1 teaspoon<br>â€¢ Tomatoes Â¼ cup, finely chopped <br>â€¢ Black salt Â¼ tsp<br>â€¢ Dried fenugreek leaves 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Garam masala 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Salt 1 tsp or to taste<br><br>Directions:<br>â€¢ Wash spinach properly and chop the leaves.<br>â€¢ Boil 7-8 cups of water, add chopped spinach. Let it cook for 3 minutes exactly and strain. Rinse with cold water (it helps in keeping bright green color intact). <br>â€¢ In a blender, puree the spinach without adding water and set aside. <br>â€¢ Take 1 tsp oil, add sliced onion and fry until soft and translucent. In a blender add softened onion, cashew nuts and green chilies and blend until a smooth paste.<br>â€¢ Heat 1 tbs oil in a pan on medium heat and add cumin seeds. Add ginger garlic paste and sautÃ© for 30 seconds. Add tomatoes and cook until soft. Add onion paste and cook for 2 minutes. <br>â€¢ Add spinach puree, black salt, dried fenugreek leaves, garam masala and salt. Mix well and cook for 5-6 mins. Add water if gravy is too thick.<br>â€¢ Cut Â½ inch cubes of paneer and shallow fry them in a pan. (This step is optional)<br>â€¢ Add paneer cubes in the spinach gravy and simmer for 2-3 minutes. <br>â€¢ Palak Paneer is ready to serve.<br><br>Palak Paneer Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>â€¢ Palak 6 cups (1 bunch) <br>â€¢ Paani 7-8 cups<br>â€¢ Pyaz 1 cup sliced<br>â€¢ Kaju Â¼ cup <br>â€¢ Hari Mirch 4-5<br>â€¢ Paneer/cottage cheese 200grams <br>â€¢ Oil 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Zeera 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Adrak paste 1 teaspoon<br>â€¢ Lehsan paste 1 teaspoon<br>â€¢ Tamatar Â¼ cup, finely chopped <br>â€¢ Kala namak Â¼ tsp<br>â€¢ Kasuri Methi 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Garam masala 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Namak 1 tsp or to taste<br><br>Directions:<br>â€¢ Palak ko achi tarah dho kar chop kar lain.<br>â€¢ 7-8 cup paani ko boil karlain aur palak shamil karain. 4 minte keliye boil hone dain aur palak se paani nikal kar thande pani se guzar lain.<br>â€¢ Blender main palak ki puree banalain.<br>â€¢ Ab ek pan main 1 tsp oil lain aur pyaz ko naram karlain. Blender main pyaz, kaju aur hari mirchen shamil karke paste banalain.<br>â€¢ Ek degchi main 1 tbs oil garam karain aur zeera daal den karkarane pe adrak lehsan ka paste shamil karlain. Tamatar shamil karke gal jane tak pakayen. Pyaz ka paste shamil Karen aur 2 minutes pakayen. <br>â€¢ Palak puree shamil karain. Kala namak, kasuri methi, garam masala aur namak shamil karke kuch dair (5-6 min) pakayen.<br>â€¢ Paneer ko Â½ inch cubes main kaat lain aur frying pan main shallow fry karlain (ye step optional hai agar na karna chahen tu paneer ke cubes ko directly gravy main shamil kar lain)<br>â€¢ Paneer ke cubes ko gravy main shamil kar ke 2-3 min mix karain. <br>â€¢ Mazedaar Palak paneer tayar hai.</p>','',26,'BTI6RggETEQ','','active','normal','2017-07-13 15:35:37','Palak Paneer','','Palak Paneer Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nâ€¢ Spinach 6 cups (1 medium Bunch) \r\nâ€¢ Water 7-8 cups\r\nâ€¢ Onion 1 cup sliced\r\nâ€¢ Cashew nuts Â¼ cup (optional)\r\nâ€¢ Green chilies 4-5\r\nâ€¢ Paneer/cottage cheese 200grams \r\nâ€¢ Oil 2 tbs\r\nâ€¢ Cumin 1 ts',10,'youtube',''),(127,'Easy Potato Pancakes Recipe','<p>POTATO PANCAKES IN ENGLISH:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>â€¢ Aalo (potatoes) grated 2 large<br>â€¢ Pyaz (onion) grated Â½<br>â€¢ Water<br>â€¢ Mulmal ka kapra (cheese cloth)<br>â€¢ Drain off excess water<br>â€¢ Anda (egg) 1<br>â€¢ Maida (flour) 1 Â½ tbs<br>â€¢ Namak (salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Black pepper Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Lal mirch (red chili) Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Lehsan (garlic) grated 1 clove<br>â€¢ Oil 2 tbs <br><br>Directions:<br>Grate potatoes and onion with grater (or cheese grater). And put them in a bowl of water for 5 minutes. Drain water from potatoes and put them in a cheesecloth and drain off excess water. <br>In a separate bowl, add flour, egg, salt, black pepper, red chili and mix well, grated potato and onion mix in the bowl and mix well. <br>In a frying pan on low medium heat, add dumpling size of potato mix and spread gently with spatula. Fry both sides until golden brown and dish out. <br>Serve with fried egg or sour cream or boiled eggs or just with ketchup. <br><br>POTATO PANCAKES RECIPE IN URDU:<br><br>Ajza:<br>â€¢ Aalo (potatoes) grated 2 large<br>â€¢ Pyaz (onion) grated Â½<br>â€¢ Water<br>â€¢ Mulmal ka kapra (cheese cloth)<br>â€¢ Drain off excess water<br>â€¢ Anda (egg) 1<br>â€¢ Maida (flour) 1 Â½ tbs<br>â€¢ Namak (salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Black pepper Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Lal mirch (red chili) Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Lehsan (garlic) grated 1 clove<br>â€¢ Oil 2 tbs <br><br>Banane ka tareeka:<br>Aalo aur pyaz ko cheel kar, kadu kash kar k eek pani ke bowl main 5 minutes keliye rakh den. Pani niikal den aur ek mulmul ke kapre main aalo aur pyaz ko daalain aura chi tarah press karke pani nikal kar khushk karden.<br>Ek bowl main, maida, anda, namak, lal mirch, kali mirch shamil kar kea chi tarah mix kar lainaur khushk kiye hue aalo us main shamil kar dain. Achi tarah mix Karen.<br>Ek frying pan main, oil garam Karen. Chamach ki madad se mixture shamil Karen aur thora phela dain. Halki aanch par dono sides ko fry kar lain. <br>Tayar pancakes ko fry ande, sour cream, ketchup ya boil ande ke sath serve karain.</p>','',26,'dAtTV4Zs0m0','','active','','2017-07-13 15:37:11','Easy Potato Pancakes Recipe','','POTATO PANCAKES IN ENGLISH:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nâ€¢ Aalo (potatoes) grated 2 large\r\nâ€¢ Pyaz (onion) grated Â½\r\nâ€¢ Water\r\nâ€¢ Mulmal ka kapra (cheese cloth)\r\nâ€¢ Drain off excess water\r\nâ€¢ Anda (egg) 1\r\nâ€¢ Maida (flour) 1 Â½ tbs\r\nâ€¢ Namak (salt) Â½ tsp o',10,'youtube',''),(131,'Stuffed Potato with cheese','<p>Qeema Stuffed Potato Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>- Mince Chicken 250 gram<br>- Potatoes Large 5-6<br>- Onion thinly sliced 1<br>- Ginger paste 1 Tablespoon<br>- Garlic paste 1 Tablespoon<br>- Green chilies paste 1 Tablespoon<br>- Salt To taste<br>- Red chili powder 1 teaspoon<br>- Coriander mint leaves as per need<br>- Mozzarella Cheese as per need<br>- Green onion as per need<br>- Tomato thinly sliced 1<br>- Olives 5-6<br>- Butter 2 Tablespoon<br>- Black pepper to taste<br><br>Directions:<br>Qeema:<br>- Heat oil in a pan and add thinly sliced onion. When onion are brown add mince chicken, ginger garlic paste and green chili paste. Cook for 5-6 minutes,<br>- Add red chili powder and let it cook until chicken is cooked well.<br>- Add chopped coriander and mint leaves <br>- Fry for 2 minutes. Your filling is ready. Set aside to cool. <br>Potato stuffed:<br>- Half boil potatoes for 10-15 minutes. <br>- Slice tops off of potatoes and scoop the flesh out, leave skin intact.<br>- Preheat oven to 180 degrees C.<br>- Fill potato with salt, butter, mince chicken, green onion, tomatoes. Add cheese on top, garnish with olives, black pepper and bake for 20 minutes.<br>- Qeema stuffed potatoes are ready to serve.<br><br>Qeema Stuffed Potato Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>- Chicken qeema 250 gram <br>- Pyaz bareek kati 1 <br>- Aaloo bare size ke 5-6 <br>- Adrak paste 1 khanay ka chamach<br>- Lehsan paste 1 Khanay ka chamach<br>- Hari mirch pisi hui 1 khanay ka chammach<br>- Namak hasbe zaika<br>- Lal mirch 1 chai ka chamach<br>- Dhaniya podina kata hua hasbe zaroorat<br>- Mozzarella Cheese hasbe zaroorat<br>- Hari piyaz hasbe zaroorat<br>- Tamatar bareek kata hua 1<br>- Olives pieces <br>- Makhan 2 khanay kay chamach <br>- Kali mirch hasbe zaika<br><br>Pakanay ka Tareeka:<br>Qeema:<br>- Oil garam Karen aur pyaz shamil karke brown karlen. Adrak lehsan paste, pisi huee hari mirch aur qeema shamil karke bhoon len.<br>- Phir lal mirch shamil karay aur achi tarha se bhoon lain. <br>- Akhir main dhaniya aur podina shamil karain.<br>- 1-2 min tak bhoon lain aur qeema tayar hai. <br>Potato stuffed:<br>- Aloo ko 10 â€“ 15 main tak boil karain. Khyal rahay ke Aloo ko poora boil nahi karna hai.<br>- Aaloo nikal len aur chamach ki madad se beech main se uska gooda nikal len. <br>- Phir aloo kay andar thora namak aur makhan dal dain. <br>- Phir qeema, hari piyaz aur tamatar bharen ooper cheese shamil karlen kaali mirch, olive daalden<br>- Oven ko pehle se garam karlen 180 degrees C pe aur phir aaloo ko 20 minute bake Karen.<br>- Mazadar qeema stuffed Aloo tayaar hain.</p>','',26,'Y2c3fL713mE','','active','','2017-07-13 15:39:46','Stuffed Potato with cheese','','Qeema Stuffed Potato Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n- Mince Chicken 250 gram\r\n- Potatoes Large 5-6\r\n- Onion thinly sliced 1\r\n- Ginger paste 1 Tablespoon\r\n- Garlic paste 1 Tablespoon\r\n- Green chilies paste 1 Tablespoon\r\n- Salt To taste\r\n- Red chili po',10,'youtube',''),(132,'Fusion Fire Chicken','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Lal mirch kuti huee (Red chili flakes) 2 tbs<br>-Paprika powder 1 tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tbs<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Adrak paste (Ginger paste) 2 tsp<br>-Lehsan paste (Garlic paste) 1 tsp<br>-Soy sauce 1 tbs<br>-Hot pepper sauce 1 tbs<br>-Shahad (Honey) 3 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) 1-2 tbs<br>-Chicken boneless (Bite-size cubes) 500 gms<br>-Oil 1-2 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Mozzarella cheese (Grated) 200 gms<br>-Hara pyaz (Green onion) 1 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>-In bowl,add red chili flakes,paprika powder,red chili powder,black pepper powder,ginger paste,garlic paste,soy sauce, hot pepper sauce,honey and water,mix well.<br>-Add chicken boneless cubes and marinate for 15 minutes.<br>-In frying pan,add oil and chicken,mix well.<br>-Add salt,cover & cook until chicken is done.<br>-Add mozzarella cheese,cover and cook or bake until cheese melts.<br>-Garnish with green onion.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Lal mirch kuti huee (Red chili flakes) 2 tbs<br>-Paprika powder 1 tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tbs<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Adrak paste (Ginger paste) 2 tsp<br>-Lehsan paste (Garlic paste) 1 tsp<br>-Soy sauce 1 tbs<br>-Hot pepper sauce 1 tbs<br>-Shahad (Honey) 3 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) 1-2 tbs<br>-Chicken boneless (Bite-size cubes) 500 gms<br>-Oil 1-2 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Mozzarella cheese (Grated) 200 gms<br>-Hara pyaz (Green onion) 1 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein lal mirch kuti huee,paprika powder,lal mirch powder,kali mirch powder,adrak paste,lehsan paste,soy sauce, hot pepper sauce,shahad aur pani dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Chicken boneless cubes dal ker 15 minutes kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Frying pan mein oil aur chicken dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Namak dal ker dhak ker chicken gul janay tak paka lein.<br>-Mozzarella cheese dal ker dhak ker cheese melt hunay tak paka lein ya bake ker lein.<br>-Hara pyaz sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'Sibnm1zZjR8','','active','','2017-07-13 15:41:01','Fusion Fire Chicken','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Lal mirch kuti huee (Red chili flakes) 2 tbs\r\n-Paprika powder 1 tsp\r\n-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tbs\r\n-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) Â½ tsp\r\n-Adrak paste (Ginger paste) 2 tsp\r\n-Lehsan paste (Garli',8,'youtube',''),(133,'Bharat Khofzada? - Headlines - 06:00 PM - 13 July 2017','<p>Watch&nbsp;Bharat Khofzada? - Headlines - 06:00 PM - 13 July 2017</p><div><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTur7oM6mLL0rM2k0znuZpQ\"></a></p></div>','',24,'4xQw6U93DR4','','active','','2017-07-13 15:42:39','Bharat Khofzada? - Headlines - 06:00 PM - 13 July 2017','','Watch Bharat Khofzada? - Headlines - 06:00 PM - 13 July 2017\r\n',7,'youtube',''),(134,'Chicken 65','<p>Chicken 65 recipe</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br><br>Chicken Marinade<br>â€¢ Chicken boneless 1 inch cubes Â½ kg<br>â€¢ Adrak lehsan paste (ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Lal mirch (red chili flakes/powder) 1 tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Corn flour 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Dhania (coriander seeds) roasted & crushed 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Namak (salt) 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Chawal (rice flour) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Sirka (vinegar) or lemon juice 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Pani (water) as required<br>Oil for frying <br><br>Gravy:<br>â€¢ Oil 3-4 tbs <br>â€¢ Kari pata (curry leaves) 10-15<br>â€¢ Adrak (ginger) chopped Â½ tbs<br>â€¢ Lehsan (garlic) chopped Â½ tbs<br>â€¢ Chili garlic sauce Â¼ cup<br>â€¢ Tomato paste 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Namak (salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Lal mirch powder (red chili powder) 1 tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Zeera (cumin seeds) roasted & crushed 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Dahi (yogurt) Â¾ cup<br>â€¢ Fried chicken<br>â€¢ Hari mirch (green chilies) 2-3 <br>â€¢ Red food color Â¼ tsp (optional)<br>â€¢ Garam masala powder (whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Lemon juice 2 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>- Add chicken in a bowl and add all marinade ingredients and mix well. Marinate for 2 hours.<br>- Heat oil in a wok and fry marinated chicken cubes until golden brown on medium low flame. Set aside.<br>- To prepare gravy, heat oil and add curry leaves, ginger and garlic. Saute for 1 min and add ginger garlic sauce, tomato paste, salt, red chili powder cumin powder and mix well. <br>- Add yogurt, mix and add fried chicken.<br>- Add green chilies, red food color and mix well<br>- Sprinkle whole spice powder and lemon juice.<br>- Serve with white rice.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Chicken Marinade<br>â€¢ Chicken boneless 1 inch cubes Â½ kg<br>â€¢ Adrak lehsan paste (ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Lal mirch (red chili flakes/powder) 1 tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Corn flour 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Dhania (coriander seeds) roasted & crushed 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Namak (salt) 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Chawal (rice flour) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Sirka (vinegar) or lemon juice 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Pani (water) as required<br>Oil for frying <br><br>Gravy:<br>â€¢ Oil 3-4 tbs <br>â€¢ Kari pata (curry leaves) 10-15<br>â€¢ Adrak (ginger) chopped Â½ tbs<br>â€¢ Lehsan (garlic) chopped Â½ tbs<br>â€¢ Chili garlic sauce Â¼ cup<br>â€¢ Tomato paste 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Namak (salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Lal mirch powder (red chili powder) 1 tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Zeera (cumin seeds) roasted & crushed 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Dahi (yogurt) Â¾ cup<br>â€¢ Fried chicken<br>â€¢ Hari mirch (green chilies) 2-3 <br>â€¢ Red food color Â¼ tsp (optional)<br>â€¢ Garam masala powder (whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Lemon juice 2 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>1. Bowl mein chicken aur tamam ajza dal ker 2 ghantay kliya marinate kar ke rakh dein<br>2. Karhai mein tel garam ker k ,chicken ko darmiyani ancch per light golden hunay tak fry ker lein<br>3. Gravy banana kliya tel garam karein,kari pata,lehsan,adrak dal ker 1 minute kliya saute ker lein <br>4. Ginger garlic sauce, tomato paste,namak, lal mirch powder, zeera dal ker chamcha chalayein<br>5. Dahi shamil ker k mix karein, ab is mein fry ki hoye chicken dal dein<br>6. Hari mirchein aur red food color shamil karein<br>7. Akhir mein garam masala powder aur lemon juice dal ker mix ker lein<br>8. Chawal k saath serve karein.</p>','',26,'SX5vHLirW6o','','active','','2017-07-13 15:42:51','Chicken 65','','Chicken 65 recipe\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n\r\nChicken Marinade\r\nâ€¢ Chicken boneless 1 inch cubes Â½ kg\r\nâ€¢ Adrak lehsan paste (ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs\r\nâ€¢ Lal mirch (red chili flakes/powder) 1 tsp or to taste\r\nâ€¢ Corn flour 2 tbs\r\nâ€¢ Dhania (coriander seed',10,'youtube',''),(135,'Chicken Jalfrezi','<p>Chicken Jalfrezi Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Ande (Eggs) 2 with salt & pepper<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) Julienne 1<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Julienne 1<br>-Oil 2-3 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tsp<br>-Boneless chicken Julienne Â½ kg<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Kali mirch (Black paper) Crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Tomato ketchup 4 tbs<br>-Tomato paste 2 tbs<br>-Soya sauce 1 tbs<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Tamatar (Tomato) Deseeded & Julienne 1<br><br>Directions:<br>-In frying pan, add oil and pour the whisk eggs, make omelet, set aside and cut into cubes.<br>-In wok, add oil, capsicum and onion, sautÃ© for a minute, set aside.<br>-In wok, add oil and ginger garlic paste and boneless chicken, sautÃ© until it changes color.<br>-Add red chili powder, turmeric powder,black pepper crushed,coriander powder and give it a good mix.<br>-Add tomato ketchup,tomato paste and soya sauce and mix.<br>-Add whole spice powder,cumin powder,salt and mix well.<br>-Add tomato (deseeded), sautÃ©ed vegetables and omelet cubes,mix well.<br>-Chicken Jalfrezi is ready,serve with rice.<br><br>Chicken Jalfrezi Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Ande (Eggs) 2 with salt & pepper<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) Julienne 1<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Julienne 1<br>-Oil 2-3 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tsp<br>-Boneless chicken Julienne Â½ kg<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Kali mirch (Black paper) Crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Tomato ketchup 4 tbs<br>-Tomato paste 2 tbs<br>-Soya sauce 1 tbs<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Tamatar (Tomato) Deseeded & Julienne 1 <br><br>Directions:<br>-Frying pan mein oil aur ande dal ker omelet tayyar ker lein,side per rakh dein aur cubes mein cut ker lein.<br>-Karhai mein oil,shimla mirch aur pyaz dal ker ek minute kliya saute ker lein,side per rakh dein.<br>-Karhai mein oil, adrak lehsan paste aur boneless chicken shamil karein aur rang tabdeel hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Lal mirch powder,haldee powder,kali mirch crushed,dhania powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Tomato ketchup,tomato paste aur soya sauce dak ker mix karein.<br>-Garam masala powder,zeera powder aur namak dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Tomato (deseeded), sautÃ©ed vegetables aur omelet cubes dal ker ache tarhan mix karein.<br>-Chicken Jalfrezi tayyar hai, chawal ka saath serve karein.</p>','',26,'6zYCE6MbTZo','','active','','2017-07-13 15:47:18','Chicken Jalfrezi','','Chicken Jalfrezi Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Oil 1 tbs\r\n-Ande (Eggs) 2 with salt & pepper\r\n-Oil 1 tbs\r\n-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) Julienne 1\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) Julienne 1\r\n-Oil 2-3 tbs\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tsp\r\n-Boneless chicken',10,'youtube',''),(136,'Croquette Balls','<p>CHICKEN CROQUETTES RECIPE IN URDU:</p><p><br>AJZA:<br>â€¢ Chicken Ubli & resha hue 1 Â½ Cup<br>â€¢ Makhan 2 tbsp<br>â€¢ Piyaz 2 tbsp<br>â€¢ Maida 4 tbsp ameze keliye<br>â€¢ Maida 3 tbsp coating keliye<br>â€¢ Doodh 1 Cup<br>â€¢ Hara Dhania 2 tbsp<br><br><br><br><br>â€¢ Mustard powder Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Namak 1tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Kali Mirch powder Â½ tsp <br>â€¢ Leemon ka rus 1 tbsp<br>â€¢ Anday (Phnetay hue) 2<br>â€¢ Oil deep Fry ke liye<br>â€¢ Breadcrumbs 1 Â½ Cup<br><br><br><br><br>Bananay ka Tareeqa:<br>o Chicken ko thore se namak and kali mirch ke sath boil karlen, aur haath se resha kar ke alag rakh lein. <br>o Pan main makhan garam Karen and us main piyaz shamil Karen and naram hone tak pakaye.<br>o Is main ab maida shamil shamil karke pakaye ke uskab colour halka change hojaye.<br>o Pan ko heat se hataye aur us main doodh shamil Karen. Doodh shamil karte waqt isko whisk karte rahe take lumps nahi bane and \\ball ke surat ban jaye. <br>o Is main namak, kali mirch, mustard shamil kare. <br>o Ab is main ubli hue chicken aur lemon ka rus daalein<br>o Croquettes ke shape banaye and isko 5-10 mins ke liye freezer main rakh dein. <br>o Iske baad deep fry kare darmiyani aanch pe jab tak golden na hojaye. <br>o Apni pasand ki sauce k sath serve Karen. <br><br>CHICKEN CROQUETTES RECIPE IN ENGLISH:<br><br>INGREDIENTS:<br>â€¢ Chicken (Boiled & Shredded) 1 Â½ Cup<br>â€¢ Butter 2 tbsp<br>â€¢ Onion (Chopped) 2 tbsp<br>â€¢ Flour 4 tbsp for mixture<br>â€¢ Flour 3 tbsp for coating<br>â€¢ Milk 1 Cup<br>â€¢ Coriander (chopped) 2 tbsp<br>â€¢ Mustard Powder Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Salt 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Black pepper Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Lemon Juice 1 tbsp<br>â€¢ Eggs (beaten) 2<br><br><br><br><br>â€¢ Oil for deep fry<br>â€¢ Bread Crumbs 1 Â½ Cup<br><br>METHOD:<br>o Boiled the chicken with some salt & peppercorn and then shred it with hands. Keep aside.<br>o Heat Butter and slightly fry onions till soft. <br>o Add Flour and saute till it becomes lightly gold. <br>o Now remove the pan from heat and start adding milk and keep whisking to avoid lumps. <br>o At this stage it becomes like a ball.<br>o Now add seasoning, lemon juice and boiled/mashed chicken<br>o Shape the croquettes as desired, dust them in flour (3 tbsp), dip in eggs and roll them in Bread crumbs.<br>o When all the croquettes done, keep them in freezer for 5-10 mins for better firming. <br>o Deep fry them on medium heat till golden. <br>o Serve with your favorite sauce.</p>','',26,'MXuVkUZaagE','','active','','2017-07-13 15:48:45','Croquette Balls','','CHICKEN CROQUETTES RECIPE IN URDU:\r\n\r\nAJZA:\r\nâ€¢ Chicken Ubli & resha hue 1 Â½ Cup\r\nâ€¢ Makhan 2 tbsp\r\nâ€¢ Piyaz 2 tbsp\r\nâ€¢ Maida 4 tbsp ameze keliye\r\nâ€¢ Maida 3 tbsp coating keliye\r\nâ€