glasses of water, add salt and boil chicken fillet for 10-15 minutes.<br>- Cut chicken fillet in slices as per chilies size.<br>- Make cuts in Mozzarella Cheese as per chilies size.<br>- Make a slit in chilies and deseed them gently.<br>- Take 2 glasses of water in a bowl, add vinegar and dip all chilies in it for 10-15 minutes.<br>- Take out chilies from water and pat dry them. Put a chicken slice and cheese inside the chilies and set aside.<br>- Take three separate bowls, add flour, breadcrumbs and (well beated) eggs in each.<br>- With the help of spoon coat each chili with flour than dip it in egg and then breadcrumbs, repeat the step. <br>- Heat oil in a wok. On medium flame fry the chilies until they are golden brown.<br>- Serve Chili Bites with the dip.</p>','',26,'l74nruKOKmo','','active','','2017-07-13 15:51:48','Chili Bites Recipe','','Chili Bites recipe in Urdu\r\nAjzah\r\n\r\n- Chicken fillet 250 gm (Ek pao)\r\n- Namak hasbe zaika\r\n- moti hari mirch 12-18\r\n- Mozzarella cheese slices 4\r\n- Maida 1 cup\r\n- Bread crumbs 1 Â½ cup \r\n- Sirka 2 khanay ke chamach\r\n- Anday 3 phainte hue\r\n- Oil for deep ',11,'youtube',''),(141,'Donkey Meat Prank |Gadha Ka Goosht Bechna | ','<p>Watch&nbsp;Donkey Meat Prank |Gadha Ka Goosht Bechna |</p>','',27,'oxd6uh9Imps','','active','','2017-07-13 16:05:53','Donkey Meat Prank |Gadha Ka Goosht Bechna | ','','Watch Donkey Meat Prank |Gadha Ka Goosht Bechna | ',12,'youtube',''),(142,'GYM PRANK','<p>Watch&nbsp;|| GYM PRANK || By Nadir Ali In || P4 Pakao ||</p><div><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCI9tIvSPsdxNEICjZk7ujUA\"></a></p></div>','',27,'ysuvT7zuxKg','','active','','2017-07-13 16:06:55','GYM PRANK','','Watch || GYM PRANK || By Nadir Ali In || P4 Pakao ||\r\n',14,'youtube',''),(143,'Conjuring Prank ','<p>Watch&nbsp;|| Conjuring Prank || By Ahmed Khan In || P4 Pakao ||</p><div><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCI9tIvSPsdxNEICjZk7ujUA\"></a></p></div>','',27,'UGKq0h1u8w0','','active','','2017-0