r>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) 2<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) 1<br>-Iceberg lettuce Â½ <br>-Parsley or Hara dhania (Coriander) Â½ cup<br>-Podina (Mint) 3-4 tbs<br>-Moli (Radish) Â½ <br>-Whole wheat pita bread 1-2<br>-Olive oil 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1-2Pinch<br>Salad Dressing:<br>-Olive oil Â½ Cup<br>-Lemon juice 1/3 Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Lehsan (Garlic) chopped 1<br>-Sumac or lemon zest 1 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>-Kheeray ko peel ker ka cubes mein cut ker lein.<br>-Tamatar ko deseed ker ka cubes mein cut ker lein.<br>-Shimla mirch ko deseed ker ka cubes mein cut ker lein.<br>-Iceberg lettuce,parsley or dhania,podina,moli aur whole wheat pita bread ko bhi cut ker lein.<br>-Tawa ko garam karein,whole wheat pita bread cubes dal ker upper sa olive oil aur namak dal dein,brown hunay tak halki ancch per toast ker lein ya 180 C per 10 minute kliya bake ker lein.<br>-Salad dressing kliya,jug mein olive oil,lemon juice,namak,lehsan aur lemon zest dal ker ache tarhan whisk ker lein aur squeeze bottle mein dal dein.<br>-Bowl mein tamam vegetables,bran pita bread and salad dressing dal ker ache tarhan mix ker ka serve karein.</p>','',26,'EIHxNtAhjgk','','active','','2017-07-14 10:08:34','Fattoush Salad','','Fattoush Salad\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Kheera (Cucumber) 2-3\r\n-Tamatar (Tomatoes) 2\r\n-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) 1\r\n-Iceberg lettuce Â½ \r\n-Parsley or Hara dhania (Coriander) Â½ cup\r\n-Podina (Mint) 3-4 tbs\r\n-Moli (Radish) Â½ \r\n-Whole wheat pita ',10,'youtube',''),(213,'Bhagaray Baigan ','<p>Serving: 4-5 People</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>-Sabut dhania (Coriander seeds) 3 tbs<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) 3 tbs<br>-Safed till (Sesame seeds) 3 tbs<br>-Kashkhash (Poppy seeds) 3 tbs<br>-Khopra (Desiccated coconut) 3 tbs<br>-Moong phali (Peanuts) raw 3 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup <br>-Pyaz (Onion) 4-5<br>-Baigan (Eggplants) round 750 gms<br>-Namak (Salt) to taste<br>-Oil Â¾ Cup<br>-Kalonji (Nigella seeds) Â¼ tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) 1 tsp<br>-Sabut lal mirch (Whole red chilies) 7-8<br>-Curry pata (Curry leaves) 9-10<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) 1 tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as required<br>-Imli ka gooda (Tamarind pulp) 2 Cups<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as much gravy required<br><br>Directions:<br>-In frying pan,add coriander seeds,cumin seeds and roast for 1 minute.<br>-Add sesame seeds,poppy seeds and mix.<br>-Add desiccated coconut and roast until fragrant and set aside.<br>-In frying pan,add peanuts,roast until light golden and set aside.<br>-In spice mixer,add roasted mixture and grind to make coarse powder and set aside.<br>-Fire roast whole onion with skin until skin is burnt and crush/press the whole onion and remove roasted black skin & cut roughly.<br>-In grinder,add water,roasted onions and grind to make a puree and set aside.<br>-Take egg plants,make 4 small cuts in the eggplant but donâ€™t separate them and keep them intact, including the stem,sprinkle salt and stuffed with ground spice mixture & set aside.<br>-In pot,add oil,nigella seeds,cumin seeds,whole red chilies and mix.<br>-Add curry leaves,fry until fragrant and add ginger garlic paste,mix well.<br>-Add onion puree,mix well for 3-4 minutes.<br>-Add remaining ground spice mixture and mix well.<br>-Add red chili powder,turmeric powder,salt and mix well.<br>-Add water,mix well and cook for 4-5 minutes.<br>-Now place spiced egg plants and turn sides to cook evelny,cover & cook for 5-6 minutes.<br>-Add tamarind pulp,water and mix well.<br>-Cover and steam cook for 8-10 minutes.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Sabut dhania (Coriander seeds) 3 tbs<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) 3 tbs<br>-Safed till (Sesame seeds) 3 tbs<br>-Kashkhash (Poppy seeds) 3 tbs<br>-Khopra (Desiccated coconut) 3 tbs<br>-Moong phali (Peanuts) raw 3 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup <br>-Pyaz (Onion) 4-5<br>-Baigan (Eggplants) round 750 gms<br>-Namak (Salt) to taste<br>-Oil Â¾ Cup<br>-Kalonji (Nigella seeds) Â¼ tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) 1 tsp<br>-Sabut lal mirch (Whole red chilies) 7-8<br>-Curry pata (Curry leaves) 9-10<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) 1 tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as required<br>-Imli ka gooda (Tamarind pulp) 2 Cups<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as much gravy required<br><br>Directions:<br>-Frying pan mein sabut dhania aur zeera dal ker 1 minute kliya roast ker lein.<br>-Safed till aur kashkhash dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Khopra dal dein aur khushbu anay tak roast ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Frying pan mein moong phali dal ker light golden hunay tak roast ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Spice mixer mein roasted mixture dal dein aur grind ker ka coarse powder bana lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Pyaz ko chulhay per skin jal janay tak fire roast ker lein aur crush/press ker lein aur roasted black skin ko nikal lein & roughly cut ker lein.<br>-Grinder mein pani aur roasted pyaz dal dein aur grind ker ka puree bana lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Baigan mein 4 small cuts laga lein magar alag nahi kerna hai,stem lo lagay rehnay dein,namak chirak ker ground spice mixture bhar dein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Pot mein oil,kalonji,zeera aur sabut lal mirch dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Curry pata dal ker khushbu anay tak fry ker lein aur adrak lehsan paste dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Onion puree dal ker 3-4 minutes kliya ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Baqi bacha huwa ground spice mixture bhi dal dein aur ker mix ker lein.<br>-Lal mirch powder,haldee powder aur namak dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Pani shamil karein aur 4-5 minutes kliya paka lein.<br>-Ab spiced baigan rakh dein aur sides ko turn ker lei aur dhak ker 5-6 minutes kliya paka lein.<br>-Imli ka gooda aur pani dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Dhak dein aur 8-10 minutes kliya steam cook ker lein.</p>','',26,'erZIvrJ3Zr4','','active','','2017-07-14 10:10:46','Bhagaray Baigan ','','Serving: 4-5 People\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Sabut dhania (Coriander seeds) 3 tbs\r\n-Zeera (Cumin seeds) 3 tbs\r\n-Safed till (Sesame seeds) 3 tbs\r\n-Kashkhash (Poppy seeds) 3 tbs\r\n-Khopra (Desiccated coconut) 3 tbs\r\n-Moong phali (Peanuts) raw 3 ',12,'youtube',''),(214,'Namak Boti','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Oil Â½ Cup<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Mutton (Mix boti) 1 kg <br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Pani (Water) 3-4 Cups<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tbs<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs or to taste<br>-Chaat masala to taste<br>-Kala namak (Black salt) to taste<br><br>Directions:<br>-In pot,add oil,ginger garlic paste,mutton,salt,water and mix well,cover & cook for 30-40 minutes or until meat is tender.<br>-Now cook on high flame until oil separates.<br>-Add sugar and mix well.<br>-Add lemon juice,sprinkle chaat masala,black salt and serve.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Oil Â½ Cup<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Mutton (Mix boti) 1 kg <br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Pani (Water) 3-4 Cups<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tbs<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs or to taste<br>-Chaat masala to taste<br>-Kala namak (Black salt) to taste<br><br>Directions:<br>-Pot mein adrak lehsan paste,mutton,namak aur pani dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein,dhka ker 30-40 minutes ya gosht gul janay tak paka lein.<br>-Ab tez ancch per oil alag hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Cheeni dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Lemon juice,chaat masala aur kala namak dal ker serve karein.</p>','',26,'wIH5v-2UuL4','','active','','2017-07-14 10:26:50','Namak Boti','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Oil Â½ Cup\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs\r\n-Mutton (Mix boti) 1 kg \r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste\r\n-Pani (Water) 3-4 Cups\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tbs\r\n-Lemon juice 1 tbs or to taste\r\n-Chaat masala to ta',11,'youtube',''),(215,'Potato Puffs','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Makhan (Butter) 80 gms (1/3 Cup)<br>-Pani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) chopped 1 tbs<br>-Hara dhania (Coriander) chopped 1 tbs<br>-Anday (Eggs) 3<br>-Aloo (Potatoes) Boiled & mashed Â½ Cup<br>-Cheddar cheese grated Â¾ Cup<br>-Parmesan cheese Â¼ Cup (optional)<br>-Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>-In wok,add butter and water,bring it to boil and mix well.<br>-Add all-purpose flour and mix well for 3-4 minutes until dough is formed.<br>-In bowl,add dough,black pepper powder,salt,green chilies,coriander and egg,mix well.<br>-Add eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition.<br>-Add mashed potatoes,cheddar cheese and parmesan cheese,mix well.<br>-Grease your hands with oil,take a mixture and make a small ball.<br>-In wok,heat oil and fry on low flame until golden.<br>-Add this mixture in piping bag and fry on low flame until golden.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Makhan (Butter) 80 gms<br>-Pani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) chopped 1 tbs<br>-Hara dhania (Coriander) chopped 1 tbs<br>-Anday (Eggs) 3<br>-Aloo (Potatoes) Boiled & mashed Â½ Cup<br>-Cheddar cheese grated Â¾ Cup<br>-Parmesan cheese Â¼ Cup (optional)<br>-Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>-Karhai mein makhan aur pani dal ker ubal lein aur ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Maida dal ker 3-4 minute kliya ache tarhan mix ker lein yahan tak ka dough bun jaye.<br>-Bowl mein dough,kali mirch powder,namak,hari mirch,dhania aur anda dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Ek,ek ker ka anday daltay jayein aur mix kertay jayein.<br>-Aloo mashed,cheddar cheese aur parmesan cheese dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Haathon ko oil sa grease ker ka mixture ki small ball bana lein.<br>-Karhai mein oil garam ker ka golden hunay tak halki ancch per fry ker lein.<br>-Is mixture ko piping bag mein dal dein aur golden hunay tak halki ancch per fry ker lei</p>','',26,'zttvI0MX22c','','active','','2017-07-14 10:28:10','Potato Puffs','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Makhan (Butter) 80 gms (1/3 Cup)\r\n-Pani (Water) 1 Cup\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup\r\n-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp\r\n-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chilies) chopped 1 tbs\r\n-Har',9,'youtube',''),(216,'Chili Stuffed Pakora','<p>ngredients:</p><p>Masala Mix (For Chili Stuffing):<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) roasted & crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Achar gosht masala 1 tsp<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs<br>-Cooking oil Â½ tbs<br>Potato Coating:<br>-Aloo (Potatoes) boiled & mashed Â½ kg <br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp<br>-Chaat masala 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Hara dhania (Fresh coriander) chopped 3 tbs<br>Pakora Batter:<br>-Baisan (Gram flour) 1 Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Baking soda Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) roasted & crushed Â¼ tsp<br>-Pani (Water) Â¾ Cup<br>-Cooking oil 1 tbs <br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 15-20<br>-Mozzarella cheese grated as required (Optional)<br>-Cooking 0il for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>Masala Mix (For Chili Stuffing):<br>-In bowl,add salt,coriander powder,cumin seeds,achar gosht masala,lemon juice,cooking oil and mix well,set aside.<br>For Potato Coating:<br>-In mash potatoes,add red chili powder,chaat masala,salt,fresh coriander and mix well,set aside.<br>For Pakora Batter:<br>-In bowl,add gram flour,salt,baking powder,cumin seeds,water and mix well until smooth batter is formed.<br>-Add cooking oil,mix well and let it rest for 20 minutes.<br>-Wash,pat dry and deseed chilies.<br>-In green chilies,add masala mix or mozzarella cheese with masala mix,coat with potato coating then dip into pakora batter.<br>-Follow the same process and similarly make other chilies.<br>-In wok,heat cooking oil and fry until golden brown.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Masala Mix (For Chili Stuffing):<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) roasted & crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Achar gosht masala 1 tsp<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs<br>-Cooking oil Â½ tbs<br>Potato Coating:<br>-Aloo (Potatoes) boiled & mashed Â½ kg <br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp<br>-Chaat masala 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Hara dhania (Fresh coriander) chopped 3 tbs<br>Pakora Batter:<br>-Baisan (Gram flour) 1 Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Baking soda Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) roasted & crushed Â¼ tsp<br>-Pani (Water) Â¾ Cup<br>-Cooking oil 1 tbs <br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 15-20<br>-Mozzarella cheese grated as required (Optional)<br>-Cooking 0il for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>Masala Mix (For Chili Stuffing):<br>-Bowl mein namak,dhania powder,zeera,achar gosht masala,lemon juice aur cooking oil dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>For Potato Coating:<br>-Mash aloo mein lal mirch powder,chaat masala,namak aur hara dhania dsal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>For Pakora Batter:<br>-Bowl mein baisan,namak,baking powder,zeera aur pani dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur smooth batter tayyar ker lein.<br>-Cooking oil dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur 20 minutes kliya rakh dein.<br>-Chilies ko dho lein,pat dry karein aur seeds nikal lein.<br>-Green chilies mein masala mix or mozzarella cheese with masala mix dal dein,potato coating sa coat ker lein phir pakora batter mein dip ker lein.<br>-Yehe process follow karein aur baqi mirchein bhi tayyar ker lein.<br>-Karhai mein cooking oil garam karein aur golden brown fry ker lein.</p>','',26,'ti8MD3-kkMQ','','active','','2017-07-14 10:32:06','Chili Stuffed Pakora','','ngredients:\r\nMasala Mix (For Chili Stuffing):\r\n-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste\r\n-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) Â¼ tsp\r\n-Zeera (Cumin seeds) roasted & crushed Â½ tsp\r\n-Achar gosht masala 1 tsp\r\n-Lemon juice 1 tbs\r\n-Cooking oil Â½ tbs\r\nPotato Coating:\r\n',9,'youtube',''),(217,'Chicken Patties and Puff Pastry with Ghee ','<p>Chicken Patties Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Puff Pastry:<br>Ingredients:<br>-Ghee 400 gms<br>-Pani (Water) 200 ml<br>-Anda (Egg) 1 (Optional)<br>-Oil 4 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Powdered 2 tbs<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 500 gms<br>-Pani (Water) if required <br><br>Directions: <br>-In wok,add ghee,let it melt and bring it to room temperature.<br>-In bowl,add chilled water with ice cubes,melted ghee,leave it until ghee becomes solid and refrigerate for approx.6 hours.<br>-In jug,add water,egg,oil,salt,sugar and whisk well.<br>-In bowl,add all-purpose flour and make a well,gradually add egg water mixture and knead until smooth & soft dough is formed.Use water if required,cover and let it rest for 20 minutes.<br>-Take out solid ghee from water and squeeze out excess water completely.<br>-Take square pan,place butter paper and set a block in a square pan.<br>-Place butter paper on top and with the help of kitchen hammer flatten ghee and freeze ghee block for 20 minutes.<br>-Take prepared dough,sprinkle generous amount of flour and roll out dough in round shape with the help of rolling pin.<br>-In the center of the dough,place solid ghee block,wrap four sides,dust dry flour and roll out in rectangular shape with the help of rolling pin,fold one third into the middle and then the other third on top,fold and overlap the remaining sides,cover and freeze it for 20 minutes.<br>-Take out from freezer,dust dry flour and roll out in rectangular shape with rolling pin.<br>-Repeat the same over lapping folding process,cover and freeze it for another 20 minutes.<br>-Again take out from freezer,dust dry flour and roll out in rectangular shape with rolling pin.<br>-Puff pastry is ready and use as required.<br><br>Tips:<br>-If you are using butter,follow the same puff pastry method.<br>-If you are using ghee,freeze it for 15-20 minutes and if you are using unipuff,put it in fridge for 15-20 minutes.<br>-Sprinkle generous amount of all-purpose flour while you are rolling or overlapping puff pastry.<br>-In puff pastry recipes,egg is optional.<br>-Put the ghee (with chilled ice cold water) in refrigerator until ghee becomes solid.<br><br>Chicken Filling:<br>Ingredients:<br>-Oil 2 tbs<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Chopped 1 medium<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) chopped 2 tsp<br>-Chicken 1 & Â½ cups (Boiled with Â½ tsp ginger garlic paste & shredded)<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Chicken cube Â¼ tsp<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 2 tbs<br>-Doodh (Milk) Â½ Cup<br><br>Directions:<br>-In frying pan,add oil and onion,fry until translucent.<br>-Add green chilies and mix.<br>-Add chicken,salt,black pepper powder,white pepper powder,chicken cube and mix well.<br>-Add all-purpose flour and mix well for 2 minutes.<br>-Add milk and mix until milk is dried,set aside and let it cool.<br>-Roll out puff pastry,cut in desired shape by using round cookie cutter,egg wash,add chicken filling,put another piece on top,gently press to seal and egg wash again.<br>-Spray baking tray with water and place chicken patties,bake in a pre-heated oven at 180 C for 40-45 minutes.<br>-Chicken patties are ready.<br><br><br>Tips in urdu:<br>-Agar makhan use ker raha han tou same yehe puff pastry ka method follow karein.<br>-Agar ghee use ker raha ha tou 15-20 minutes kliya freeze karein aur agar unipuff use ker raha han tou 15-20 minutes kliya fridge mein rakh dein.<br>-Puff pastry ko rolling ya overlapping kertay hoye bohat sara maida chirak dein.<br>-Puff pastry mein anda optional hai.<br>-Ghee ko chilled pani aur baraf ka saath refrigerator mein rakah dein jab tak ghee solid na ho jaye.</p>','',26,'vSDjJ7sY9pQ','','active','','2017-07-14 10:38:22','Chicken Patties and Puff Pastry with Ghee ','','Chicken Patties Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nPuff Pastry:\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Ghee 400 gms\r\n-Pani (Water) 200 ml\r\n-Anda (Egg) 1 (Optional)\r\n-Oil 4 tbs\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) Powdered 2 tbs\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 500 gms\r\n-Pani (Water) if required',12,'youtube',''),(218,'Folded Chicken Paratha ','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Ghee/Oil 1-2 tbs<br>-Pyaz (Onion) chopped 2-3 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) Â½ tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) Chopped 1 tbs<br>-Chicken qeema (Chicken mince) 300 gms<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander) 1 tbs<br>-Atta (Flour) 2 Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ tbs<br>-Anda (Egg) 1<br>-Oil/Melted ghee 3-4 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) warm as required<br>-Anda (Egg) whisked 2 tbs<br>-Tamatar (Tomato) Chopped 1 tbs<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander) 1 tbs<br>-Hara pyaz (Green onion)<br>-Cheddar cheese (Grated) as required<br>-Mozzarella cheese (Grated) as required<br>-Ghee/Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>-In frying pan,add oil/ghee,onion,ginger garlic paste and sautÃ© for a minute.<br>-Add green chilies,chicken mince,salt,red chili powder,cumin powder,coriander powder and green coriander,cook until done and set aside.<br>-In bowl,add flour,salt,sugar,egg,oil/melted ghee and mix.<br>-Add water and knead well to form dough,cover and let it rest for 20 minutes.<br>-Apply melted ghee/oil and knead again to make smooth dough.<br>-Take a small dough and coat in dry flour,roll out dough into round shape with the help of rolling pin.<br>-Spread oil and dry flour evenly,fold from both opposite sides,apply oil and again fold both opposite sides,it will be square.<br>-Dust in dry flour and roll out dough with the help of rolling pin.<br>-Heat griddle,place dough,pour and spread whisk egg,add cooked mince,tomato,green coriander, green onion,cheddar cheese,mozzarella cheese and remaining egg.<br>-Fold one side of paratha and fry paratha from both sides with ghee/oil.<br>-Sprinkle green onion leaves and serve.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Ghee/Oil 1-2 tbs<br>-Pyaz (Onion) chopped 2-3 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) Â½ tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) Chopped 1 tbs<br>-Chicken qeema (Chicken mince) 300 gms<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander) 1 tbs<br>-Atta (Flour) 2 Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ tbs<br>-Anda (Egg) 1<br>-Oil/Melted ghee 3-4 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) warm as required<br>-Anda (Egg) whisked 2 tbs<br>-Tamatar (Tomato) Chopped 1 tbs<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander) 1 tbs<br>-Hara pyaz (Green onion)<br>-Cheddar cheese (Grated) as required<br>-Mozzarella cheese (Grated) as required<br>-Ghee/Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>-Frying pan mein oil/ghee,pyaz aur adrak lehsan paste dal ker ek minute kliya sautÃ© ker lein.<br>-Hari mirch,chicken qeema,namak,lal mirch powder,zeera powder,dhania powder aur hari mirch dal ker pak janay tak paka lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Bowl mein atta,namak,cheeni,anda aur oil/melted ghee dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Pani dal ker dough ko ache tarhan ghond lein,dhak ker 20 minute kliya rakh dein.<br>-Ghee melted/oil dal ker dough ko dubara smooth hunay tak ghond lein.<br>-Small dough ko atta mein coat ker ka rough shape mein rolling pin ki madad sa bail lein.<br>-Oil laga ker atta chirak dein,dono opposite sides sa fold ker lein,oil laga ker dubara opposite sides ko fold ker lein,square shape bun jaye.<br>-Atta laga ker dough ko rolling pin ki madad sa bail lein.<br>-Tawa garam ker ka dough rakh dein aur us ka upper pheeta huwa anda,cooked qeema,tamatar,hara dhania,hari pyaz,cheddar cheese,mozzarella cheese aur bacha huwa anda dal dein.<br>-Paratha ki ek side ko fold ker ka dono sides sa ghee/oil mein fry ker lein.<br>-Hara pyaz sa garnish ker ka serve karein.</p>','',26,'eXqqplbZJHs','','active','','2017-07-14 10:44:46','Folded Chicken Paratha ','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Ghee/Oil 1-2 tbs\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) chopped 2-3 tbs\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) Â½ tbs\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chili) Chopped 1 tbs\r\n-Chicken qeema (Chicken mince) 300 gms\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste\r\n-Lal ',24,'youtube',''),(219,'Lifafa(Envelop) Egg Paratha ','<p>Lifafa Egg Paratha</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>-Atta (Flour) 2 Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ tbs<br>-Anda (Egg) 1<br>-Oil/Ghee 3-4 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) as required<br>-Anday (Eggs) 2<br>-Pyaz (Onion) 2 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) Chopped 1 (Optional)<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Tamatar (Tomato) Chopped 2<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander)<br>-Ghee/Oil for frying<br>-Mozzarella cheese (Grated) as required<br><br>Directions:<br>-In bowl,add flour,salt,sugar,egg,oil and mix.<br>-Add water and knead well to form a dough,cover and let it rest for 20 minutes.<br>-In bowl,add eggs,onion,green chilies,red chili powder,salt,cumin powder,tomato and green coriander, whisk well.<br>-Apply oil and knead again to make smooth dough.<br>-Take a small dough and coat in dry flour,roll out dough into round shape with the help of rolling pin.<br>-Spread oil and dry flour evenly,fold from both opposite sides,apply oil and again fold both opposite sides,it will be square.<br>-Dust in dry flour and roll out dough with the help of rolling pin.<br>-On griddle,keep flame low,place dough,add egg mixture and mozzarella cheese,apply ghee/oil and fold the paratha from both sides and again fold the remaining sides,it should be sealed completely.<br>-Fry paratha from both sides with ghee/oil.<br>-Serve hot with spicy chutney.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Atta (Flour) 2 Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ tbs<br>-Anda (Egg) 1<br>-Oil/Ghee 3-4 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) as required<br>-Anday (Eggs) 2<br>-Pyaz (Onion) 2 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) Chopped 1 (Optional)<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Tamatar (Tomato) Chopped 2<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander)<br>-Ghee/Oil for frying<br>-Mozzarella cheese (Grated) as required<br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein atta,namak,cheeni,anda aur oil dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Pani dal ker dough ko ache tarhan ghond lein,dhak ker 20 minute kliya rakh dein.<br>-Bowl mein anday,pyaz,hari mirch,lal mirch powder,namak,zeera powder,tamatar aur hara dhania dal ache tarhan whisk ker lein<br>-Oil laga ker dough ko dubara smooth hunay tak ghond lein.<br>-Small dough ko atta mein coat ker ka rough shape mein rolling pin ki madad sa bail lein.<br>-Oil laga ker atta chirak dein,dono opposite sides sa fold ker lein,oil laga ker dubara opposite sides ko fold ker lein,square shape bun jaye.<br>-Atta laga ker dough ko rolling pin ki madad sa bail lein.<br>-Halki ancch per tawa per dough dal dein,egg mixture aur mozzarella cheese dal dein,ghee/oil dal ker paratha ko dono sides sa fold ker lein aur baqi sides ko bhi fold ker lein,completely seal ho jaye.<br>-Paratha ko dono sides sa ghee/oil mein fry ker lein.<br>-Spicy chutney ka saath garam serve karein.</p>','',26,'2RS1wMixze8','','active','','2017-07-14 10:48:37','Lifafa(Envelop) Egg Paratha ','','Lifafa Egg Paratha\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Atta (Flour) 2 Cups\r\n-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste\r\n-Cheeni (Sug