s) Â½ tbs<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) Â½ tbs<br>-Laung (Cloves) Â½ tsp<br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 14-15<br>-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 1<br>-Sabut kali mirch (Black pepper corns) Â½ tbs<br>-Dried lemon/Lime 2<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) 1 tsp<br>-Oil Â¼ Cup<br>-Pyaz (Onion) cubes 1 large<br>-Lehsan (Garlic) cloves 5-6<br>-Mutton large pieces 700 gms<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Special spice mix 3 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) 5-6 Cups <br>-Dried lemon/Lime 1<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Tomato paste 2 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp<br>-Special spice mix 1 tsp<br>-Pani (Water) 2-3 tbs<br>-Chawal (Rice) Basmati Â½ kg (soaked for 1 hour)<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Tomato paste 2 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp<br>-Special spice mix 1 tsp<br>-Pani (Water) 2-3 tbs<br>Assembling:<br>-Oil 1 tbs <br>-Baigan (Egg plants) deep fried slices<br>-Aloo (Potatoes) deep fried slices <br>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) sautÃ© in 1 tbs oil<br>-Pyaz (Onion) sautÃ© in 1 tbs oil<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) sautÃ© in 1 tbs oil<br>-Cooked meat <br>-Tomato flavored rice<br>-Remaining cooked rice <br>-Pani (Water) 1-2 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>For Special spice mix:<br>-In frying pan,add coriander seeds,cumin seeds,cloves,green cardamom,cinnamon stick,black pepper corns,dried lemon/lime and roast until fragrant,set aside & let it cool.<br>-In spice mill,add roasted spices and grind well.<br>-Sift the grinded powder spices,add turmeric powder and mix well & set aside.<br>-In pot,add oil and onion,garlic cloves and sautÃ© until translucent.<br>-Add mutton and mix well for 4-5 minutes.<br>-Add black pepper powder,salt and 3 tbs of special spice mix & mix well.<br>-Add water,dried lemon/lime,mix well and bring it to boil,cover and cook until meat is tender (40-50 minutes).<br>-In frying pan,add oil and tomato paste,salt,1 tsp of special spice mix,water and mix well,cook for 2 minutes and set aside.<br>-Remove the cooked meat,dried lemon and set aside.<br>-Add basmati rice and mix well,add salt and mix,bring it to boil,cover & cook on low flame until water is reduced.<br>-Remove half quantity of cooked rice and set aside.<br>-Add tomato sauce in the remaining cooked rice and mix well & set aside.<br>Assembling:<br>-In pot,grease bottom with oil,place deep fried eggplant slices,fried potato slices,fried tomato slices,fried capsicum and fried onion rings.<br>-Add cooked meat,fried capsicum,fried tomato,add layer of tomato flavored rice and press gently.<br>-Now add deep fried potato slices,deep fried eggplant slices,fried onion rings,fried capsicum and add a layer of remaining cooked rice and press gently.<br>-Drizzle water,cover and steam cook on low flame for 5-6 minutes.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Directions:<br>For Special spice mix:<br>-Frying pan mein dhania,zeera,laung,hari elaichi,darchini,sabut kali mirch aur dried lemon/lime dal ker khushbu anay tak roast ker lein & thanda ker lein.<br>-Spice mill mein roasted spices dal ker ache tarhan grind ker lein.<br>-Grinded powder spices ko sift ker lein aur haldee powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Pot mein oil,pyaz aur lehsan cloves ko dal ker translucent hunay tak sautÃ© ker lein.<br>-Mutton dal ker 4-5 minutes kliya ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Kali mirch powder,namak aur 3 tbs special spice mix dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Pani aur dried lemon/lime dal ker ache tarhan mix karein,ubal anay ka bad dhak dein aur ghost gul Janay tak paka lein (40-50 minutes).<br>-Frying pan mein oil,tomato paste,namak,1 tsp special spice mix aur pani dal ker ache tarhna mix karein aur 2 minutes kliya paka lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Cooked ghost aur dried lemon ko nikla ker side per rakh dein.<br>-Basmati chawal dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein,namak dal ker mix karein,ubal anay ka bad dhak dein aur pani sukh janay tak paka lein.<br>-Cooked chawal ki half quantity nikla ker side per rakh dein.<br>-Tomato sauce ko bachay hoye chawal mein dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>Assembling:<br>-Pot ko oil sa grease ker lein,deep fried baigan slices,deep fried aloo slices,fried tamatar slices,fried shimla mirch aur fried pyaz rings ko rakh dein.<br>-Cooked meat,fried shimla mirch,fried tamatar dal dein,tomato flavored chawal ki layer laga lein aur halka sa press ker lein.<br>-Ab is mein fried aloo slices,deep fried baigan slices,fried pyaz rings,fried shimla mirch dal ker upper sa remaining cooked chawal ki layer laga lein aur halka sa press ker lein.<br>-Pani dal ker dhak dein aur 5-6 minutes kliya halki ancch per steam cook ker lein.</p>','',26,'jx6EgofxbHo','','active','','2017-07-17 18:32:25','Makloubeh Recip','','Makhloubeh Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nSpecial Spice Mix:\r\n-Dhania (Coriander seeds) Â½ tbs\r\n-Zeera (Cumin seeds) Â½ tbs\r\n-Laung (Cloves) Â½ tsp\r\n-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 14-15\r\n-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 1\r\n-Sabut kali mirch (Black pepper c',12,'youtube',''),(263,'Chicken Shahjahani Korma','<p>Shahjahani Qorma Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¾ Cup <br>-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) 1 tsp<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 3 tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 & Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Pyaz (Onion) fried 1 large<br>-Badam (Almonds) blanched & grinded 3 tbs<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¼ Cup<br>-Ghee Â¾ Cup<br>-Baadiyan ka phool (Star anise) 1<br>-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 1<br>-Sabut kali mirch (Black pepper corns) 10-12<br>-Badi elaichi (Black cardamom) 2<br>-Hari eliachi (Green cardamom) 7-8<br>-Laung (Cloves) 5-6<br>-Tez paat (Bay leaves) 2<br>-Adrak lehsan powder (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tsp<br>-Chicken (Qorma cut) 1 kg<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as required<br>-Garam masala powder 1 tsp<br>-Jaifil & javatri powder (Nutmeg & mace powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Kewra water Â½ tsp<br>-Adrak (Ginger) julienne Â½ inch piece<br>-Kaju (Cashew nuts) 6-8<br>-Badam (Almonds) blanched & sliced 6-8<br><br>Directions:<br>-In bowl,add yogurt,cumin powder,coriander powder,turmeric powder,red chili powder and salt,mix well & set aside.<br>-In blender,add fried onion,almonds,yogurt and blend until well combined & set aside.<br>-In pot,add ghee and let it melt,add star anise,cinnamon stick,black pepper corns,black cardamom, green cardamom,cloves,bay leaves and mix.<br>-Add ginger garlic paste and mix well.<br>-Add spiced yogurt and mix well,cover & cook for 3 minutes.<br>-Add chicken and cook until chicken changes color,cover & cook for 4-5 minutes.<br>-Add onion & almond mixture,mix well & cook for 10-12 minutes.<br>-Add water and mix well.<br>-Add garam masala powder,nutmeg & mace powder,kewra water,ginger,cashew nuts,almonds and mix well.<br>-Cover and put it on simmer for 2 minutes or until oil separates.<br>-Garnish with ginger & almonds.<br>Recipe in Urdu:<br>Ajza:<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¾ Cup <br>-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) 1 tsp<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 3 tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 & Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Pyaz (Onion) fried 1 large<br>-Badam (Almonds) blanched & grinded 3 tbs<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¼ Cup<br>-Ghee Â¾ Cup<br>-Baadiyan ka phool (Star anise) 1<br>-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 1<br>-Sabut kali mirch (Black pepper corns) 10-12<br>-Badi elaichi (Black cardamom) 2<br>-Hari eliachi (Green cardamom) 7-8<br>-Laung (Cloves) 5-6<br>-Tez paat (Bay leaves) 2<br>-Adrak lehsan powder (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tsp<br>-Chicken (Qorma cut) 1 kg<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as required<br>-Garam masala powder 1 tsp<br>-Jaifil & javatri powder (Nutmeg & mace powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Kewra water Â½ tsp<br>-Adrak (Ginger) julienne Â½ inch piece<br>-Kaju (Cashew nuts) 6-8<br>-Badam (Almonds) blanched & sliced 6-8<br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein dahi,zeera powder,dhania powder,haldee powder,lal mirch powder aur namak dal ker ache tarhan mix karein & side per rakh dein.<br>-Blender mein fried pyaz,badam aur dahi dal ker ache tarhan blend ker lein & side per rakh dein.<br>-Pot mein ghee dal ker melt ker lein,baadiyan ka phool,darchini,sabut kali mirch,badi elaichi,hari elaichi, laung aur tez paat dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Adrak lehsan paste dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Spiced dahi shamil karein aur ache tarhan mix ker lein aur dhak ker 3 minutes kliya paka lein.<br>-Chicken dal dein aur chicken ka rang tabdeel hunay tak paka lein,dhak ker 4-5 minutes kliya paka lein.<br>-Pyaz & badam mixture shamil karein aur ache tarhan mix karein aur 10-12 minutes kliya paka lein.<br>-Pani dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Garam masala powder,jaifil & javatri powder,kewra water,adrak,kaju aur badam dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Dhak dein aur 2 minutes ya oil alag hunay tak dum per rakh dein.<br>-Adrak aur badam sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'4hw9qkxAYsY','','active','','2017-07-17 18:34:17','Chicken Shahjahani Korma','','Shahjahani Qorma Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¾ Cup \r\n-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) 1 tsp\r\n-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 3 tsp\r\n-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp\r\n-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tbs\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 ',10,'youtube',''),(264,'Smokey Chicken Biryani ','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Chicken (Biryani cut) 12 pieces<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ kg<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tbs<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 tbs<br>-Zeera (Cumin) roasted & crushed Â½ tbs<br>-Garam masala 1 tsp<br>-Jaifil powder (Nutmeg powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Javitri powder (Mace powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tbs or to taste<br>-Lemon juice 4 tbs<br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â¼ tsp<br>-Oil 1 Cup<br>-Pyaz (Onion) sliced Â½ kg<br>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) sliced 2-3 medium<br>-Aloo bukhara (Dried plums) 6-8<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) slit 5-6<br>-Koyla (Coal) for smoke <br>-Podina (Mint leaves) 1 bunch<br>-Chawal (Rice) Basmati sella 1 kg (soaked 30 minutes) (Parboiled with lemon juice,salt,whole spices)<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 2 tbs<br>-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 2 <br>-Tez paat (Bay leaf) 2<br>-Laung (Cloves) 2-3<br>-Pyaz (Onion) fried <br>-Adrak (Ginger) julienne <br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â½ tsp dissolve in 2-3 tbs water<br><br>Directions:<br>-Boil rice with lemon juice,salt,cinnamon sticks,bay leaf and cloves,boil until Â¾ th done,strain and set aside.<br>-In bowl,add chicken pieces,yogurt,ginger garlic paste,red chili powder,coriander powder,cumin,garam masala,nutmeg powder,mace powder,salt,lemon juice,yellow food color,mix well and marinate for 2 hours.<br>-In pot,add oil,onion and fry until brown,take out half of the fried onions and set aside.<br>-Add tomatoes and mix well.<br>-Add dried plums,green chilies and mix well.<br>-Now add marinated chicken,turn off the heat and give a coal smoke for 3 minutes then remove coal.<br>-Turn on heat,mix well and cover & cook on low flame until chicken is done (8-10 minutes).<br>-Add mint leaves,mix well and cook on high flame until oil separates.<br>-Add boiled rice half,fried onion,remaining boiled rice,fried onion,food color dissolve in water and ginger,cover and steam cook on low flame for 10-15 minutes.<br>-Smokey chicken biryani is ready,serve with raita.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Chicken (Biryani cut) 12 pieces<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ kg<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tbs<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 tbs<br>-Zeera (Cumin) roasted & crushed Â½ tbs<br>-Garam masala 1 tsp<br>-Jaifil powder (Nutmeg powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Javitri powder (Mace powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tbs or to taste<br>-Lemon juice 4 tbs<br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â¼ tsp<br>-Oil 1 Cup<br>-Pyaz (Onion) sliced Â½ kg<br>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) sliced 2-3 medium<br>-Aloo bukhara (Dried plums) 6-8<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) slit 5-6<br>-Koyla (Coal) for smoke <br>-Podina (Mint leaves) 1 bunch<br>-Chawal (Rice) Basmati sella 1 kg (soaked 30 minutes) (Parboiled with lemon juice,salt,whole spices)<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 2 tbs<br>-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 2 <br>-Tez paat (Bay leaf) 2<br>-Laung (Cloves) 2-3<br>-Pyaz (Onion) fried <br>-Adrak (Ginger) julienne <br>-Zarda ka rang (Yellow food color) Â½ tsp dissolve in 2-3 water<br><br>Directions:<br>-Chawal ko lemon juice,namak,darchini,tez paat aur laung ka saath Â¾ th boil ker lein aur strain ker ka side per rakh dein.<br>-Bowl mein chicken pieces,dahi,adrak lehsan paste,lal mirch powder,dhania powder,zeera,garam masala,jaifil powder,javatri powder,namak,lemon juice aur zarda ka rang dal ker ache tarhan mix ke lein aur 2 hours kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Pot mein oil aur pyaz dal ker brown fry ker lein,adhe fried pyaz bahir nikal lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Tamatar dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Aloo bukhara aur hari mirch dal ker mix karein.<br>-Ab is mein marinated chicken dal dein,chulha bund ker dein aur 3 minutes kliya koyla ka dhuwan dein aur phir koyla ko hata lein.<br>-Chulha on karein aur ache tarhan mix karein,dhak dein aur halki ancch per chicken gul janay tak paka lein (8-10 minutes).<br>-Podina dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur tez ancch per oil alag hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Chawal boiled adhay dal dein,fried pyaz,baqi bachay hoye chawal,fried pyaz,zarda ka rang pani mein dissolve ker ka dal dein,adrak dal ker dhak dein aur 10-15 minutes kliya steam cook ker lein.<br>-Smokey chicken biryani tayyar hai,raita ka saath serve karein.</p>','',26,'_NmDq_ZbrC0','','active','','2017-07-17 18:35:15','Smokey Chicken Biryani ','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Chicken (Biryani cut) 12 pieces\r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ kg\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 2 tbs\r\n-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 & Â½ tbs\r\n-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 tbs\r\n-Zeera (Cumin) roasted &',10,'youtube',''),(265,'Pizza Without Oven','<p><br>BBQ Chicken Pizza with Pizza Sauce without Oven Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>Chicken Tikka Filling:<br>-Chicken boneless Â½ kg<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tsp<br>-Lal mirch (Red chili) Crushed 1 tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Oil 2 tbs for frying<br>-Coal for smoke<br><br>Homemade Pizza Sauce:<br>-Oil 2 tbs<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Finely chopped 1 Medium<br>-Lehsan (Garlic) 1 tbs<br>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) Finely chopped 2 Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp<br>-Tomato ketchup 1 Cup<br>-Safed mirch (White pepper) 1 tsp<br>-Brown sugar 1 tbs<br>-Soy sauce 1 tbs<br>-Worcestershire sauce 1 tbs<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Dried oregano 1 tsp<br>-Dried basil leaves 1 tsp<br>-Lal mirch (Red chili) Crushed 1 tsp or to taste<br>Pizza Dough:<br>-Neem garam doodh (Warm milk) Â¾ Cup<br>-Neem garam pani (Warm water) Â¾ Cup<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 3 & Â½ Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tsp<br>-Khameer (Dry instant yeast) 2 tsp<br>-Makhan (Butter) Soften 2 tbs<br>-Anda (Egg) 1<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br><br>Assembling:<br>-Pizza sauce<br>-Cheddar cheese<br>-Chicken tikka filling<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Sliced<br>-Olives<br>-Mozzarella cheese<br>-Jalapenos<br>-Oregano to sprinkle<br>-Lal mirch (Red chili) Crushed<br><br>Directions:<br>For Chicken Tikka Filling: In bowl,add chicken,lemon juice,ginger garlic paste,red chili crushed,red chili powder,salt and coriander powder,mix and marinate for 15-20 minutes.<br>-In frying pan,add oil and marinated chicken,fry until chicken is done and give a coal smoke for 1-2 minutes,set aside.<br>For Homemade Pizza Sauce: In frying pan,add oil and onion,saute until translucent.<br>-Add garlic and tomatoes,cook until tomatoes are soft.<br>-Add salt,tomato ketchup,white pepper,brown sugar,soy sauce,worcestershire sauce,red chili powder, dried oregano,dried basil leaves and red chili crushed and cook until sauce thickens, set aside.<br>For Pizza Dough: In milk,add water and mix.<br>-In bowl,add all-purpose flour,salt,sugar,instant yeast,butter,egg and mix.<br>-Add milk+water mixture,mix & knead to form dough.<br>-Add oil,cover and let it sit for 2 hour or until dough is doubled in size.<br>-Add oil and knead again.<br>Assembling: Take dough and make a ball, press the dough ball and flattened it, make a round shaped dough,prick with fork.<br>-Spread pizza sauce,add cheddar cheese,chicken tikka filling,onion,olives,mozzarella cheese, jalapenos, oregano and red chili crushed,set aside for 15 minutes before baking.<br>-In pot,add 1 pack (800gms) of salt,place wire rack (min 2-3 inches high) and heat on high flame for 15 minutes.<br>-Place pizza, cover and let it cook for 10-15 minutes or until cheese melts (high flame).<br><br>Pizza without oven Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Directions:<br>For Chicken Tikka Filling: Bowl mein chicken,lemon juice,adrak lehsan paste,lal mirch crushed,lal mirch powder,namak aur dhania powder dal ker mix karein aur 15-20 minute kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Frying pan mein oil aur marinated chicken dal ker chicken pak janay tak fry ker lein aur 1-2 minute kliya koyla ka dhuwa dein,side per rakh dein.<br>For Homemade Pizza Sauce: Frying pan mein oil aur pyaz dal ker translucent hunay tak saute karein.<br>-Lehsan aur tamatar dal ker tamatar naram hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Namak,tomato ketchup,safed mirch,brown sugar,soy sauce,worcestershire sauce,lal mirch powder,dried oregano,dried basil leaves aur lal mirch crushed dal ker sauce garha hunay tak paka lein,side per rakh dein.<br>For Pizza Dough: Doodh mein pani dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Bowl mein maida,namak,cheeni,khameer,makhan aur anda dal ker mix karein.<br>-Milk+water mixture shamil karein aur ghond ker dough tayyar ker lein.<br>-Oil dal ker ghond lein aur dhak ker 2 hour ya dough ka size double hunay tak rakh dein.<br>-Oil dal ker dubara ghond lein.<br>Assembling: Dough ki ball bana lein aur daba ker flat ker lein,round shape dough tayyar ker lein,fork ki madad sa prick karein.<br>-Pizza sauce dal ker pheela lein,cheddar cheese,chicken tikka filling,pyaz,mozzarella cheese,jalapenos, oregano aur lal micrh crushed dal dein,15 minute kliya side per rakh dein.<br>-Pot mein namak ka 1 pack (800 gms) dal ker wire rack (min 2-3 inches high) rakh dein aur tez annch per 15 minute kliya garam karein.<br>-Pizza rakh ker dhak dein aur 10-15 minute ya cheese melt hunay tak tez ancch per paka lein.</p>','',26,'yohIMERveHI','','active','','2017-07-17 18:36:37','Pizza Without Oven','','\r\nBBQ Chicken Pizza with Pizza Sauce without Oven Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nChicken Tikka Filling:\r\n-Chicken boneless Â½ kg\r\n-Lemon juice 1 tbs\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tsp\r\n-Lal mirch (Red chili) Crushed 1 tsp\r\n-Lal mirch po',11,'youtube',''),(266,'Mantu ','<p>Mantu</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>Yogurt Sauce:<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) whisked 1 Cup<br>-Lehsan paste (Garlic paste) 1 tsp<br>Prepare Lentil topping (Chana Daal):<br>-Oil 4-5 tbs<br>-Pyaz (Onion) sliced 1 medium<br>-Adrak (Ginger) chopped 1 tbs<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) 1 tsp<br>-Tomato paste 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Chanay ki daal (Split bengal gram) boiled 1 Cup<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup<br>Prepare Mince:<br>-Oil 2-3 tbs<br>-Beef qeema (Beef mince) 500 gms<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 & Â½ tsp<br>-Pyaz (Onion) finely chopped 6 medium <br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tbs<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 tsp<br>-Garam masala powder 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) chopped 4<br>-Podina (Mint leaves) chopped Â½ Cup<br>-Hara dhania (Fresh coriander) chopped Â½ Cup<br>Prepare Dough & Dumplings:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 2 Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as required<br>-Pani (Water) 2-3 Cups<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander)<br><br>Directions:<br>Yogurt Sauce:<br>-In bowl,add yogurt,garlic paste and whisk well & set aside.<br>Prepare Lentil topping (Chana Daal):<br>-In wok,add oil and onion,fry until golden brown.<br>-Add ginger and mix.<br>-Add turmeric powder,tomato paste and mix well.<br>-Add salt and mix well.<br>-Add split bengal gram with remaining water and mix well.<br>-Add water and mix well,cover and put it on simmer for 6-8 minutes.<br>Prepare Mince:<br>-In pot,add oil,beef mince and mix well until water dries.<br>-Add ginger garlic paste and mix well.<br>-Add onion and mix,add black pepper powder,red chili powder,coriander powder,garam masala powder, salt and mix well.<br>-Add green chilies,mint leaves,fresh coriander and mix well.<br>-Cover and cook on low flame for 4-5 minutes.<br>Prepare Dough & Dumplings:<br>-In all-purpose flour,add salt and mix,gradually add water and knead well until dough is formed.<br>-Cover and let it rest for 20 minutes and knead dough again until smooth dough is formed.<br>-Cut the dough into four equal portions,take a small dough and make a ball.<br>-Roll out flat dough with the help of rolling pin and with the help of the cutter,cut the dough into four equal square piece.<br>-Take one square piece,apply water at the edges and add mince filling,fold all four sides with each other and press the edges tightly to seal together.Continue doing this with the remaining dumplings.<br>-In pot,add water and bring it to boil,place steam rack and grease the steam rack with oil.<br>-Now place dumplings on steam rack,cover and steam cook for 15-20 minutes.<br>Assembling:<br>-On serving plate,spread yogurt sauce,place dumplings,pour yogurt sauce,sprinkle red chili flakes,add cooked mince and chana lentil topping & garnish with green coriander.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Directions:<br>Yogurt Sauce:<br>-Bowl mein dahi aur lehsan paste dal ker ache tarhan whisk karein aur side per rakh dein.<br>Prepare Lentil topping (Chana Daal):<br>-Karhai mein oil aur pyaz dal ker golden brown fry ker lein.<br>-Adrak dal ker mix karein.<br>-Haldee powder aur tomato paste dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Namak dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Chanay ki daal pani ka saath dal ker ache tarhan mix karein.<br>-Pani dal ker mix ker lein,dhak ker 6-8 minutes kliya dum per rakh dein.<br>Prepare Mince:<br>-Pot mein oil aur beef qeema dal dein aur pani sukh janay tak ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Adrak lehsan paste dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Pyaz dal ker mix karein,kali mirch powder,lal mirch powder,dhania powder,garam masala powder<br>aur namak dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Hari mirch,podina aur hara dhania dal ker ache tarhan mix karein.<br>-Dhak dein aur halki ancch per 4-5 minutes kliya paka lein.<br>Prepare Dough & Dumplings:<br>-Maida mein namak dal ker mix karein,thora thora ker ka pani shamil karein aur ghond ker dough tayyar ker lein.<br>-Dhak ker 20 minutes kliya rakh dein,dubara ghond ker smooth dough tayyar ker lein.<br>-Dough ko four equal parts mein cut ker lein,chota dough lein aur ball bana lein.<br>-Dough ko rolling pin ki madad sa patla bail lein aur cutter ki madad sa dough ko four equal square piece mein cut ker lein.<br>-Ek square piece lein,edges per pani laga lein aur qeema filling rakh dein,tamam four sides ko ek saath fold ker lein aur edges ko tightly seal ker lein.Is he tarhan tamam dumplings tayyar ker lein.<br>-Pot mein pani dal ker ubal lein,steam rack rakh dein aur stream rack ko oil sa grease ker lein.<br>-Ab steam rack per dumplings rakh dein,dhak ker 15-20 minutes kliya steam cook ker lein.<br>Assembling:<br>-Serving palte mein dahi sauce pheela lein,dumplings rakh dein,upper sa dahi sauce dal dein,red chili flakes sprinkle karein,cooked qeema aur chanay ki daal topping dal dein aur hara dhania sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'7RVhb5TJFmg','','active','','2017-07-17 18:41:44','Mantu ','','Mantu\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nYogurt Sauce:\r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) whisked 1 Cup\r\n-Lehsan paste (Garlic paste) 1 tsp\r\nPrepare Lentil topping (Chana Daal):\r\n-Oil 4-5 tbs\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) sliced 1 medium\r\n-Adrak (Ginger) chopped 1 tbs\r\n-Haldee powder (T',11,'youtube',''),(267,'Chicken Chow Mein','<p><br>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>Chow mein sauce:<br>-Oyster sauce 1 tbs<br>-Soy sauce 2 tbs<br>-Sesame oil 1 tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tbs (optional)<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Corn flour 2 tbs <br>-Chicken boneless cut in strips 250 gms<br>-Chow mein sauce 1 tbs <br>-Oil 2 tbs<br>-Lehsan (Garlic) finely chopped 1 tbs<br>-Gajar (Carrot) julienne Â½ Cup<br>-Bund gobhi (Cabbage) shredded 2 Cups<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) julienne Â½ Cup<br>-Hara pyaz ka safed hissa (Green onion white part) julienne Â¼ Cup <br>-Sirka (Vinegar) 2 tbs<br>-Chow mein or Egg noodles (Boiled) 1 & Â½ Cups<br>-Yakhni (Chicken stock) Â¼ Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Hara pyaz (Green onion) julienne Â½ Cup<br>-Kali mirch (Black pepper) crushed Â½ tsp<br><br>Directions:<br>-In bowl,add oyster sauce,soy sauce,sesame oil,sugar,black pepper powder,white pepper powder,corn flour and mix well.Chow Mein sauce is ready.<br>-In chicken,add 1 tbs of chow mein sauce,mix well and marinate for 15 minutes.<br>-In wok,add oil,garlic and marinated chicken,stir-fry until chicken changes color.<br>-Add carrot and mix,add cabbage,capsicum,green onion white part and stir fry for 1-2 minutes.<br>-Add remaining chow mein sauce,vinegar and mix well.<br>-Add chow mein or egg noodles,chicken stock,salt,green onion and stir-fry for 2-3 minutes on high flame.<br>-Sprinkle black pepper crushed and serve.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Chow mein sauce:<br>-Oyster sauce 1 tbs<br>-Soy sauce 2 tbs<br>-Sesame oil 1 tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tbs (optional)<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Corn flour 2 tbs <br>-Chicken boneless cut in strips 250 gms<br>-Chow mein sauce 1 tbs <br>-Oil 2 tbs<br>-Lehsan (Garlic) finely chopped 1 tbs<br>-Gajar (Carrot) julienne Â½ Cup<br>-Bund gobhi (Cabbage) shredded 2 Cups<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) julienne Â½ Cup<br>-Hara pyaz ka safed hissa (Green onion white part) julienne Â¼ Cup <br>-Sirka (Vinegar) 2 tbs<br>-Chow mein or Egg noodles (Boiled) 1 & Â½ Cups<br>-Yakhni (Chicken stock) Â¼ Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Hara pyaz (Green onion) julienne Â½ Cup<br>-Kali mirch (Black pepper) crushed Â½ tsp<br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein oyster sauce,soy sauce,sesame oil,kali mirch powder,safed mirch powder aur corn flour dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.Chow mein sauce tayyar hai.<br>-Chicken mein 1 tbs chow mein sauce dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur 15 minutes kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Karhai mein oil,lehsan aur marinated chicken dal ker chicken ka rang tabdeel hunay tak stir-fry ker lein.<br>-Gajar dal ker mix karein,bund gobhi aur hara pyaz ka safed hissa dal ker 1-2 minutes kliya stir fry ker lein.<br>-Baqi chow mein sauce aur sirka dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Chow mein or egg noodles,yakhni,namak aur hara pyaz dal ker 2-3 minutes kiya tez ancch per stir-fry ker lein.<br>-Kali mirch crushed dal ker serve karein.</p>','',26,'mCys5ND7r7s','','active','','2017-07-17 18:44:44','Chicken Chow Mein','','\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nChow mein sauce:\r\n-Oyster sauce 1 tbs\r\n-Soy sauce 2 tbs\r\n-Sesame oil 1 tsp\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tbs (optional)\r\n-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp\r\n-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) Â½ tsp\r\n-Corn flo',10,'youtube',''),(268,'Chicken Fajita Pasta ','<p>Chicken Fajita Pasta Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Chicken julienne cut 250 gms<br>-Lemon juice 1-2 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp<br>-Kali mirch (Black pepper) Ground Â½ tsp<br>Fajita Seasoning:<br>-Paprika powder Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) Â½ tbs<br>-Kali mirch (Black pepper) Ground Â½ tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp<br>-Lehsan powder (Garlic powder) Â½ tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp<br>-Oil 2 tsp<br>-Oil 1-2 tsp<br>-Peeli shimla mirch (Yellow bell pepper) Julienne cut 1<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) Julienne cut 1<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Sliced 1<br>-Lehsan (Garlic) Chopped Â½ tbs<br>-Fajita seasoning 1 tsp<br>-Oil 2 tbs<br>-Tamatar (Tomato) Chopped 2-3<br>-Fajita seasoning 1 tbs<br>-Penne pasta cooked (as per packet instructions) 2 Cups<br>-Cream Â¾ Cup<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 Cup<br>-Cheddar cheese Â½ Cup<br>-Mixed herbs or Oregano<br><br>Direction:<br>-In bowl,add chicken julienne,lemon juice,salt,black pepper and marinate for 30 minutes.<br>-For Fajita seasoning,in bowl,add paprika powder,cumin powder,black pepper,red chili powder, garlic powder and salt,mix well.Fajita seasoning is ready.<br>-In wok,add oil add marinated chicken and mix until chicken is done,set aside.<br>-In wok,add oil,yellow bell pepper,capsicum,onion,garlic and fajita seasoning, sautÃ© for 2-3 minutes and set aside.<br>-In wok,add oil,tomatoes,fajita seasoning,cook until tomatoes are soft,add cooked chicken,penne pasta cooked, vegetables and mix well.<br>-Add cream,milk and cheddar cheese,mix well.<br>-Sprinkle mixed herbs or oregano and serve.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Chicken julienne cut 250 gms<br>-Lemon juice 1-2 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp<br>-Kali mirch (Black pepper) Ground Â½ tsp<br>Fajita Seasoning:<br>-Paprika powder Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) Â½ tbs<br>-Kali mirch (Black pepper) Ground Â½ tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp<br>-Lehsan powder (Garlic powder) Â½ tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp<br>-Oil 2 tsp<br>-Oil 1-2 tsp<br>-Peeli shimla mirch (Yellow bell pepper) Julienne cut 1<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) Julienne cut 1<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Sliced 1<br>-Lehsan (Garlic) Chopped Â½ tbs<br>-Fajita seasoning 1 tsp<br>-Oil 2 tbs<br>-Tamatar (Tomato) Chopped 2-3<br>-Fajita seasoning 1 tbs<br>-Penne pasta cooked (as per packet instructions) 2 Cups<br>-Cream Â¾ Cup<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 Cup<br>-Cheddar cheese Â½ Cup<br>-Mixed herbs or Oregano<br><br>Direction:<br>-Bowl mein chicken julienne,lemon juice,namak aur kali mirch dal ker 30 minute kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Fajita seasoning kliya,bowl mein paprika powder,zeera powder,kali mirch,lal mirch powder, lehsan powder aur namak dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.Fajita seasoning tayyar hai.<br>-Karhai mein oil aur marinated chicken dal ker chicken pak janay tak mix ker lein,side per rakh dein.<br>-Karhai mein oil,peeli shimla mirch,shimla mirch,pyaz,lehsan aur fajita seasoning dal ker 2-3 minute kliya saute ker lein, side per rakh dein.<br>-Karhai mein oil,tamatar,fajita seasoning dal ker tamatar naram hunay tak paka lein,cooked chicken, penne pasta cooked aur vegetables dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Cream,doodh aur cheddar cheese dal ker ache tarhan mix karein.</p>','',26,'E-rqG-2F9ks','','active','','2017-07-17 18:48:33','Chicken Fajita Pasta ','','Chicken Fajita Pasta Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Chicken julienne cut 250 gms\r\n-Lemon juice 1-2 tbs\r\n-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp\r\n-Kali mirch (Black pepper) Ground Â½ tsp\r\nFajita Seasoning:\r\n-Paprika powder Â½ tsp\r\n-Zeera powder (Cumin powder) Â½ tbs\r\n-',10,'youtube',''),(269,'Rainbow Sandwich','<p>Rainbow Sandwiches in English</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>- Bread slices 8 Large (preferably one day old)<br>- Boiled Eggs 2 <br>- Mayonnaise Â¼ cup <br>- Mustard paste 2 tbsp<br>- Salt Â¼ tsp<br>- Black pepper Â¼ tsp<br>- Yellow food color a single drop<br>- Ketchup OR chili garlic sauce Â¼ cup<br>- Shredded Carrots Â½ cup (water drained)<br>- Red Food Color single drop<br>- Shredded Cucumber Â½ cup (water drained)<br>- * Green chilies 2-3<br>- * Fresh Coriander Â½ bunch<br>- * Salt Â¼ tsp<br>- * Lemon Juice Â½ tsp<br>- * Water 1-2 tbsp<br>- Green Food Color single drop<br>- Butter to spread on slices<br>Step 1:<br>- Make a paste of asterisk ingredients. <br>Step 2: <br>- Mash the eggs in bowl adding mayonnaise, mustard, salt, pepper and yellow color. Set aside. <br>- In a green paste added shredded cucumbers with green food color and set aside. <br>- In ketchup/chili garlic sauce add shredded carrots and red food color and set aside. <br>Assembling:<br>- Take four slices and butter them properly. <br>- Now add red batter and place a slice on it following by green and lastly by yellow. <br>- Once a sandwich ready cut all the corners<br>- Cut the sandwich in a way you like (diagnol or square)<br>- Serve with fried and coleslaw<br><br><br><br><br>Rainbow Sandwiches in Urdu:<br>Ingredients:<br>- Bread slices 8 Large (one day old)<br>- Boiled Anday 2 <br>- Mayonnaise Â¼ cup <br>- Mustard paste 2 tbsp<br>- Namak Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>- Kali mirch powder Â¼ tsp<br>- Yellow food color a single drop<br>- Ketchup OR chili garlic sauce Â¼ cup<br>- Shredded Gajar Â½ cup (water drained)<br>- Red Food Color single drop<br>- Shredded Kheera Â½ cup (water drained)<br>- * Hari Mirch 2-3<br>- * Fresh Dhania Â½ bunch<br>- * Namak Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>- * Lemon Juice Â½ tsp<br>- * PANI 1-2 tbsp<br>- Green Food Color single drop<br>- Makhan to spread on slices<br>Step 1:<br>- Asterisk ingredients ka paste bana lein<br>Step 2: <br>- Anday mash karein and is main mayonnaise. Mustard, nmak, kali mirch aur yellow color milaye. Alag rakh dein. <br>- Green paste main kheera aur hara rang milaye aura lag rakh dein. <br>- Ketchup/chili garlic sauce main shredded gajar aur lal rang milaye aur alag rakh dein. <br>Assembling:<br>- Chaar slices ko sahi se makhan lagaye<br>- Ab pehle slice pe lal batter lagaye aur uper dosri slice rakh dein. <br>- Phir hara batter aur phir slice aur akhir main peela batter and slice rakh dein. <br>- Jab sandwich ready hojaye to chaar konay kaat lein. <br>- Sandwich ko pasand ke mutabiq cut karke fries aur coleslaw ke saath serve karein.<br><br><br><br><br>Coleslaw Recipe in English<br><br>Ingredients:<br><br>- Finely sliced green cabbage 1 cup<br>- Shredded carrots 2 tbsp<br>- Mayonnaise Â½ cup <br>- Sugar 1 tsp<br>- Salt as per taste<br>- White pepper powder Â¼ tsp <br>Directions:<br>- Blanch cabbage: Bring water to boil, add sliced cabbage, boil for 1 minute and drain water. Add to cold water immediately to stop cooking. Drain properly again.<br>- Add blanched cabbage in a bowl. <br>- Add carrots, mayonnaise, salt, pepper, sugar and mix well. <br>- Chill and serve.<br><br><br><br><br>Coleslaw Recipe in Urdu<br><br>Ingredients:<br><br>- Finely sliced band gobi 1 cup<br>- Shredded gajar2 tbsp<br>- Mayonnaise Â½ cup <br>- Cheeni 1 tsp<br>- Namak as per taste<br>- White pepper powder Â¼ tsp <br>Directions:<br>- Blanch cabbage: Pani ko boil karein, is main band gobi 1 min ke daal ke nithar lein. Aur kuch dair thande pani main rakhden. Paani se nikal kar bowl main daal lain. <br>- Ab is main gajar, mayonnaise, namak, mirch aur cheeni daal ke mix karein. <br>- Thanda karke serve karein.</p>','',26,'yPJwgXNDrJs','','active','','2017-07-17 18:51:41','Rainbow Sandwich','','Rainbow Sandwiches in English\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n- Bread slices 8 Large (preferably one day old)\r\n- Boiled Eggs 2 \r\n- Mayonnaise Â¼ cup \r\n- Mustard paste 2 tbsp\r\n- Salt Â¼ tsp\r\n- Black pepper Â¼ tsp\r\n- Yellow food color a single drop\r\n- Ketchup OR chili gar',11,'youtube',''),(270,'Chicken Wonton ','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Chicken boneless 250 gms<br>-Hara pyaz (Green onion) chopped 2 Cups<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 7-8<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) 1 medium<br>-Soy sauce 1 tbs<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Chicken cube Â½ <br>-Oil 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Anda (Egg) beaten 1 <br>-Wonton wraps<br>-Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>-Pat dry chicken boneless cubes with kitchen tissue.<br>-In chopper,add chicken boneless cubes,green onion,green chilies,capsicum,soy sauce,black pepper powder,chicken cube,oil,salt and chop until well combined & set aside.<br>-Take wanton wrap,add 1 tbs mixture in the center,apply egg at the edges,fold in triangular shape & seal all sides.<br>-Apply egg on one side of triangle and overlap to form wonton shape (makes 25-30).<br>-In wok,heat oil and fry until golden brown.<br>-Can be stored up to one month in freezer.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Chicken boneless 250 gms<br>-Hara pyaz (Green onion) chopped 2 Cups<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 7-8<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) 1 medium<br>-Soy sauce 1 tbs<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Chicken cube Â½ <br>-Oil 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Anda (Egg) beaten 1 (for binding)<br>-Wonton wraps<br>-Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>-Chicken boneless cubes ko kitchen tissue sa pat dry ker lein.<br>-Chopper mein chicken boneless cubes,hara pyaz,hari mirch,shimla mirch,soy sauce,kali mirch powder, chicken cube,oil aur namak dal ker ache tarhan chop ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Wonton wrap ko center mein 1 tbs mixture rakh dein,edges mein anda laga lein,triangular shape mein fold ker lein & tamam sides ko seal ker lein.<br>-Triangle ka ek side per anda laga lein aur overlap ker ka wonton ki shape bana lein (makes 25-30).<br>-Karhai mein oil garam karein aur golden brown fry ker lein.<br>-Freezer mein 1 month tak store ker saktay han.</p>','',26,'p2aNZrynJ8o','','active','','2017-07-17 18:53:05','Chicken Wonton ','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Chicken boneless 250 gms\r\n-Hara pyaz (Green onion) chopped 2 Cups\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 7-8\r\n-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) 1 medium\r\n-Soy sauce 1 tbs\r\n-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) Â½ tsp\r\n-Chicken cube Â½',10,'youtube',''),(271,'Chicken & Cheese half moon','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>Sauce:<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup<br>-Soy sauce 2 tsp<br>-Oyster sauce 2 tsp<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) crushed 1 tbs<br>-Corn flour 1 tbs<br>Chicken Filling:<br>-Oil 2-3 tbs<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Chopped 1 medium<br>-Chicken mince (Chicken qeema) Â½ kg<br>-Adrak (Ginger) chopped 1 tbs<br>-Gajar (Carrot) chopped Â½ Cup<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) chopped Â½ Cup<br>-Matar (Peas) Â½ Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Dried parsley 1 tsp<br>Dough:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 2 Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp <br>-Ajwain (Carom seeds) Â½ tsp<br>-Ghee 3 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as required<br>-Mozzarella cheese grated Â½ Cup<br>-Cutter/Cookie cutter<br>-Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>For Sauce:<br>-In bowl,add water,soy sauce,oyster sauce,green chili crushed and corn flour,mix well and set aside.<br>For Chicken filling:<br>-In wok,add oil,onion and mix until translucent,add chicken mince and cook until it changes color.<br>-Add ginger,carrot,capsicum,peas,salt,black pepper powder and mix well.<br>-Add prepared sauce,mix well and cook until water is dried.<br>-Add dried parsley, mix well & let it cool.<br>For Dough:<br>-In bowl,add all-purpose flour,salt,carom seeds,ghee and mix well until crumbled.<br>-Gradually add water and knead until dough is formed,cover with a wet cloth and let it rest for 30 minutes.<br>-Wet your hands with water and knead dough again.<br>-Take a small dough,make a ball and coat in dry flour and roll out with the help of rolling pin.<br>-Take a dough,add chicken filling and mozzarella cheese,apply water at the edges,fold it and press and seal the edges with cookie cutter.<br>-In a wok,heat oil and fry on low flame until golden brown.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Sauce:<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup<br>-Soy sauce 2 tsp<br>-Oyster sauce 2 tsp<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) crushed 1 tbs<br>-Corn flour 1 tbs<br>Chicken Filling:<br>-Oil 2-3 tbs<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Chopped 1 medium<br>-Chicken mince (Chicken qeema) Â½ kg<br>-Adrak (Ginger) chopped 1 tbs<br>-Gajar (Carrot) chopped Â½ Cup<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) chopped Â½ Cup<br>-Matar (Peas) Â½ Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Dried parsley 1 tsp<br>Dough:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 2 Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp <br>-Ajwain (Carom seeds) Â½ tsp<br>-Ghee 3 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as required<br>-Mozzarella cheese grated Â½ Cup<br>-Cutter/Cookie cutter<br>-Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>For Sauce:<br>-Bowl mein pani,soy sauce,oyster sauce,hari mirch crushed aur corn flour dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>For Chicken filling:<br>-Karhai mein oil aur pyaz dal ker translucent hunay tak mix karein,chicken qeema dal ker rang tabdeel hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Adrak,gajar,shimla mirch,matar,namak aur kali mirch powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Prepared sauce dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur pani sukh janay tak paka lein.<br>-Dried parsley dal ker mix karein & thanda ker lein.<br>For Dough:<br>-Bowl mein maida,namak,ajwain aur ghee dal ker crumbles hunay tak mix ker lein.<br>-Thora thora ker ka pani shamil karein aur ghond ker dough tayyar ker lein,geelay kapray sa dhak ker 30 minutes kliya rakh dein.<br>-Haathon ko pani sa geela ker ka dough ko dubara ghond lein.<br>-Small dough la ker ball bana lein,atta mein coat ker ka rolling pin ki madad sa bail lein.<br>-Dough ko bail lein,chicken filling aur mozzarella cheese dal dein,edges per pani laga lein aur press ker ka edges ko cookie cutter ki madad sa seal ker lein.<br>-Karhai mein oil garam karein aur halki ancch per golden brown fry ker lein.</p>','',26,'3G9GF1uhA0Y','','active','','2017-07-17 18:59:12','Chicken & Cheese half moon','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nSauce:\r\n-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup\r\n-Soy sauce 2 tsp\r\n-Oyster sauce 2 tsp\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chili) crushed 1 tbs\r\n-Corn flour 1 tbs\r\nChicken Filling:\r\n-Oil 2-3 tbs\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) Chopped 1 medium\r\n-Chicken mince (Chicken qe',3,'youtube',''),(272,'Naan Pockets','<p>Naan Pockets Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>Tawa Naan:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 2 cups<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tsp<br>-Baking soda Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp<br>-Khameer (Dry instant yeast) 1 tsp<br>-Oil 1 tbs <br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¼ cup<br>-Pani (Water) Luke warm as required<br>Chicken:<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ cup<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) 1 tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tbs or to taste<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Lemon juice 3 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) Chopped 1 tbs<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander) 1 tbs<br>-Chicken small cubes Â½ kg<br>-Oil 2 tbs<br>Chutney:<br>-Podina (Mint leaves) 2 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) 4-5<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander) 3 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) to taste<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) Â½ tsp<br>-Mayonnaise 2-3 tbs<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¾ cup<br>Assembling:<br>-Naan<br>-Chicken<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Chopped<br>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) Chopped<br>-Band gobhi (Cabbage) Chopped<br>-Chutney<br><br>Directions:<br>For Tawa Naan:<br>-In bowl,add all-purpose flour,sugar,baking soda,salt,instant yeast,oil,yogurt and mix well.<br>-Add water and knead until dough is formed.<br>-Apply oil over the dough, cover and let it rest for 2-3 hours.<br>-Add oil and knead again.<br>-Now take a dough,makes 5-6 naans and coat in dry flour, roll the ball with the help of rolling pin into a flat round circle and prick with fork.<br>-Heat griddle and put round dough and cook from both sides.<br>For Chicken:<br>-In bowl,add yogurt,whole spice powder,red chili powder,salt,lemon juice,green chili,green coriander and mix well.<br>-Add chicken,mix well and marinate for 15-20 minutes.<br>-In frying pan,add oil and add marinated chicken,cook until chicken is done,set aside.<br>For Chutney:<br>-In grinder,add mint leaves,grren chili,green coriander,salt,cumin seeds,mayonnaise and yogurt, grind until smooth,set aside.<br>For Assembling:<br>-Take naam,add chicken,onion,tomato,cabbage and drizzle chutney.<br>-Cover one side of naan, pierce the tooth pick and serve with chutney.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Tawa Naan:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 2 cups<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tsp<br>-Baking soda Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp<br>-Khameer (Dry instant yeast) 1 tsp<br>-Oil 1 tbs <br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¼ cup<br>-Pani (Water) Luke warm as required<br>Chicken:<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ cup<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) 1 tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tbs or to taste<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Lemon juice 3 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) Chopped 1 tbs<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander) 1 tbs<br>-Chicken small cubes Â½ kg<br>-Oil 2 tbs<br>Chutney:<br>-Podina (Mint leaves) 2 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) 4-5<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander) 3 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) to taste<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) Â½ tsp<br>-Mayonnaise 2-3 tbs<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¾ cup<br>Assembling:<br>-Naan<br>-Chicken<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Chopped<br>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) Chopped<br>-Band gobhi (Cabbage) Chopped<br>-Chutney<br><br>Directions:<br>For Tawa Naan:<br>-Bowl mein maida,cheeni,baking soda,namak,khameer,oil aur dahi dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Pani shamil karein,ache tarhan ghoond ker dough tayyar ker lein.<br>-Dough per oil lagayein,dhak ker 2-3 hours kliya rakh dein.<br>-Oil dal ker dough ko dubara ghond lein.<br>-Ab dough ki 5-6 naan bana lein aur aata mein coat ker lein,rolling pin ki madad sa ball ko roll ker lein aur flat round circle bana lein,fork ki madad sa prick ker lein.<br>-Tawa ko garam karein aur round dough dal ker dono side sa paka lein.<br>For Chicken:<br>-Bowl mein dahi,garam masala powder,lal mirch powder,namak,leemo ka rus,hari mirch aur hara dhania dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Chicken dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur 15-20 minute kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Frying pan mein oil aur marinated chicken dal ker chicken pak janay tak paka lein,side per rakh dein.<br>For Chutney:<br>-Grinder mein podina,hari mirch,hara dhania,namak,zeera,mayonnaise aur dahi dalein, smmoth grind ker lein,side per rakh dein.<br>For Assembling:<br>-Naan per chicken,pyaz,tamatar,band gobhi aur chutney dal dein.<br>-Naan ko ek side sa cover ker ka tooth pick laga dein aur chutney ka saath serve karein.</p>','',26,'JzftcNHu-lI','','active','','2017-07-17 19:02:54','Naan Pockets','','Naan Pockets Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nTawa Naan:\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 2 cups\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tsp\r\n-Baking soda Â½ tsp\r\n-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp\r\n-Khameer (Dry instant yeast) 1 tsp\r\n-Oil 1 tbs \r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¼ cup\r\n-Pani (Water) Luke wa',27,'youtube',''),(273,'Chicken Shawarma | Home made Chicken shawarma','<p>Whole Wheat Shawarma</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>Whole Wheat Pita Bread:<br>-Aata (Whole wheat flour) 2 cups<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 cup<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ tbs<br>-Khameer (Dry instant yeast) 1 & Â½ tsp<br>-Olive oil 4-5 tbs<br>-Neem garam pani (Warm water) as required<br>Chicken:<br>-Chicken boneless Â½ kg<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) 3 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) Â½ tbs<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) 1 tsp<br>-Lemon juice Â½ tbs<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 & Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Olive oil 1 tbs<br>Fusion Tahini Sauce:<br>-Tahini paste 4 tbs<br>-Garlic mayo 2 tbs<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Strained 2 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Pani (Water) 1-2 tbs<br>Stuffing:<br>-Tomatoes (Tamatar) Deseeded Julienne Â½ Cup<br>-Gajar (Carrot) Julienne Â½ Cup<br>-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) Julienne Â½ Cup<br>-Kheera (Cucumber) Julienne Â½ Cup<br>-Bund gobhi (Cabbage) Julienne 1 Cup<br>-Jalapenos Â¼ cup<br><br>Directions:<br>For Whole Wheat Pita Bread:<br>-In bowl,add whole wheat flour,all-purpose flour,salt,sugar and instant yeast and give it a good mix.<br>-Add olive oil and mix well.<br>-Now add warm water, mix and knead well until dough is formed, apply olive oil over the dough, cover and let it rest for 30 minutes.<br>-After 30 minutes, knead dough again and cover, let it rest for 15 minutes.<br>-Now take a dough and make 6 balls of the dough.<br>-Sprinkle some wheat flour on working surface and roll the ball with the help of rolling pin into a flat round circle, cover & let it rest for 15 minutes.<br>-Heat griddle and put round dough on griddle,cover and cook both sides on low flame until light brown.<br>For Chicken:<br>-In chicken boneless,add yogurt,ginger garlic paste,whole spice powder,lemon juice,red chili powder,salt,black pepper powder,mix well and marinate for 15 minutes.<br>-In frying pan,add olive oil and marinated chicken, cook until chicken is done.<br>For Fusion Tahini Sauce:<br>-In bowl,add tahini paste,garlic mayo,yogurt,salt and water,mix well.<br>-Pour fusion tahini sauce in the sneezing bottle and refrigerate for 10-15 minutes.<br>For Stuffing:<br>-In bowl,add tomatoes,carrot,capsicum,cucumber,cooked chicken,cabbage, jalapenos, mix well and set aside.<br>For Assembling:<br>-Take pita bread, cut from the center and make a pocket, add stuffing and drizzle fusion tahini sauce.<br>-Take pita bread, add stuffing and fusion tahini sauce, roll it, wrap in butter paper.<br>-Shawarma is ready.<br><br>Note:<br>-Remember put upside down on griddle, this helps you to blow your pita bread very well.<br>-When all the pita breads are ready for filling, do cover for avoiding hard crust and breakage of it.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br>Directions:<br>For Whole Wheat Pita:<br>-Bowl mein aata,maida,namak,cheeni aur khameer dal ker mix karein.<br>-Olive oil dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Ab neem garam pani shamil karein,ache tarhan ghoond ker dough tayyar ker lein,dhak ker 30 minute kliya rakh dein.<br>-30 minute ka bad dubara dough ko ghoond lein aur dhak ker 15 minute kliya rakh dein.<br>-Ab dough ki 6 balls bana lein.<br>-Working surface per aata chirak ker ball ko rolling pin ki madad sa flat round circle roti bail lein,dhak ker 10-15 minute kliya rakh dein.<br>-Tawa ko garam ker ka round shape roti dal dein aur dono side sa halki ancch per light brown hunay tak paka lein.<br>For Chicken:<br>-Chicken boneless mein dahi,adrak lehsan paste,garam masala powder,leemo ka rus,lal mirch powder,namak aur kali mirch powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur 15 minute kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Frying pan mein olive oil dal ker marinated chicken dal ker chicken pak janay tak paka lein.<br>For Fusion Tahini Sauce:<br>-Bowl mein tahini paste,garlic mayo,dahi,namak aur pani dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur refrigerate ker lein.<br>For Stuffing:<br>-Bowl mein tamatar,gajar,Shimla mirch,kheera,fried chicken,band gobhi aur jalapenos dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur side per rakh dein.<br>For Assembling:<br>-Fusion tahini sauce ko sneezing bottle mein dal dein.<br>-Pita bread ko center mein sa cut ker lein aur pocket bana lein,chicken filling bhar ker upper sa sauce dal dein.<br>-Pita bread per chicken filling rakh ker upper sa sacue dal ker roll ker lein aur butter paper mein wrap ker lein.<br>-Shawarma tayyar hai.</p>','',26,'lq5weOcbyac','','active','','2017-07-17 19:07:17','Chicken Shawarma | Home made Chicken shawarma','','Whole Wheat Shawarma\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nWhole Wheat Pita Bread:\r\n-Aata (Whole wheat flour) 2 cups\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 cup\r\n-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ tbs\r\n-Khameer (Dry instant yeast) 1 & Â½ tsp\r\n-Olive oil 4-5 tb',13,'youtube',''),(275,'Mini Chicken Burger','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Chicken boneless boiled 250 gms<br>-Mayonnaise Â½ Cup<br>-Tomato ketchup 3 tbs<br>-BBQ sauce 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1-2 pinches<br>-Lehsan powder (Garlic powder) 1-2 pinches<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) to taste<br>-Mini burger buns <br>-Cheese slice<br>-Tomato slice<br>-Lettuce leave<br><br>Directions:<br>-Shred boiled chicken.<br>-In bowl,add shredded chicken,mayonnaise,tomato ketchup,bbq sauce,salt,garlic powder,black pepper powder and mix well,(makes 6-8 mini burgers).<br>Assembling:<br>-On mini burger bun,add chicken mixture,place cheese slice & tomato slice,lettuce leaf and place another bun on top.<br>-Mini chicken burger is ready.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Chicken boneless boiled 250 gms<br>-Mayonnaise Â½ Cup<br>-Tomato ketchup 3 tbs<br>-BBQ sauce 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) 1-2 pinches<br>-Lehsan powder (Garlic powder) 1-2 pinches<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) to taste<br>-Mini burger buns <br>-Cheese slice<br>-Tomato slice<br>-Lettuce leave<br><br>Directions:<br>-Boiledchicken ko shred ker lein.<br>-Bowl mein shredded chicken,mayonnaise,tomato ketchup,bbq sauce,namak,lehsan powder aur kali mirch powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein (makes 6-8 mini burgers).<br>Assembling:<br>-Mini burger bun per chicken mixture dal dein,cheese slice & tamatar slice,lettuce leaf rakh ker upper sa dusra bun rakh dein.<br>-Mini chicken burger tayyar hai.</p>','',26,'feuICeAlIPE','','active','','2017-07-18 08:58:22','Mini Chicken Burger','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Chicken boneless boiled 250 gms\r\n-Mayonnaise Â½ Cup\r\n-Tomato ketchup 3 tbs\r\n-BBQ sauce 1 tbs\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1-2 pinches\r\n-Lehsan powder (Garlic powder) 1-2 pinches\r\n-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) to taste\r\n-M',13,'youtube',''),(276,'Club Sandwich recipe','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Chicken (boiled and shredded) 1 Cup<br>-Kali mirch (Black pepper) crushed Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Makhan (Butter) salted 1-2 tbs<br>-Anday (Eggs) 2<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 pinch<br>-Yellow food color 1 pinch (optional)<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Bread Slices Large <br>-Mayonnaise<br>-Kheera (Cucumber) sliced <br>-Mayonnaise<br>-Lettuce leaves<br>-Cheese slice<br>-Tamatar (Tomato) slices<br>-Makhan (Butter) <br><br>Directions:<br>-In bowl,add chicken,black pepper crushed,white pepper powder,salt and butter,mix well and set aside.<br>-In small bowl,add eggs,salt and yellow food color,whisk well.<br>-In frying pan,brush oil and pour egg mixture,cook omelet from both sides and set aside.<br>-Cut corners of bread slices,heat grill pan and grill bread slice,spread mayonnaise,add chicken and cucumber.<br>-Grill another bread slice and place over it,again spread mayonnaise,place lettuce leaf,egg omelet, cheese slice,tomato,spread mayonnaise on another bread slice and top with bread slice.<br>-Grease grill pan with butter,place sandwich,apply butter and grill from both sides.<br>-Clun sandwich is ready,serve with french fries,coleslaw and ketchup.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Chicken (boiled and shredded) 1 Cup<br>-Kali mirch (Black pepper) crushed Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste<br>-Makhan (Butter) salted 1-2 tbs<br>-Anday (Eggs) 2<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 pinch<br>-Yellow food color 1 pinch (optional)<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Bread Slices Large <br>-Mayonnaise<br>-Kheera (Cucumber) sliced <br>-Mayonnaise<br>-Lettuce leaves<br>-Cheese slice<br>-Tamatar (Tomato) slices<br>-Makhan (Butter) <br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein chicken,kali mirch crushed,safed mirch powder,namak aur makhan dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Ek chotay bowl mein anday,namak aur yellow food color dal ker ache tarhan whisk ker lein.<br>-Frying pan ko oil sa brush karein,anday ka mixture dal ker omelet ko dono sides sa paka lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Bread ka corners ko cut ker lein,gril pan ko garam karein aur bread ko grill ker lein,mayonnaise laga ker upper sa chicken aur kheera rakh dein.<br>-Ek aur bread slice ko grill ker lein aur sandwich ka upper rakh dein,mayonnaise laga ker salad leaf,egg omelet,cheese slice,tamatar rakh dein,ek aur bread slice per mayonnaise laga lein aur bread slice ko sandwich ka upper rakh dein.<br>-Grill pan ko makhan sa grill karein,sandwich rakh dein aur makhan laga ker dono sides sa grill ker lein.<br>-Club sandwich tayyar hai,french fries,coleslaw aur ketchup ka saath serve karein.</p>','',26,'0DCg40GpAOM','','active','','2017-07-18 09:00:46','Club Sandwich recipe','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Chicken (boiled and shredded) 1 Cup\r\n-Kali mirch (Black pepper) crushed Â¼ tsp or to taste\r\n-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) Â¼ tsp\r\n-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp or to taste\r\n-Makhan (Butter) salted 1-2 tbs\r\n-Anday (E',10,'youtube',''),(277,'Home Made Naan','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 500 gms<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp<br>-Baking powder 2 tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) powdered 2 tsp<br>-Baking soda 1 & Â½ tsp<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) 3 tbs<br>-Oil 2 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) lukewarm as required<br>-Pani (Water) as required<br>-Makhan (Butter) as required<br><br>Directions:<br>-In bowl,add all-purpose flour,salt,baking powder,sugar,baking soda and mix well.<br>-Add yogurt,oil and mix well.<br>-Gradually add water and knead well until soft dough is formed,cover & let it rest for 2-3 hours.<br>-Knead dough again,grease hands with oil,take a dough and make a ball,sprinkle flour on working surface and roll out dough with the help of rolling pin and apply water on the surface (makes 4-5 Naans).<br>-Heat griddle,place rolled dough and cook form both sides.<br>-In the end,apply butter on the surface & serve.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 500 gms<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp<br>-Baking powder 2 tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) powdered 2 tsp<br>-Baking soda 1 & Â½ tsp<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) 3 tbs<br>-Oil 2 tbs<br>-Pani (Water) lukewarm as required<br>-Pani (Water) as required<br>-Makhan (Butter) as required<br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein maida,namak,baking powder,cheeni aur baking soda dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Dahi aur oil dal ker mix karein.<br>-Thora thora ker ka pani shamil karein aur ghond ker naram dough tayyar ker lein,dhak ker 2-3 hours kliya rakh dein.<br>-Dough ko dubara ghond lein,haathon ko oil sa grease karein,dough ki ball bana lein,working surface per atta chirak dein aur rolling pin ki madad sa dough ko bail lein aur surface per pani laga lein (makes 4-5 Naans).<br>-Tawa garam karein,rolled dough ko rakh dein aur dono sides sa paka lein.<br>-Akhir mein makhan laga ker serve karein.</p>','',26,'qoZ_mqQLIOw','','active','','2017-07-18 09:03:47','Home Made Naan','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 500 gms\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp\r\n-Baking powder 2 tsp\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) powdered 2 tsp\r\n-Baking soda 1 & Â½ tsp\r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) 3 tbs\r\n-Oil 2 tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) lukewarm as required\r\n-Pani (Water)',8,'youtube',''),(278,'Salt Roasted Corn (Makai) & Chickpeas (Chanay) ','<p>SALT ROASTED CORN AND CHICKPEAS</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>â€¢ Corn cob as required<br>â€¢ Corn Kernels as required<br>â€¢ Salt 1 packet<br>â€¢ Chickpea (white) as required (soaked overnight)<br>â€¢ Chaat masala to taste<br>â€¢ Lemon as required <br><br>Tip: It is very important that the corn kernels are plucked by hand as shown in the video and the exterior of the corn kernels is completely dry. Any extra moisture on corn and chickpeas will make them too salty. Also make sure your salt is very hot when you put in the kernels.<br><br><br><br><br>Directions:<br>For Corn Kernels:<br>-Pull husks away from corn cob. Remove corn silk.<br>-Peel corns kernels from the corn cob, set aside<br>-Corn Kernels must be dry <br>-Take a large wok, add one packet of salt, heat at high flame for 10 mins<br>-The salt color will change from white to grayish white, add kernels and cook until corns/kernel starts to brown, stir occasionally.<br>-Strain corn kernels through strainer, rub with clean cloth to remove extra salt <br>-Sprinkle chaat masala and squeeze lemon juice, mix well and serve<br><br>For corn cob:<br>-Add corn cob on salt and roast or cook until corn cob starts to brown, turn corn occasionally<br>-Tab to remove extra salt<br>-Rub lemon with chaat masala and serve<br><br>For chickpeas:<br>-Soak chickpeas overnight, drain and dry with clean towel. <br>-Add chickpeas on heated salt and roast until chickpeas change color, stir occasionally<br>-Strain chickpeas through strainer, rub with clean cloth to remove extra salt <br>-Season with chaat masala<br>-Serve and enjoy<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>â€¢ Makai hasb e zarooart<br>â€¢ Makai ke dane hasb e zarooart<br>â€¢ Namak 1 packet<br>â€¢ Safed channay hasb e zarooart (soaked overnight)<br>â€¢ Chaat masala hasb e zarooart<br>â€¢ Lemon 1<br>Direction:<br>For Makai:<br>-Makai ko cheel kar saaf kar lein<br>-Makai mein sa Makai ka dane alag ker lein aur side per rakh dein<br>-Makai ka dane ko khusk huna zarori hai<br>-Karhai mein namak ka packet dal ker 10 mins kliya tez annch per garam ker lein<br>-Namak ka color tabdeel ho jaye tou Makai ka dane shamil ker lein aur paka lein yahan tak k Makai ka color sunhairi/brown ho jaye, chamcha chalatay rahein<br>-Makai k dane chaan lein aur saaf kapray ki madad sa ezafee namak saaf ker lein<br>-Ab is mein hasb e zaroorat chaat masala aur leemun dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur serve karein<br>For Makai:<br>-Makai ko namak mein dal ker bhoon lein aur musalsal turn kertay jayein<br>-Makai ko tab ker lein ta k extra namak alag ho jaye<br>-Leemun aur chaat masala laga ker serve karein<br><br>For channay:<br>-Chana ko raat bhar bhego ke rakhen, chaan ker saaf kapary ki madad sa sukha lein<br>-Chane ko namak mein dal ker bhoon lein , chamcha chalatay rahein<br>-Ab Chane ko chaan lein strainer ki madad sa aur kapray sa ezafee namak saf ker lein<br>-Chaat masala hasb e zaroorat dal ker serve karein.</p>','',26,'BR4MgnZySAA','','active','','2017-07-18 09:06:58','Salt Roasted Corn (Makai) & Chickpeas (Chanay) ','','SALT ROASTED CORN AND CHICKPEAS\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nâ€¢ Corn cob as required\r\nâ€¢ Corn Kernels as required\r\nâ€¢ Salt 1 packet\r\nâ€¢ Chickpea (white) as required (soaked overnight)\r\nâ€¢ Chaat masala to taste\r\nâ€¢ Lemon as required \r\n\r\nTip: ',4,'youtube',''),(279,'Whole Green Chicken','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>Prepare Green marinade:<br>-Hara dhania (Coriander) 3/4 Cup<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 10-15<br>-Podina (Mint leaves) Â½ Cup<br>-Yogurt (Dahi) 1/3 Cup<br>-Tetra pack cream 3 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 & Â½ tsp<br>Spatchcock Chicken:<br>-Whole chicken with skin 2 kg<br>-Butter 1 tbs<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Coal (Koyla) for smoke <br>Caramelize onion:<br>-Makhan (Butter) 1 tbs<br>-Oil 1 tsp<br>-Pyaz (Onion) rings 2 <br>-Namak (Salt) 1-2 pinch<br>-Brown sugar 1 tbs<br>Butter Rice:<br>-Pani (Water) 2 tbs<br>-Zafran (Saffron) powder or strands Â½ tsp (optional)<br>-Makhan (Butter) 1/3 Cup or as required<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup<br>-Chawal (Rice) 1 & Â½ Cups (boiled with 1 tsp salt)<br><br>Directions:<br>Prepare Green marinade:<br>-In blender,add coriander,green chilies,mint leaves and blend well.<br>-In bowl,add yogurt,tetra pack cream,ginger garlic paste,black pepper powder,whole spice powder,salt, greens and mix well.<br>Spatchcock Chicken:<br>-Wash and pat dry whole chicken.Cut tips of the wings.<br>-Upside down chicken and pat dry again.<br>-Cut whole chicken with kitchen scissor,cut the back bone of the chicken and break breast bone with knife & flatten it.<br>-Transfer chicken in a dish,add green marinade and spread evenly,marinate for 4 hours.<br>-Heat griddle,add butter,oil and marinated chicken,place aluminum foil and put a heavy pan on chicken and cook on low flame for 20 minutes.<br>-Remove weight,apply marinade and turn the chicken,again apply marinade.<br>-Turn the chicken and cook for another 20 minutes or until chicken is done (total cooking time: approx.45-50 minutes).<br>-Give a coal smoke for 1-2 minutes.<br>For Caramelize onion:<br>-In frying pan,add butter,oil,onion rings and mix.<br>-Add salt,brown sugar and cook on low flame until onions are translucent brown and keep stirring in between.<br>For Butter Rice:<br>-Dissolve saffron powder or strands in water and mix well and soak for 10 minutes.<br>-In pot,add butter,water and let it melt,add boiled rice and mix gently<br>-Add saffron on top of the rice,cover and put it on low flame for 5-8 minutes.<br>Note:<br>-You can bake in pre-heated oven at 180 C for 1 hour and 15 minutes.<br>-Grill or steam cook at low flame until done.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Prepare Green marinade:<br>-Hara dhania (Coriander) 3/4 Cup<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 10-15<br>-Podina (Mint leaves) Â½ Cup<br>-Yogurt (Dahi) 1/3 Cup<br>-Tetra pack cream 3 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 & Â½ tsp<br>Spatchcock chicken:<br>-Whole chicken with skin 2 kg<br>-Butter 1 tbs<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Coal (Koyla) for smoke <br>Caramelize onion:<br>-Makhan (Butter) 1 tbs<br>-Oil 1 tsp<br>-Pyaz (Onion) rings 2 <br>-Namak (Salt) 1-2 pinch<br>-Brown sugar 1 tbs<br>Butter Rice:<br>-Pani (Water) 2 tbs<br>-Zafran (Saffron) powder or strands Â½ tsp (optional)<br>-Makhan (Butter) 1/3 Cup or as required<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup<br>-Chawal (Rice) 1 & Â½ Cups (boiled with 1 tsp salt)<br><br>Directions:<br>Prepare Green marinade:<br>-Blender mein hara dhania,hari mirch aur podina dal ker ache tarhan blend ker lein.<br>-Bowl mein dahi,tetra pack cream,adrak lehsan paste,kali mirch powder,garam masala powder,namak aur greens dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>Spatchcock Chicken:<br>-Chicken ko dho ker pat dry ker lein.Wings ka tips ko cut ker lein.<br>-Chicken ko palat dein aur dubara pat dry karein.<br>-Kitchen scissor ki madad sa whole chicken ko cut ker lein,back bone ko cut ker lein aur breast bone ko knife ki madad sa break karein & flat ker lein.<br>-Chicken ko dish mein transfer ker lein,green mariande dal ker ache tarhan pheela lein aur 4 hours kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Tawa garam karein,makhan,oil aur marinated chicken dal dein,upper sa aluminum foil aur heavy pan ko chicken ka upper rakh dein,20 minutes kliya halki ancch per paka lein.<br>-Weight hata lein,marination laga ker chicken ko palat dein,phir dubara marination laga lein.<br>-Chicken ko turn ker lein aur mazeed 20 minute ya chicken gul janay tak paka lein (total cooking time: approx.45-50 minutes).<br>-1-2 minutes kliya koyla ka dhuwa dein.<br>For Caramelize onion:<br>-Frying pan mein makhan,oil aur onion rings dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Namak,brown sugar dal dein aur halki ancch per pyaz ko translucent brown hunay tak paka lein aur chamcha chalatay rahein.<br>For Butter Rice:<br>-Zafran powder or strands ko pani mein dissolve karein aur 10 minutes kliya soak ker lein.<br>-Pot mein makhan aur pani dal ker melt ker lein,boiled chawal dal ker gently mix ker lein.<br>-Chawal ka upper zafran dal dein,dhak ker 5-8 minutes kliya halki ancch per rakh dein.<br>Note:<br>-Pre-heated oven mein 180 c per 1 hour aur 15 minutes kliya bake bhi ker saktya han.<br>-Grill or halki darmiyani ancch per steam cook bhi ker saktay han.</p>','',26,'CpTjBlc0Sj8','','active','','2017-07-18 09:08:57','Whole Green Chicken','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nPrepare Green marinade:\r\n-Hara dhania (Coriander) 3/4 Cup\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 10-15\r\n-Podina (Mint leaves) Â½ Cup\r\n-Yogurt (Dahi) 1/3 Cup\r\n-Tetra pack cream 3 tbs\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tb',11,'youtube',''),(280,'Besan ke Altay Paltay','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Baisan (Gram flour) 1 Cup<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Chaat masala Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Pani (Water) 1 Cup or as required<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) Chopped<br>-Hara dhania (Coriander) Chopped <br>-Oil Â¼ Cup<br>-Meethi dana (Fenugreek seeds) Â½ tsp<br>-Onion paste (Pyaz) pissi hoye 1 medium<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 & Â½ tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¾ Cup<br>-Fried pyaz (Fried onion) Crushed 1 tbs <br>-Pani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 1-2<br>-Hara dhania (Coriander) chopped 1-2 tbs<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br><br>Directions:<br>-In bowl,add gram flour,red chili powder,turmeric powder,whole spice powder,chaat masala,salt,water and mix well.<br>-Add oil,mix well and set aside for 15-20 minutes.<br>-By using non-stick pan,pour batter,sprinkle green chili and coriander,fold and press,cook until light brown and set aside.<br>-Now cut all the altay paltay in desired shape with knife.<br>-In wok,add oil,meethi dana,onion paste and fry for 1-2 minutes.<br>-Add ginger garlic paste,salt,coriander powder,red chili powder and turmeric powder,sautÃ© for 1-2 minutes.<br>-Add yogurt,mix well until water is evaporated.<br>-Add fried onion,water and mix well.<br>-Now add altay paltay,green chilies,coriander,whole spice powder,cover and simmer for 1-2minutes.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Baisan (Gram flour) 1 Cup<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Chaat masala Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Pani (Water) 1 Cup or as required<br>-Oil 1 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) Chopped<br>-Hara dhania (Coriander) Chopped <br>-Oil Â¼ Cup<br>-Meethi dana (Fenugreek seeds) Â½ tsp<br>-Onion paste (Pyaz) pissi hoye 1 medium<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 & Â½ tsp<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â¾ Cup<br>-Fried pyaz (Fried onion) Crushed 1 tbs <br>-Pani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 1-2<br>-Hara dhania (Coriander) chopped 1-2 tbs<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein baisan,lal mirch powder,haldee powder,garam masala powder,chaat masala,namak aur pani dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Oil dal ker mix ker lein aur 15-20 minute kliya side per rakh dein.<br>-Non-stick pan mein batter dal ker upper sa hari mirch,hara dhania dal dein,fold ker ka press ker lein,light brown hunay tak paka lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Ab altay paltay ko knife ki madad sa desired shape mein cut ker lein.<br>-Karhai mein oil,meethi dana aur pyaz ka paste dal ker 1-2 minute kliya fry ker lein.<br>-Adrak lehsan paste,namak,dhania powder,lal mirch powder aur haldee powder dal ker 1-2 minutes kliya sautÃ© ker lein.<br>-Dahi shamil karein aur pani sukh janay tak paka lein.<br>-Fried pyaz aur pani dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Ab is mein altay paltay,hari mirch,hara dhania aur garam masala powder dal ker dhak dein aur 1-2 minutes kliya dum per rakh dein.</p>','',26,'p9cZJx8khdQ','','active','','2017-07-18 09:10:45','Besan ke Altay Paltay','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Baisan (Gram flour) 1 Cup\r\n-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tsp\r\n-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp\r\n-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp\r\n-Chaat masala Â½ tsp\r\n-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp or to taste\r',11,'youtube',''),(281,'Meethi Tikiyan ','<p>Meethi Tikiyan</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>-Doodh (Milk) Hot Â½ Cup<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 Cup<br>-Ghee 5-6 tbs<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 2 Cups<br>-Til (Sesame seeds) 3 tbs<br>-Khopra (Desiccated coconut) 4 tbs<br>-Sooji (Semolina) Â¾ Cup<br>-Elaichi powder (Cardamom powder) 1 tsp<br>-Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>-In jug,add milk,sugar,ghee and mix well until sugar is dissolved.<br>-In bowl,add all-purpose flour,sesame seeds,desiccated coconut,semolina,cardamom powder and mix well.<br>-Gradually add milk mixture and knead to form a dough,cover and let it rest for 1 hour (yields: 10-12 pieces).<br>-Grease your hands with oil and divide dough into two equal parts.<br>-Roll out dough with the help of rolling pin and cut with cutter.<br>-In a wok,heat oil and fry on medium low flame until light golden.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Doodh (Milk) Hot Â½ Cup<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 Cup<br>-Ghee 5-6 tbs<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 2 Cups<br>-Til (Sesame seeds) 3 tbs<br>-Khopra (Desiccated coconut) 4 tbs<br>-Sooji (Semolina) Â¾ Cup<br>-Elaichi powder (Cardamom powder) 1 tsp<br>-Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>-Jug mein doodh,cheeni aur ghee dal ker cheeni ghul janay tak ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Bowl mein maida,til ka tail,khopra,sooji aur elaichi powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Thora thora ker ka milk mixture daltey jayein aur ghond ker dough tayyar ker lein,dhak ker 1 hour kliya rakh dein (yields: 10-12 pieces).<br>-Haathon ko oil sa grease ker lein aur dough ko do hisson mein divde ker lein.<br>-Dough ko rolling pin sa roll ker lein aur cutter ki madad sa cut ker lein.<br>-Karhai mein oil garam karein,medium low flame per light golden hunay tak fry ker lein.</p>','',26,'wYVQPc9G3lg','','active','','2017-07-18 09:16:48','Meethi Tikiyan ','','Meethi Tikiyan\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Doodh (Milk) Hot Â½ Cup\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 Cup\r\n-Ghee 5-6 tbs\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 2 Cups\r\n-Til (Sesame seeds) 3 tbs\r\n-Khopra (Desiccated coconut) 4 tbs\r\n-Sooji (Semolina) Â¾ Cup\r\n-Elaichi powder',10,'youtube',''),(282,'Homemade Chocolate Donuts Recipe ','<p>Chocolate Donuts</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>-Khameer (Yeast) 1 tbs<br>-Doodh (Milk) Warm Â¼ Cup<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 5 tbs<br>-Doodh (Milk) Warm Â¼ Cup<br>-Khameer (Yeast) Â½ tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) powdered 1 tbs<br>-Vanilla extract Â½ tsp<br>-Ande ki zardi (Egg yolks) 1 & Â½ <br>-Makhan (Butter) Melted 2 tbs<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 & Â¼ Cup<br>-Makhan (Butter) Melted 1 tbs<br>-Oil for frying <br>Chocolate Glaze:<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) powdered Â¾ Cup<br>-Cocoa powder 2 tbs<br>-Doodh (Milk) 4 tbs<br>-Vanilla extract 1 tsp<br>-Makhan (Butter) Melted 2 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>-In a bowl,add yeast,milk warm,all-purpose flour and mix well.<br>-Cover with cling film and let it rest for 30 minutes.<br>-In a bowl,add milk warm,yeast and mix.<br>-Add flour-yeast mixture,salt,sugar,vanilla essence,egg yolk and beat well.<br>-Add butter and gradually add all-purpose flour, knead well to form soft dough and makes 8-10 medium size donuts.<br>-Cover and refrigerate for 1 & Â½ hour or until doubles in size.<br>-Knead dough again and make a ball,divide into two equal pieces.<br>-Roll out dough into round shape with the help of rolling pin.<br>-Cut with a doughnut cutter and leave for 20 minutes.<br>-In a wok, heat oil (maintain oil temperature at 190 c while frying) and deep fry donuts on each side until golden brown.<br>-Dip doughnuts into the chocolate glaze and set onto wire racks to drain off excess and sprinkle with colored sprinkles immediately after glazing.<br>Chocolate Glaze: <br>-In a sauce pan,add milk,butter melted,vanilla essence,sugar,cocoa powder and keep stirring until sauce thickens.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Khameer (Yeast) 1 tbs<br>-Doodh (Milk) Warm Â¼ Cup<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 5 tbs<br>-Doodh (Milk) Warm Â¼ Cup<br>-Khameer (Yeast) Â½ tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) powdered 1 tbs<br>-Vanilla extract Â½ tsp<br>-Ande ki zardi (Egg yolks) 1 & Â½ <br>-Makhan (Butter) Melted 2 tbs<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 & Â¼ Cup<br>-Makhan (Butter) Melted 1 tbs<br>-Oil for frying <br>Chocolate Glaze:<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) powdered Â¾ Cup<br>-Cocoa powder 2 tbs<br>-Doodh (Milk) 4 tbs<br>-Vanilla extract 1 tsp<br>-Makhan (Butter) Melted 2 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein khameer,neem garam doodh aur maida dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Cling film sa dhak ker 30 minute kliya rakh dein.<br>-Bowl mein neem garam doodh aur khameer dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Flour-yeast mixture,namak,cheeni,vanilla essence aur anda ki zarde dal ker ache tarhan beat ker lein.<br>-Makhan dal dein aur thora thora ker ka maida daltay jayein aur ache tarhan ghond ker naram dough tayyar ker lein, 8-10 medium size ka donuts bana lein.<br>-Dhak ker 1 & Â½ hour ya size double hunay tak refrigerate ker lein.<br>-Dubara dough ko ghond lein aur ball bana lein,do equal piece mein divide ker lein.<br>-Dough ko round shape mein rolling pin ki madad sa bail lein.<br>-Doughnut cutter ki madad sa cut ker lein aur 20 minute kliya chor dein.<br>-Karhai mein oil garam karein (oil ka temperature 190 C rakhein frying kertay hoye) donuts ko dono sides sa golden brown hunay tak deep fry ker lein.<br>-Doughnuts ko chocolate glaze mein dip ker ka wire racks per rakh dein aur upper sa colored sprinkle dal ker serve karein.<br>Chocolate Glaze: <br>-Sauce pan mein doodh,makhan melted,vanilla essence,cheeni aur cocoa powder dal ker musalsal mix kertay rahein yahan tak ka sauce garha ho jaye.</p>','',26,'QkFZ4TvWVI0','','active','','2017-07-18 09:17:59','Homemade Chocolate Donuts Recipe ','','Chocolate Donuts\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Khameer (Yeast) 1 tbs\r\n-Doodh (Milk) Warm Â¼ Cup\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 5 tbs\r\n-Doodh (Milk) Warm Â¼ Cup\r\n-Khameer (Yeast) Â½ tbs\r\n-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) powdered 1 tbs\r\n-Vanilla e',11,'youtube',''),(283,'ShakarParay ','<p>Ingredients:</p><p>-Pani (Water) Hot Â½ Cup<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 pinch<br>-Ghee Â½ Cup<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 3 Cups<br>-Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>-In hot water,add sugar,salt and ghee,whisk well until sugar is dissolved and set aside.<br>-In all-purpose flour, gradually add water mixture and knead a smooth dough,cover and let it rest for 15 minutes.<br>-Divide dough into two equal parts,coat in dry flour and roll out with the help of rolling pin.<br>-Cut the dough into desired shape with knife.<br>-In wok,heat oil and fry until golden.<br><br>Shakarpara Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Pani (Water) Hot Â½ Cup<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 pinch<br>-Ghee Â½ Cup<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 3 Cups<br>-Oil for frying<br><br>Directions:<br>-Garam pani mein cheeni,namak aur ghee dal dein,cheeni ghul janay tak ache tarhan whisk ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Maida mein thora thora ker ka water mixture daltay jayein aur ghond ker smooth dough tayyar ker kein,dhak ker 15 minutes kliya rakh dein.<br>-Dough ko do baraber ka pieces mein divide ker lein,dry atta mein coat ker ka rolling pin ki madad sa bail lein.<br>-Knife ki madad sa desired shape mein cut ker lein.<br>-Karhai mein oil garam ker ka golden hunay tak fry ker lein</p>','',26,'3ICBDT1hcL4','','active','','2017-07-18 09:20:29','ShakarParay ','','Ingredients:\r\n-Pani (Water) Hot Â½ Cup\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 Cup\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 pinch\r\n-Ghee Â½ Cup\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 3 Cups\r\n-Oil for frying\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-In hot water,add sugar,salt and ghee,whisk well until sugar is dissolved and set aside.',8,'youtube',''),(284,'Mehboobi','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>For Sheera (Sugar syrup):<br>-Paani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 2 Cups<br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3-4<br>-Lemon juice 1 tsp<br>For Dough:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup<br>-Safed Aata (White flour) 1 Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp <br>-Oil Â¼ Cup<br>-Pani (Water) warm for kneading <br>-Desi ghee (for brushing)<br>-Desi ghee for frying<br>-Cream for garnishing<br><br>Direction:<br>For Sheera (Sugar syrup):<br>-In pot,add water,sugar and green cardamom,mix and cook until syrup thickens.<br>-Add lemon juice,stir well and set aside.<br>For Dough:<br>-In bowl,add all-purpose flour,white flour,salt,oil and mix.<br>-Gradually add warm water and knead until smooth dough is formed.<br>-Cover and leave it for 20 minutes.<br>-Take a dough and make 4 small balls and coat in dry wheat flour.<br>-Press each ball a little between your palms to give a shape, coat it with dry flour.<br>-Roll out dough into round shape with the help of rolling pin and set aside.<br>-Repeat this process and roll out 3 more doughs into round shape.<br>-Spread desi ghee evenly over entire surface and dust flour,place another round dough, spread desi ghee and dust flour,repeat this process 2 times more.<br>-With the help of cutter,cut the entire dough into strips (about 1 inch) and roll it like a swiss roll,now place this roll over the another strip and roll it again like a swiss roll and stick outer end,coat it with dry wheat flour.<br>-Repeat this process and prepare remaining rolls.<br>-Now again coat it with dry wheat flour and roll it gently with the help of rolling pin and give it a round shape.<br>-In wok heat desi ghee and fry round dough until golden brown color.<br>-After frying, immediately put the fried mehboobi in the sugar syrup.The sugar syrup should be slightly warm when you add mehboobi in it.<br>-Turn over after a minute so that both sides are coated with the syrup.<br>-Keep them in the sugar syrup for about 2 minutes.<br>-Remove mehboobi with the help of tong and shake lightly so that excess sugar syrup.<br>-Mehboobi is ready to serve,garnish with cream.<br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>For Sheera (Sugar syrup):<br>-Paani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 2 Cups<br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3-4<br>-Lemon juice 1 tsp<br>For Dough:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup<br>-Safed Aata (White flour) 1 Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp <br>-Oil Â¼ Cup<br>-Pani (Water) warm for kneading <br>-Desi ghee (for brushing)<br>-Desi ghee for frying<br>-Cream for garnishing<br><br>Direction:<br>-For Sheera (Sugar syrup):<br>-Pot mein pani,cheeni aur hari elaichi shamil ker k mix karein,sheera garha hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Lemon juice dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>For Dough:<br>-Bowl mein maida,safed aata,namak aur oil dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Thora thora ker ka neem garam pani dal ker aata ghond lein aur smooth dough tayyar ker lein.<br>-Dhak ker 20 minutes kliya rakh dein.<br>-Dough ki 4 small balls bana lein aur aata mein coat ker lein.<br>-Dough ko haath ki madad sa pheela lein aur sukha atta mein coat ker lein.<br>-Rolling pin ki madad sa roti bail lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Yehe process dubara karein,3 aur rotiyan bail lein.<br>-Desi ghee laga ker upper sa maida chirak dein,ek aur dough is k upper rakh k desi ghee lagayein aur maida chirak dein,yehe process 2 dafa aur karein.<br>-Cutter ki madad sa puri dough ko strips (about 1 inch) ki shakal mein cut ker lein aur swiss roll ki tarhan roll karein,dosri strip k upper roll rakh k phr sa swiss roll ki tarhan roll karein aur end ko stick ker dein,dry wheat flour mein coat ker lein.<br>-Yehe process dubara karein aur tamam rolls tayyar ker lein.<br>-Ab dubara dry wheat flour mein coat karein aur rolling pin ki madad sa round shape mein bail lein.<br>-Karhai mein desi ghee garam karein aur round dough ko golden brown color hunay tak fry ker lein.<br>-Frying k foran bad fried mehboobi ko sugar syrup mein dal dein.Sugar syrup halka garam huna chahiya.<br>-Sugar syrup mein mehboobi ko turn ker lein ta k dono sides sa syrup coat ho jaye.<br>-Sugar syrup mein 2 minutes kliya chor dein.<br>-Tong ki madad sa mehboobi ko syrup sa nikal lein aur halka sa shake karein ta k ezafee sugar syrup nikla jaye.<br>-Mehboobi tayyar hai,cream sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'1poCampvmH4','','active','','2017-07-18 09:22:58','Mehboobi','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nFor Sheera (Sugar syrup):\r\n-Paani (Water) 1 Cup\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 2 Cups\r\n-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3-4\r\n-Lemon juice 1 tsp\r\nFor Dough:\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup\r\n-Safed Aata (White flour) 1 Cup\r\n-Namak (Sal',11,'youtube',''),(285,'Orange Blossom Dessert','<p>Orange Blossom</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>-Caramelized biscuits 24<br>-Makhan (Butter) 2-3 tbs<br>-Cream 1 & Â½ Cup<br>-Condense milk Â½ Cup<br>-Evaporated milk Â½ Cup<br>-Orange jelly crystals 3 packets<br>-Orange slices deseeded as required <br>-Orange juice 2-3 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>-In grinder,add caramelized biscuits and butter, grind well.<br>-Take a serving dish,add biscuit crumbs and spread it with the back of a spoon and refrigerate for 15-20 minutes.<br>-In bowl,add cream and beat until soft peak is formed.<br>-Add condense milk,evaporated milk and beat again.<br>-Add orange jelly crystals and beat until well combined & crystals dissolve.<br>-On biscuit layer,add orange slices,orange juice and cream mixture,spread evenly.<br>-For garnishing, sprinkle biscuit crumbs and add oranges slices.<br>-Refrigerate and serve chilled.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Caramelized biscuits 24<br>-Makhan (Butter) 2-3 tbs<br>-Cream 1 & Â½ Cup<br>-Condense milk Â½ Cup<br>-Evaporated milk Â½ Cup<br>-Orange jelly crystals 3 packets<br>-Orange slices deseeded as required <br>-Orange juice 2-3 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>-Grinder mein caramelized biscuits aur makhan dal ker ache tarhan grind ker lein.<br>-Serving dish mein biscuit crumbs dal ker chamchay ki madad sa pheela lein aur 15-20 minute kliya refrigerate ker lein.<br>-Bowl mein cream dal ker soft peaks bannay tak beat ker lein.<br>-Condense milk aur evaporated milk dal ker dubara beat ker lein.<br>-Orange jelly crystals dal ker ache tarhan beat ker lein yahan tak ka crystals dissolve ho jayein.<br>-Biscuit layer per orange slices,orange juice aur cream mixture dal ker pheela lein.<br>-Biscuit crumbs aur oranges slices sa garnish karein.<br>-Thanda ker ka serve karein.</p>','',26,'kr2XE-08nEs','','active','','2017-07-18 09:24:56','Orange Blossom Dessert','','Orange Blossom\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Caramelized biscuits 24\r\n-Makhan (Butter) 2-3 tbs\r\n-Cream 1 & Â½ Cup\r\n-Condense milk Â½ Cup\r\n-Evaporated milk Â½ Cup\r\n-Orange jelly crystals 3 packets\r\n-Orange slices deseeded as required \r\n-Orange juic',9,'youtube',''),(286,'Mehboobi','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>For Sheera (Sugar syrup):<br>-Paani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 2 Cups<br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3-4<br>-Lemon juice 1 tsp<br>For Dough:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup<br>-Safed Aata (White flour) 1 Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp <br>-Oil Â¼ Cup<br>-Pani (Water) warm for kneading <br>-Desi ghee (for brushing)<br>-Desi ghee for frying<br>-Cream for garnishing<br><br>Direction:<br>For Sheera (Sugar syrup):<br>-In pot,add water,sugar and green cardamom,mix and cook until syrup thickens.<br>-Add lemon juice,stir well and set aside.<br>For Dough:<br>-In bowl,add all-purpose flour,white flour,salt,oil and mix.<br>-Gradually add warm water and knead until smooth dough is formed.<br>-Cover and leave it for 20 minutes.<br>-Take a dough and make 4 small balls and coat in dry wheat flour.<br>-Press each ball a little between your palms to give a shape, coat it with dry flour.<br>-Roll out dough into round shape with the help of rolling pin and set aside.<br>-Repeat this process and roll out 3 more doughs into round shape.<br>-Spread desi ghee evenly over entire surface and dust flour,place another round dough, spread desi ghee and dust flour,repeat this process 2 times more.<br>-With the help of cutter,cut the entire dough into strips (about 1 inch) and roll it like a swiss roll,now place this roll over the another strip and roll it again like a swiss roll and stick outer end,coat it with dry wheat flour.<br>-Repeat this process and prepare remaining rolls.<br>-Now again coat it with dry wheat flour and roll it gently with the help of rolling pin and give it a round shape.<br>-In wok heat desi ghee and fry round dough until golden brown color.<br>-After frying, immediately put the fried mehboobi in the sugar syrup.The sugar syrup should be slightly warm when you add mehboobi in it.<br>-Turn over after a minute so that both sides are coated with the syrup.<br>-Keep them in the sugar syrup for about 2 minutes.<br>-Remove mehboobi with the help of tong and shake lightly so that excess sugar syrup.<br>-Mehboobi is ready to serve,garnish with cream.<br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>For Sheera (Sugar syrup):<br>-Paani (Water) 1 Cup<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) 2 Cups<br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3-4<br>-Lemon juice 1 tsp<br>For Dough:<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup<br>-Safed Aata (White flour) 1 Cup<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tsp <br>-Oil Â¼ Cup<br>-Pani (Water) warm for kneading <br>-Desi ghee (for brushing)<br>-Desi ghee for frying<br>-Cream for garnishing<br><br>Direction:<br>-For Sheera (Sugar syrup):<br>-Pot mein pani,cheeni aur hari elaichi shamil ker k mix karein,sheera garha hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Lemon juice dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>For Dough:<br>-Bowl mein maida,safed aata,namak aur oil dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Thora thora ker ka neem garam pani dal ker aata ghond lein aur smooth dough tayyar ker lein.<br>-Dhak ker 20 minutes kliya rakh dein.<br>-Dough ki 4 small balls bana lein aur aata mein coat ker lein.<br>-Dough ko haath ki madad sa pheela lein aur sukha atta mein coat ker lein.<br>-Rolling pin ki madad sa roti bail lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Yehe process dubara karein,3 aur rotiyan bail lein.<br>-Desi ghee laga ker upper sa maida chirak dein,ek aur dough is k upper rakh k desi ghee lagayein aur maida chirak dein,yehe process 2 dafa aur karein.<br>-Cutter ki madad sa puri dough ko strips (about 1 inch) ki shakal mein cut ker lein aur swiss roll ki tarhan roll karein,dosri strip k upper roll rakh k phr sa swiss roll ki tarhan roll karein aur end ko stick ker dein,dry wheat flour mein coat ker lein.<br>-Yehe process dubara karein aur tamam rolls tayyar ker lein.<br>-Ab dubara dry wheat flour mein coat karein aur rolling pin ki madad sa round shape mein bail lein.<br>-Karhai mein desi ghee garam karein aur round dough ko golden brown color hunay tak fry ker lein.<br>-Frying k foran bad fried mehboobi ko sugar syrup mein dal dein.Sugar syrup halka garam huna chahiya.<br>-Sugar syrup mein mehboobi ko turn ker lein ta k dono sides sa syrup coat ho jaye.<br>-Sugar syrup mein 2 minutes kliya chor dein.<br>-Tong ki madad sa mehboobi ko syrup sa nikal lein aur halka sa shake karein ta k ezafee sugar syrup nikla jaye.<br>-Mehboobi tayyar hai,cream sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'1poCampvmH4','','active','','2017-07-18 09:29:41','Mehboobi','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nFor Sheera (Sugar syrup):\r\n-Paani (Water) 1 Cup\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 2 Cups\r\n-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3-4\r\n-Lemon juice 1 tsp\r\nFor Dough:\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup\r\n-Safed Aata (White flour) 1 Cup\r\n-Namak (Sal',11,'youtube',''),(287,'Chocolate Pudding Pie Recipe','<p>Chocolate Pudding Pie Recipe in English:</p><p><br>INGREDIENTS:<br>FOR PIE CRUST/BASE:<br>o 1.5 Packets Digestive Biscuits (16-18 Biscuits)<br>o Butter 2-3 tbsp<br>PUDDING:<br>o Brown Sugar 3/4 Cup<br>o Cocoa 1/3 Cup<br>o Corn Flour 1/4 Cup <br>o Milk 3 Cup<br>o Salt Â½ tsp<br>o Butter 1 Â½ tbsp<br>o Vanilla Essence 1 Â½ tsp<br>o Chocolate Shavings for Garnishing <br><br>METHOD:<br>o Chopperize biscuits & add butter, mix well and press down form in a dish with hand/spoon or spatula in a dish and keep it in freezer for 10-15 mins. Set Aside.<br>o Whisk together Sugar, cocoa, Corn Flour, and salt in a pan. <br>o Gradually add cold milk a bit and turn on the heat. Now add remaining milk and keep whisking to combine and to avoid lumps. <br>o Whisk for 5-6 minutes more till thickens.<br>o Once thickens, remove from heat and add butter and Vanilla essence in it. <br>o Pour the mixture on pie/base and leave for 3-4 minutes. <br>o Sprinkle/garnish with chocolate shavings. <br>o Chill for 1-2 hours and enjoy. <br><br>Chocolate Pudding Pie Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>AJZA:<br>PIE CRUST/BASE KE LIYE:<br>o 1.5 Packets Wheatable Biscuits (16-18 Biscuits)<br>o Makhan 3 tbsp<br>PUDDING:<br>o Brown Sugar 3/4 Cup<br>o Cocoa 1/3 Cup<br>o Corn Flour 1/4 Cup <br>o Doodh 3 Cup<br>o Namak Â½ tsp<br>o Makhan 1 Â½ tbsp<br>o Vanilla Essence 1 Â½ tsp<br>o Chocolate Shavings Garnishing ke liye. <br><br>BANANAY KA TAREEQA:<br>o Biscuits ko chopper main daal ke chalien aur is main makhan shamil karein. Ab is dish main nikal ke haath/spatula ya chamchay se press karlein. Isko 10-15 min ke liye freezer main rakh dein taake achi tarah jam jaye. <br>o Ek pan main cheeni, cocoa, corn flour, aur namak daal ke mix karlein. <br>o Thora sa doodh shamil karein aur mix karein ab aanch medium pe rakh ke ahishta shista doodh shamil karte jaye and whisk karte jay eke achi tarah mix hojaye aur lumps na bane.<br>o Mazeed 5-6 mi tak whisk karte rahe ya jab tak garha na hojaye. .<br>o Janb garha hojaye to heat se hata kar makhan aur vanilla essence shamil karein. <br>o Pudding to pie/base pe achi tarah pehlaye aur 3-4 minure ke liye chhor dein. <br>o Chocolate shavings se Sprinkle/garnish karein<br>o 1-2 hours thanda kar ke enjoy karein.</p>','',26,'sw4VX3XcfNA','','active','','2017-07-18 09:32:46','Chocolate Pudding Pie Recipe','','Chocolate Pudding Pie Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nINGREDIENTS:\r\nFOR PIE CRUST/BASE:\r\no 1.5 Packets Digestive Biscuits (16-18 Biscuits)\r\no Butter 2-3 tbsp\r\nPUDDING:\r\no Brown Sugar 3/4 Cup\r\no Cocoa 1/3 Cup\r\no Corn Flour 1/4 Cup \r\no Milk 3 Cup\r\no Salt Â½ tsp\r\no Bu',8,'youtube',''),(288,'Chocolate Milkshake & Ganache Recipe ','<p>Chocolate Ice-Cream Milkshake Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>Chocolate Ganache:<br>â€¢ Semi-sweet Chocolate chips Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Cream Â½ cup <br>Chocolate Milkshake:<br>â€¢ Chilled Milk 2 cups<br>â€¢ Unsweetened Cocoa powder 2 tbs <br>â€¢ Chocolate ganache 2 tbs <br>â€¢ Ice cream 2 scoops<br><br>Directions:<br>- To make chocolate ganache, heat cream in a saucepan, when it starts simmering (donâ€™t let boil) add it in a bowl of chocolate chips and leave for 3-4 mins. Stir until smooth.<br>- To make Chocolate shake, in a blender add milk, cocoa powder, chocolate ganache and ice-cream and bend until all combined. <br>- Decorate glass with chocolate ganache, pour chocolate shake, add whipping cream, sprinkle chocolate shavings and serve.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza;<br>-Chocolate Ganache:<br>â€¢ Semi-sweet Chocolate chips Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Cream Â½ cup <br>-Chocolate Milkshake:<br>â€¢ Chilled Milk 2 cups<br>â€¢ Unsweetened Cocoa powder 2 tbs <br>â€¢ Chocolate ganache 2 tbs <br>â€¢ Ice cream 2 scoops<br><br>Directions:<br>- Chocolate ganache banana kliya,saucepan mein cream dal ker garam kerlein (boil nahi kerna hai),cream ko chocolate chips k bowl mein dal dein aur 5mins kliya chor dein,ache tarhan mix kerlein.<br>-Chocoalte shake banana kliya, blender mein doodh, cocoa powder, chocolate ganache aur ice-cream dal ker blend ker lein.<br>-Glass ko chocolate ganache sa decorate kerlein, chocolate shake dal ker ice cream ka scoop shamil karein,whipped cream, chocolate shavings aur choocoalte chips dal ker serve karein.</p>','',26,'4mX-tz5kbrk','','active','','2017-07-18 09:36:24','Chocolate Milkshake & Ganache Recipe ','','Chocolate Ice-Cream Milkshake Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nChocolate Ganache:\r\nâ€¢ Semi-sweet Chocolate chips Â½ cup\r\nâ€¢ Cream Â½ cup \r\nChocolate Milkshake:\r\nâ€¢ Chilled Milk 2 cups\r\nâ€¢ Unsweetened Cocoa powder 2 tbs \r\nâ€¢ Chocolate ganache 2 tbs',4,'youtube',''),(289,'Chocolate Mousse Cake ','<p>Chocolate Mousse Cake Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Plain pound cake 1<br>-Cream 100 ml<br>-Dark cooking chocolate 150 gms<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup<br>-Anday ki zarde (Egg Yolks) 3<br>-Gelatin powder 1 & Â½ Tsp<br>-Coffee 1 tsp<br>-Neem garam pani (Warm water) 2-3 Tbs<br>-Cream (Refrigerated) 200 ml<br>-Chocolate shaving <br>-Cherries for garnishing<br><br>Directions:<br>-Take plain pound cake and cut out a thin layer of cake, trimming the edges and place this layer in a 6-inch spring form pan.<br>-In double boiler,add water and simmer on low flame, place bowl, add dark chocolate and sugar, mix on low flame.<br>-Add cream and mix until smooth.<br>-Add egg yolks one by one and mix continuously for 2-3 minutes, turn off the heat.<br>-In gelatin, add coffee and warm water and mix.<br>-Now add this mixture in chocolate mixture and whisk continuously to avoid any lumps, keep aside for 5-8 minutes. <br>-Whisk 200 ml cream until soft peaks forms.<br>-Once the mixture is cooled, add whipped cream and mix well. <br>-Pour the mousse mixture over the cake layer in the spring form pan and refrigerate it for 4-6 hours.<br>-Run a knife around the edges to loosen cake from the sides of the pan and remove cake from spring form pan.<br>-Garnish with chocolate shavings and cherries.<br>-Chocolate mousse cake is ready.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Plain pound cake 1<br>-Cream 100 ml<br>-Dark cooking chocolate 150 gms<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup<br>-Anday ki zarde (Egg Yolks) 3<br>-Gelatin powder 1 & Â½ Tsp<br>-Coffee 1 tsp<br>-Neem garam pani (Warm water) 2-3 Tbs<br>-Cream (Refrigerated) 200 ml<br>-Chocolate shaving <br>-Cherries for garnishing<br><br>Directions:<br>-Plain pound cake lein aur us ki thin layer cut ker lein,cake ka kinaray trim karein aur cake layer ko 6-inch spring form pan mein rakh dein.<br>-Double boiler mein pani dal ker halki ancch per simmer karein,bowl rakh ker dark chocolate aur cheeni dal ker ka halki ancch per mix karein.<br>-Cream dal ker smooth hunay tak mix karein.<br>-Ek,ek ker ka anda ki zardiyan shamil karein aur musalsal mix kertay rahein 2-3 minute kliya aur chulha bund ker dein.<br>-Gelatin mein coffee aur neem garam pani dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Ab is mixture ko chocolate mixture mein dal ker musalsal whisk kertay rahein ta ka koi lumps na banayein, 5-8 minute kliya side per rakh dein.<br>-200 ml cream ko whisk karein yahan tak ka soft peaks bun jayein.<br>-Jaisa he mixture thanda ho us mein whipped cream shamil ker ka mix ker lein.<br>-Mousse mixture ko spring form pan k ander cake layer ka upper dal dein aur 4-6 hours kliya refrigerate ker lein.<br>-Cake ki sides ko knife ki madad sa loose ker lein aur cake ko spring form cake sa nikal lein.<br>-Chocolate shavings aur cherries sa garnish karein.<br>-Chocolate mousse cake tayyar hai.</p>','',26,'_wBqJEySfaA','','active','','2017-07-18 09:41:35','Chocolate Mousse Cake ','','Chocolate Mousse Cake Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Plain pound cake 1\r\n-Cream 100 ml\r\n-Dark cooking chocolate 150 gms\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ Cup\r\n-Anday ki zarde (Egg Yolks) 3\r\n-Gelatin powder 1 & Â½ Tsp\r\n-Coffee 1 tsp\r\n-Neem garam pani (Warm water) ',9,'youtube',''),(290,'Pound Cake ','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Butter 1 Cup<br>-Sugar 1 Cup<br>-Eggs 4 large or 5 small<br>-Flour 2 Cups<br>-Salt Â½ tsp<br>-Baking powder 1 tsp<br>-Vanilla Extract 2 tsp<br><br>Directions:<br>-In an electric mixer, add butter and mix for 1-2 mins.<br>-During mixing on medium speed, gradually add sugar and mix for 7-8 mins.<br>-Add eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition, mix for 2-3 mins.<br>-In flour,add salt and baking powder,mix well.<br>-Gradually add flour mixture in butter mixture and mix for 1-2 mins,beating just until combined (do not over mix).<br>-Add vanilla extract and mix for 30 secs.<br>-Grease loaf pan with butter and sprinkle plain flour.<br>-Scrape the batter into the prepared pan and smooth the top with an offset spatula or the back of a spoon.<br>-Tap the pan against your countertop (tap-tap-tap-tap) to scare away any last few little air bubbles trapped within.<br>-Bake in pre heated oven at 170 C for 40-45 mins.<br>-Toothpick inserted in center should come out clean.<br>-Remove the cake from oven, place on a wire rack to cool for about 10 minutes. Remove the cake from the pan and cool completely on a wire rack.<br>-Cut into slices.<br>-For sandwich cakes, grease sandwich maker, pour batter and give it 4-5 min.<br>-Sandwich cake is ready.<br><br>Tips:<br>Baking Time and Temperature:<br>- Baking time varies based on the size of your pan. <br>- If you are making simple cupcakes then they should be ready within 15 min.<br>- For small size loaf pan the time should be 40-45 mins.<br>- For larger size loaf pan the time should be 45-55 mins.<br>- Make sure that a tooth pick inserted in the center comes out clean that is the sign of a fully baked cake. <br>- The temperature will remain the same at 170 C for all types of pan, and the cake needs to be placed in the center rack with only the bottom burner on. Make sure that preheat the oven at the same temperature (170 C).<br><br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Makhan 1 Cup<br>-Cheeni 1 Cup<br>-Anday 4 large or 5 small<br>-Maida 2 Cups<br>-Namak Â½ tsp<br>-Baking powder 1 tsp<br>-Vanilla Extract 2 tsp<br><br>Directions:<br>-Electric mixer mein makhan dal ker 1-2 mins kliya mix ker lein.<br>-Mixing k doran darmiyani speed mein thori thori ker k cheeni shamil kertay jayein aur 7-8 mins kliya mix ker lein.<br>-Ek,ek ker k ande shamil kertay jayein aur mix ker kerlein 2-3 mins kliya.<br>-Maida mein namak aur baking powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Ab maida k mixture ko thora thora ker k butter mixture mein daltay jayein aur 1-2 mins kliya mix ker lein.<br>-Vanilla extract dal ker 30 secs kliya mix karein.<br>-Loaf pan ko grease ker k maida chirak dein.<br>-Ab loaf pan mein batter dal ker spatula ya spoon ki madad sa batter ko set ker lein.<br>-Pan ko countertop per tap karein ta k air bubbles nikal jayein.<br>-Pre heated oven mein 170 C per 40-45 mins kliya bake ker lein.<br>-Toothpick insert ker k check ker lein.<br>-Cake ko oven sa nikal ker wire rack per rakh ker thanda ker lein 10 minute kliya.Pan sa cake ko nikal lein aur completely thanda ker lein.<br>-Slices mein cut ker lein.<br>-Sandwich cakes bananay kliya, sandwich maker ko grease ker lein aur batter dal dein 4-5 mins kliya.<br>-Sandwich cake tayyar hai.<br><br>Tips:<br>Baking Time and Temperature:<br>-Pan k size k lehaz sa baking time change hoga.<br>-Agar app simple cupcakes bana raha han tou who 15min mein tayyar ho jayenga.<br>-Chota size k loaf pan mean time 40-45 mins lagay ga.<br>-Bada size k loaf pan mein time 45-55 mins lagay ga.<br>-Cake k bech mein tooth pick dal ker check karein,tooth pick clean bahir aye tou is k matlab hai k bake ho gaya hai.<br>-Tamam pan kliya baking temperature 170 C hoga aur cake ko hamasha bottom burner on ker k oven k center rack mein rakhein.Is baat ka kayal rakhein k oven preheat us he temperature per hoga jis per bake hoga (170 C).</p>','',26,'paBX3byTpuw','','active','','2017-07-18 09:42:47','Pound Cake ','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Butter 1 Cup\r\n-Sugar 1 Cup\r\n-Eggs 4 large or 5 small\r\n-Flour 2 Cups\r\n-Salt Â½ tsp\r\n-Baking powder 1 tsp\r\n-Vanilla Extract 2 tsp\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-In an electric mixer, add butter and mix for 1-2 mins.\r\n-During mixing on',10,'youtube',''),(291,'Fudgy Brownie Recipe','<p>Brownie Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>â€¢ Flour 1 & Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Salt 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Coco powder unsweetened 1 cup<br>â€¢ Butter melted 1 cup<br>â€¢ Castor sugar 3 cups<br>â€¢ Vanilla essence 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Eggs 4<br><br>Direction:<br>In a bowl, keep a sifter add flour and salt and sift it. Now sift coco powder and mix well dry ingredients and set aside.<br>In another bowl, add butter, caster sugar and mix well with whisk. Add vanilla essence and whisk well to combine all ingredients. Add eggs one at a time and mix well. <br>Add dry flour +coco mixture gradually and mix until combined. <br>Grease baking pan with butter and add batter evenly. Pre heat oven at 190 degrees.<br>Add batter to baking pan and bake brownies for 30-35 minutes. Insert a tooth pick in baked brownie if it comes out clean, its ready. If not than bake for another 5 minutes and check again.<br>You can cut brownies in square or any shape and serve. <br>You can serve it with ice-cream scoop or just sift powdered sugar and serve.<br><br>Recipe in urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Maida 1 & Â½ cup<br>-Namak 1 tsp<br>-Coco powder unsweetened 1 cup<br>-Makhan melted 1 cup<br>-Bareek cheeni 3 cups<br>-Vanilla essence 1 tbs<br>-Anday 4<br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein channi rakh ker maida aur namak chaan lein.<br>-Cocoa powder bhi chaan lein aur tamam ajza ache tarhan mix ker k side per rakh dein.<br>-Alag bowl mein makhan melted aur bareek cheeni dal ker ache tarhan whisk ki madad sa mix ker lein.<br>-Vanilla essence dal ker tamam ajza ko whisk ker lein.<br>-Ab anday ek,ek ker k shamil karein aur mix kertay jayein.<br>-Dry flour +coco mixture thora thora ker k daltay jayein aur mix ker lein.<br>-Baking pan ko makhan sa grease ker lein aur batter dal dein.<br>-190 C per oven ko pre-heat ker lein aur brownies ko 30-35 minutes kliya bake ker lein.<br>-Brownie mein tooth pick insert ker k check ker lein agar tooth pick saf niklay tou brownie tayyar hai,agar saf nahi niklay tou 5 minutes aur bake ker k check karein.<br>-Brownies ko square ya kissi bhi shape mein cut ker k serve karein.<br>-Ice-cream scoop ya powdered sugar chirak ker bhi serve ker saktay han.</p>','',26,'_CX4pQ5-ick','','active','','2017-07-18 09:44:08','Fudgy Brownie Recipe','','Brownie Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nâ€¢ Flour 1 & Â½ cup\r\nâ€¢ Salt 1 tsp\r\nâ€¢ Coco powder unsweetened 1 cup\r\nâ€¢ Butter melted 1 cup\r\nâ€¢ Castor sugar 3 cups\r\nâ€¢ Vanilla essence 1 tbs\r\nâ€¢ Eggs 4\r\n\r\nDirection:\r\nIn a bowl, keep a sifter add flour ',15,'youtube',''),(292,'Molten Chocolate Lava Cake','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>â€¢ Butter 4 Tbs<br>â€¢ Semi-sweet chocolate chips 1/3 cup<br>â€¢ Icing sugar Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Egg yolk 1<br>â€¢ Egg 1 <br>â€¢ All-purpose flour 3 Tbs<br>â€¢ Vanilla extract Â¼ tsp<br>â€¢ 2â€ deep ramekins<br><br>Directions:<br>-Preheat oven at 200 C.<br>-Add butter and chocolate in a bowl and microwave for 30- 45 seconds or until butter and chocolate melts. Mix well.<br>-Stir in the sugar until well blended. <br>-Add egg yolk and egg, whisk well. Stir in flour, mix well.<br>-Add vanilla extract and give it a good mix.<br>-Grease your ramekins or 2 inch deep oven safe bowls. Add some flour or coco powder and dust excess.<br>-Add mixture in ramekins/bowls. Add bake at 200 C for exact 14 minutes. Cake should have firm side and the center remains soft. Let stand for a minute and invert the cake on separate plates while itâ€™s warm.<br>-Sprinkle icing sugar and serve.<br><br>Tips:<br>â€¢ This recipe is not for microwave.<br>â€¢ If ramekins are not available use small bowl (preferably 2x2 inch deep) which are oven safe or a cupcake tray.<br>â€¢ This recipe yields 2 cakes.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>â€¢ Makhan 4 Tbs<br>â€¢ Semi-sweet chocolate chips 1/3 cup<br>â€¢ Icing sugar Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Anday ki zarde 1<br>â€¢ Anda 1 <br>â€¢ Maida 3 Tbs<br>â€¢ Vanilla extract Â¼ tsp<br>â€¢ 2â€ deep ramekins<br><br>Directions:<br>-Oven ko 200 C per preheat kerlein.<br>-Bowl mein makhan aur chocolate dal ker 30-45 seconds kliya microwave mein melt karein aur mix kerlein.<br>-Icing sugar dal ker ache tarhan mix karein.<br>-Ab is mein anday ki zarde aur anda dal ker whisk karein. Maida shamil karein aur mix karein.<br>-Akhir mein vanilla extract dal kr ache tarhan mix kerlein.<br>-Ramekins ya 2 inch deep oven safe bowls ko grease karein.Maida ya coco powder chirak dein aur extra nikal lein.<br>-Ramekins/bowls mein mixture dal dein aur 200 C per 14 mintues kliya bake ker lein.Oven sa nikal ka 1 minute kliya bahir rahein phr plate per ulta ker n ramekin sa nikal lein.<br>-Icing sugar chirak ker serve karein.<br><br>Tips:<br>â€¢ Yeh recipe microwave kliya nahi hai.<br>â€¢ Agar ramekins available nahi hun tou small bowls (preferably 2x2 inch deep)jo oven safe hun ya cupcake tray istamal ker saktay han.<br>â€¢ Is recipe sa 2 cakes tayyar hunga.</p>','',26,'jWaf5lgDEOM','','active','','2017-07-18 09:58:00','Molten Chocolate Lava Cake','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nâ€¢ Butter 4 Tbs\r\nâ€¢ Semi-sweet chocolate chips 1/3 cup\r\nâ€¢ Icing sugar Â½ cup\r\nâ€¢ Egg yolk 1\r\nâ€¢ Egg 1 \r\nâ€¢ All-purpose flour 3 Tbs\r\nâ€¢ Vanilla extract Â¼ tsp\r\nâ€¢ 2â€ deep ramekins\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-Preheat oven',11,'youtube',''),(293,'BREAD HOMEMADE','<p>BREAD HOMEMADE</p>','',26,'oAy21ymZz-8','','active','','2017-07-18 14:06:21','BREAD HOMEMADE','','BREAD HOMEMADE',9,'youtube',''),(294,'QUICHE RECIPE','<p>QUICHE RECIPE</p>','',26,'uvKv6EO1H10','','active','','2017-07-18 14:06:53','QUICHE RECIPE','','QUICHE RECIPE',10,'youtube',''),(295,'CUSTARD CAKE ','<p>CUSTARD CAKE&nbsp;</p>','',26,'1H3F-1m4lfU','','active','','2017-07-18 14:08:30','CUSTARD CAKE ','','CUSTARD CAKE ',8,'youtube',''),(296,'HABSHI HALWA','<p>HABSHI HALWA</p>','',26,'YUUHc6aApiU','','active','','2017-07-18 14:10:38','HABSHI HALWA','','HABSHI HALWA',7,'youtube',''),(297,'LOKI KA HALWA','<p>LOKI KA HALWA</p>','',26,'hBzi7QRKKwI','','active','','2017-07-18 14:11:08','LOKI KA HALWA','','LOKI KA HALWA',8,'youtube',''),(298,'MANGO KHEER - Ù…ÛŒÙ†Ú¯Ùˆ Ú©Ú¾ÛŒØ±','<p>MANGO KHEER - Ù…ÛŒÙ†Ú¯Ùˆ Ú©Ú¾ÛŒØ±</p>','',26,'-3tmep4LEVo','','active','','2017-07-18 14:11:49','MANGO KHEER - Ù…ÛŒÙ†Ú¯Ùˆ Ú©Ú¾ÛŒØ±','','MANGO KHEER - Ù…ÛŒÙ†Ú¯Ùˆ Ú©Ú¾ÛŒØ±',9,'youtube',''),(299,'BREAD & VEG KEBAB','<p>BREAD & VEG KEBAB - Ø¨Ø±ÛŒÚˆ Ø§ÙˆØ± Ø³Ø¨Ø²ÛŒ Ú©Ø¨Ø§Ø¨ - à¤¬à¥à¤°à¥ˆà¤¡ à¤”à¤° à¤¸à¤¬à¥à¤œà¥€ à¤•à¤¬à¤¾à¤¬&nbsp;</p>','',26,'WzhdyDKVgBk','','active','','2017-07-18 14:13:11','BREAD & VEG KEBAB','','BREAD & VEG KEBAB - Ø¨Ø±ÛŒÚˆ 