sp <br>-Dhania (Coriander seeds) roasted & crushed 1 & Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) roasted & crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs<br>-Oil 4-5 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 2-3<br>-Curry pata (Curry leaves) 10-12<br>-Pyaz (Onion) chopped 1 large<br><br>Directions:<br>-In bowl,add chicken,dahi,ginger garlic powder,kashmiri red chili powder,coriander seeds,cumin seeds, black pepper powder,turmeric powder,salt and lemon juice,mix well and marinate for 1 hour.<br>-In pot,add oil,green chilies,curry leaves and mix well.<br>-Add onion and fry until light golden.<br>-Add marinated chicken,mix well for 2 minutes and cook until chicken is done (approx.20 minutes on low flame) and keep mixing in between until water dries & oil separates. <br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Chicken 500 gms<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) 1 Cup<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Kashmiri lal mirch powder (Kashmiri red chili powder) 1 & Â½ tsp <br>-Dhania (Coriander seeds) roasted & crushed 1 & Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) roasted & crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Lemon juice 1 tbs<br>-Oil 4-5 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 2-3<br>-Curry pata (Curry leaves) 10-12<br>-Pyaz (Onion) chopped 1 large<br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein chicken,adrak lehsan paste,kashimiri lal mirch powder,dhania,zeera,kali mirch powder, haldee powder,namak aur lemon juice dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur 1 hour kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Pot mein oil,hari mirch aur curry pata dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Pyaz dal ker light golden fry ker lein.<br>-Marinated chicken shamil karein aur 2 minutes kliya ache tarhan mix karein aur chicken gul janay tak paka lein (approx. 20 minutes on low flame) aur chamcha chalatay rahien yahana tak ka pani sukh jaye aur oil alag ho jaye.</p>','',26,'EKXpy5opH5M','','active','','2017-07-18 17:34:38','Chicken Dry Roast Recipe','','Dry Roasted Chicken\r\n\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Chicken 500 gms\r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) 1 Cup\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs\r\n-Kashmiri lal mirch powder (Kashmiri red chili powder) 1 & Â½ tsp \r\n-Dhania (Coriander seeds) roasted & cru',13,'youtube',''),(366,'Chicken Malai Boti Recipe','<p>Ingredients:</p><p><br>â€¢ Green Chilies 2-3<br>â€¢ Coriander Leaves 2 Tbs<br>â€¢ Green Onion Whites 2 Tbs<br>â€¢ Chicken Boneless Â½ Kg<br>â€¢ Meat Tenderizer Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Ginger Garlic Paste 1 Tbs<br>â€¢ Yogurt Â¼ Cup <br>â€¢ Cream Â¼ Cup <br>â€¢ Black Pepper Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ White Pepper Â¼ Tsp<br>â€¢ Whole Spice Powder Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Corn Flour 1 Tbs<br>â€¢ Salt Â½ Tsp Or To Taste <br>â€¢ Lemon Juice 2 Tbs<br>â€¢ Makhan (Butter) Melted 1 Tbs<br><br>Directions:<br><br>In blender, make paste of green chilies, coriander leaves and green onionâ€™s white. <br>In a bowl, add chicken and all ingredients except butter. Mix well and marinate for 2-3 hours<br>Add butter before cooking and mix well.<br>Bake at 180 degrees for 20-25 mins<br>BBQ or shallow fry in a pan until itâ€™s done.<br>Delicious Malai Boti is ready.<br><br>Malai Boti Recipe In Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br><br>â€¢ Hari Mirch 2-3<br>â€¢ Dhania 2 Tbs<br>â€¢ Hari pyaz ka safed hissa 2 Tbs<br>â€¢ Chicken Boneless Â½ Kg<br>â€¢ Meat Tenderizer Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Adrak Lehsan Paste 1 Tbs<br>â€¢ Dahi Â¼ Cup <br>â€¢ Cream Â¼ Cup <br>â€¢ Kali mirch powder Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Safed mirch powder Â¼ Tsp<br>â€¢ Garam Masala Powder Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Corn Flour 1 Tbs<br>â€¢ Namak Â½ Tsp Or To Taste <br>â€¢ Lemon Juice 2 Tbs<br>â€¢ Makhan Melted 1 Tbs<br><br>Banane ka tareeka:<br>Blender main hari mirch, dhania aur hari pyaz ka paste bana ke alaihda rakh lain.<br>Ek bowl main chicken aur baki ajza shamil karlain (siwae makhan ke) Hari mirch ka paste bhi shamil kar lain. Mix karke 2-3 ghante marinate hone keliye rakh den.<br>Banane se pehle makhan shamil karke mix karlain.<br>180 degrees pe 20-25 mins tak bake karain ya phir BBQ ya shallow fry karlain<br>Mazedar Chicken Malai Boti tayar hai.</p>','',26,'DL0w2dmBgTc','','active','','2017-07-18 17:36:09','Chicken Malai Boti Recipe','','Ingredients:\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Green Chilies 2-3\r\nâ€¢ Coriander Leaves 2 Tbs\r\nâ€¢ Green Onion Whites 2 Tbs\r\nâ€¢ Chicken Boneless Â½ Kg\r\nâ€¢ Meat Tenderizer Â½ Tsp\r\nâ€¢ Ginger Garlic Paste 1 Tbs\r\nâ€¢ Yogurt Â¼ Cup \r\nâ€¢ Cream Â¼ Cup \r\nâ€¢ Black Pepper Â½ Tsp\r\nâ€¢ Whi',12,'youtube',''),(371,'Sun Yaara OST | Title Song By Damia Farooq | With Lyrics','<p>Orignal Sound Track of Sun Yaara</p><p><br>Sun yaara is a story of Lala Rukh and her brother Talal. They belong to a very well known and sober family...Talal is a doctor by profession and he has a very arrogant and sophisticated kind of personality.Roshna also likes Talal but she always try to maintain distance from him......Tania is Lala Rukhâ€™s sister in law. She is an antagonist character in the story who wants to marry Talal as well.<br><br>Writer: Asiya Mirza<br><br>Director: Danish Nawaz<br><br>Cast: <br><br>Zarnish<br>Junaid Khan<br>Hira Mani, <br>Faris Shafee <br>Ghanna Ali<br>Nida Mumtaz <br>Ismat Iqbal<br>Laila Wasti<br>Hassan Niazi <br>Asim Mehmood <br>Minal</p>','',31,'Dd-3F1tuIX0','','active','','2017-07-18 17:39:22','Sun Yaara OST | Title Song By Damia Farooq | With Lyrics','','Sun Yaara OST | Title Song By Damia Farooq | With Lyrics',9,'youtube',''),(374,'Sun yaara - 1st Episode - 2nd January 2017 ','<p>Sun yaara â€“ 1st Episode - 2nd January 2017 only on ARY Digital Official YouTube Channel.</p><p><br>Sun yaara is a story of Lala Rukh and her brother Talal. They belong to a very well known and sober family...Talal is a doctor by profession and he has a very arrogant and sophisticated kind of personality.Roshna also likes Talal but she always try to maintain distance from him......Tania is Lala Rukhâ€™s sister in law. She is an an