 vegetables and spices), nihari (a lamb dish), zeera aloo (potatoes lightly fried with cumin seeds), daal, and raita as part of a breakfast meal. It may be stuffed with potatoes, paneer, onions, qeema or chili peppers.</p>','',26,'bHTgbCgeaUA','','active','','2017-07-21 12:49:23','LACHHA PARATHA ','','\r\nThe paratha is an important part of a traditional South Asian breakfast. Traditionally, it is made using ghee but oil is also used. Some people may even bake it in the oven for health reasons. Usually the paratha is eaten with dollops of white butter on',9,'youtube',''),(466,'Pyaaz Ka Spicy Paratha (Onion Paratha) ','<p>Pyaaz Ka Spicy Paratha (Onion Paratha) Recipe By AAmna\'s Kitchen</p><p>How to make?<br>Easy to make<br>Learn step by step<br>very tasty and spicy Paratha Recipe<br>INGREDIENTS:<br>Onion 1 big size Chopped.<br>Green chili 10.<br>Fresh green Coriander 1 cup.<br>Desi Ghee or Cooking oil 4 tbs.<br>Chili Flakes 1 Tbs.<br>Lemon juice 3.<br>Salt 1 tsp.<br>Instant yeast 10 gram.<br>All purpose flour 6 cup.</p>','',26,'HmVDl1QCPt8','','active','','2017-07-21 12:51:53','Pyaaz Ka Spicy Paratha (Onion Paratha) ','','Pyaaz Ka Spicy Paratha (Onion Paratha) Recipe By AAmna\'s Kitchen\r\nHow to make?\r\nEasy to make\r\nLearn step by step\r\nvery tasty and spicy Paratha Recipe\r\nINGREDIENTS:\r\nOnion 1 big size Chopped.\r\nGreen chili 10.\r\nFresh green Coriander 1 cup.\r\nDesi Ghee or Coo',9,'youtube',''),(467,'Halwa Puri (Chanay) Recipe Ø­Ù„ÙˆÛ Ù¾ÙˆØ±ÛŒ Ø§ÙˆØ± Ú†Ù†Û’ - Easy Breakfast Recipes','<p>Halwa Puri (Chanay) Recipe Ø­Ù„ÙˆÛ Ù¾ÙˆØ±ÛŒ Ø§ÙˆØ± Ú†Ù†Û’ - Easy Breakfast Recipes</p>','',26,'-I7HIbMdFuI','','active','','2017-07-21 12:53:19','Halwa Puri (Chanay) Recipe Ø­Ù„ÙˆÛ Ù¾ÙˆØ±ÛŒ Ø§ÙˆØ± Ú†Ù†Û’ - Easy Breakfast Recipes','','Halwa Puri (Chanay) Recipe Ø­Ù„ÙˆÛ Ù¾ÙˆØ±ÛŒ Ø§ÙˆØ± Ú†Ù†Û’ - Easy Breakfast Recipes',7,'youtube',''),(468,'ANDAY KA HALVA','<p>ANDAY KA HALVA</p>','',26,'NN2_kSZCwPo','','active','','2017-07-21 12:55:25','ANDAY KA HALVA','','ANDAY KA HALVA',9,'youtube',''),(469,'HABSHI HALWA','<p>HABSHI HALWA</p>','',26,'YUUHc6aApiU','','active','','2017-07-21 12:59:00','HABSHI HALWA','','HABSHI HALWA',10,'youtube',''),(470,'KASHMIRI CHAI (TEA)','<p>KASHMIRI CHAI (TEA)</p>','',26,'vbycIrzTrDU','','active','','2017-07-21 13:00:05','KASHMIRI CHAI (TEA)','','KASHMIRI CHAI (TEA)',10,'youtube',''),(471,'SHAHI KULFA','<p>SHAHI KULFA</p>','',26,'Rb_yJNd8p00','','active','','2017-07-21 13:02:31','SHAHI KULFA','','SHAHI KULFA',6,'youtube',''),(472,'FALOODA RECIPE','<p>FALOODA RECIPE</p>','',26,'ZsJLHA4bkXs','','active','','2017-07-21 13:03:38','FALOODA RECIPE','','FALOODA RECIPE',9,'youtube',''),(473,'Ice cream Falooda ','<p>Ice cream Falooda Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 litre<br>-Tetrapack cream 200 ml<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â¼ Cup or to taste<br>-Vanilla essence Â¼ tsp<br>-Corn flour 1 & Â½ tbs (optional)<br>-Pani (Water) Â¼ Cup<br>-Tukh malanga (basil seeds) 1 tbs or as required<br>Assembling:<br>-Lal sharbat as required<br>-Corn flour ki seviyan (Corn flour vermicelli)<br>-Tukh malanga (Basil seeds)<br>-Green jelly<br>-Red jelly<br>-Mix dry fruit crushed <br>-Rabri (Thickened milk)<br>-Vanilla ice cream<br><br>Directions:<br>-In pot,add milk,tetrapack cream,sugar and vanilla essence,whisk well.<br>-When comes to boil,dissolve corn flour in water and add in it,mix well and cook until milk is thickened.Rabri (thickened milk) is ready and let it cool.<br>-In glass,add basil leaves and soak in water for 15-20 minutes.<br>Assembling:<br>-In glass,add lal sharbat,corn flour vermicelli,basil seeds,green jelly,red jelly,mix dry fruits,rabri (thickened milk),vanilla ice cream,red jelly,green jelly,mix dry fruits and drizzle lal sharbat.<br>-Ice cream faluda is ready.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 litre<br>-Tetrapack cream 200 ml<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â¼ Cup or to taste<br>-Vanilla essence Â¼ tsp<br>-Corn flour 1 & Â½ tbs (optional)<br>-Pani (Water) Â¼ Cup<br>-Tukh malanga (basil seeds) 1 tbs or as required<br>Assembling:<br>-Lal sharbat as required<br>-Corn flour ki seviyan (Corn flour vermicelli)<br>-Tukh malanga (Basil seeds)<br>-Green jelly<br>-Red jelly<br>-Mix dry fruit crushed <br>-Rabri (Thickened milk)<br>-Vanilla ice cream<br><br>Directions:<br>-Pot mein doodh,tetrapack cream,cheeni aur vanilla essence dal ker ache tarhan whisk ker lein.<br>-Jab ubal anay lagay tou corn flour ko pani mein dissolve ker ka dal dein,ache tarhan mix ker lein aur doodh garha hunay tak paka lein.Rabri (thickened milk) tayyar hai aur thanda ker lein.<br>-Glass mein tukh malanga dal ker 15-20 minutes kliya pani mein bheego dein.<br>Assembling:<br>-Glass mein lal sharbat,corn flour ki seviyan,tukh malanga,green jelley,red jelly,mix dry fruits,rabri (thickened milk),vanilla ice cream,red jelly,green jelly,mix dry fruits aur lal sharbat dal dein.<br>-Ice cream faluda tayyar hai.</p>','',26,'rGUD9buuK3M','','active','','2017-07-21 13:05:00','Ice cream Falooda ','','Ice cream Falooda Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Doodh (Milk) 1 litre\r\n-Tetrapack cream 200 ml\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) Â¼ Cup or to taste\r\n-Vanilla essence Â¼ tsp\r\n-Corn flour 1 & Â½ tbs (optional)\r\n-Pani (Water) Â¼ Cup\r\n-Tukh malanga (basil seeds) 1 tbs o',5,'youtube',''),(474,'Vanilla Ice Cream','<p>Vanila Ice Cream Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 400 ml<br>-Cream 400 ml<br>-Vanilla essence Â½ tsp<br>-Anday ki zarde (Egg yolks) 4<br>-Bareek cheeni (Caster sugar) Â½ Cup<br><br>Directions:<br>-In pot,add milk,cream and vanilla essence,bring it to boil while mixing continuously (4-5 minutes).<br>-Remove from heat and whisk until it comes to room temperature.<br>-In bowl,add egg yolks,caster sugar and beat until it changes color.<br>-Now gradually add milk mixture in egg mixture,whisk until well combined and strain it.<br>-Put it back on stove,whisk until custard thickens and let it cool.<br>-Pour the mixture in air tight container and freeze it for 4 hours.<br>-Take out from freezer,beat for 2 minutes,cover and freeze for 4 hours.<br>-Again take out from freezer,beat again and put it in freezer for at least 4 hours before serving.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 400 ml<br>-Cream 400 ml<br>-Vanilla essence Â½ tsp<br>-Anday ki zarde (Egg yolks) 4<br>-Bareek cheeni (Caster sugar) Â½ Cup<br><br>Directions:<br>-Pot mein doodh,cream aur vanilla essence dal ker ubal anay tak musalsal whisk kertay rahein (4-5 minutes).<br>-Chulhay sa utar lein aur whisk kertay rahein yahan tak ka room temperature per ajaye.<br>-Bowl mein anday ki zarde aur bareek cheeni dal ker rang tabdeel hunay tak beat ker lein.<br>-Ab egg mixture mein thora thora ker ka milk mixture daltay jayein aur whisk kertay rahein aur strain ker lein.<br>-Dubara chulhay per rakh ker custard garha hunay tak whisk ker lein aur thanda ker lein.<br>-Mixture ko air tight container mein dal dein aur 4 hours kliya freeze ker lein.<br>-Freezer sa nikal ker 2 minutes kliya beat ker lein,dhak ker 4 hours kliya freeze ker lein.<br>-Dubara freezer sa nikal ker beat karein aur serve kerna sa pehlay kum az kum 4 hours kliya freez ker lein.</p>','',26,'O30sDoTgqeQ','','active','','2017-07-21 13:05:51','Vanilla Ice Cream','','Vanila Ice Cream Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Doodh (Milk) 400 ml\r\n-Cream 400 ml\r\n-Vanilla essence Â½ tsp\r\n-Anday ki zarde (Egg yolks) 4\r\n-Bareek cheeni (Caster sugar) Â½ Cup\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-In pot,add milk,cream and vanilla essence,bring it to b',9,'youtube',''),(475,'Homemade ice cream cones','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>-Anda (Egg) 1<br>-Bareek cheeni (Caster sugar) Â¼ Cup<br>-Doodh (Milk) 2 tbs<br>-Vanilla essence/Extract Â½ tsp<br>-Makhan (Butter) melted & room temperature 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1/3 Cup<br>-Melted chocolate<br>-Multi sprinkles<br>-Ice cream of your choice<br>-Bunties<br>-Chocolate sauce<br><br>Directions:<br>-Take a sheet and cut into triangle shape,fold and make a cone,wrap the cone in aluminum foil.<br>-In bowl,add egg and caster sugar,mix well.<br>-Add milk,vanilla essence/extract,butter and mix well.<br>-Add all-purpose flour and mix well into a smooth batter.<br>-Grease frying pan,pour batter and cook each side for 2-3 minutes or until golden (low flame).<br>-Flip when bubbles rise on the surface (Approx. 2 minutes each side).<br>-Remove from frying pan and roll into a cone shape while hot and let it cool & harden.<br>-Now dip prepared cone into melted chocolate,multi sprinkles,add ice cream scoop and garnish with multi sprinkles,bunties and chocolate sauce.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Anda (Egg) 1<br>-Bareek cheeni (Caster sugar) Â¼ Cup<br>-Doodh (Milk) 2 tbs<br>-Vanilla essence/Extract Â½ tsp<br>-Makhan (Butter) melted & room temperature 1 & Â½ tbs<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1/3 Cup<br>-Melted chocolate<br>-Multi sprinkles<br>-Ice cream of your choice<br>-Bunties<br>-Chocolate sauce<br><br>Directions:<br>-Sheet ko la ker triangle shape mein cut ker lein,fold arein aur cone ki shape bana lein,aluminum foil mein wrap ker lein.<br>-Bowl mein anda aur bareek cheeni dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Doodh vanilla essence/extract aur makhan dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Maida shamil karein aur smooth batter hunay tak ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Frying pan ko grease karein,batter dal dein aur ek side ko halki anccg per 2-3 minutes ya golden hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Jab surface per bubbles ajayein tou palat lein (Approx. 2 minutes each side).<br>-Frying pan sa hata lein aur garam he cone ki shape mein roll ker lein aur thanda aur sakh hunay kliya chor dien.<br>-Ab tayyar cones ko melted chocolate,multi sprinkles mein dip karein,ice cream scoop rakh dein aur multi sprinkles,bunties aur chocolate sauce sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'7tRog8I-sVE','','active','','2017-07-21 13:06:45','Homemade ice cream cones','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Anda (Egg) 1\r\n-Bareek cheeni (Caster sugar) Â¼ Cup\r\n-Doodh (Milk) 2 tbs\r\n-Vanilla essence/Extract Â½ tsp\r\n-Makhan (Butter) melted & room temperature 1 & Â½ tbs\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1/3 Cup\r\n-Melted chocolate\r\n-M',8,'youtube',''),(476,'Monster Shakes ','<p>Monster Shakes</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Brownie & Peanut-Butter Shake:<br>Ingredients:<br>-Chocolate ice-cream 3 scoops<br>-Doodh (Milk) Â¾ Cup <br>-Peanut butter 2 tbs <br>-Brownies 2 <br><br>Directions:<br>-In blender,add chocolate ice-cream scoops,milk,peanut butter,brownies and blend until well combined.<br>-Decorate glass with peanut butter,white and black chocolate chips,pour brownie & peanut butter shake,add chocolate ice-cream,whip cream,brownie and garnish with whip cream.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Chocolate ice-cream 3 scoops<br>-Doodh (Milk) Â¾ Cup <br>-Peanut butter 2 tbs <br>-Brownies 2 <br><br>Directions:<br>-Blender mein chocolate ice-cream scoops,doodh,peanut butter aur brownies dal ker ache tarhan blend ker lein.<br>-Glass ko peanut butter,white aur black chocolate chips sa decorate ker lein,brownie & peanut butter shake dal dein,chocolate ice-cream,whip cream aur brownie dal ker,whip cream sa garnish karein.<br><br>Recipe in English:<br><br><br>Coffee Oreo Shake with Coffee Ganache:<br>Ingredients:<br>Coffee Ganache:<br>-Chocolate 200 gms<br>-Instant coffee 1 tsp <br>-Tetra pack cream 1 cup <br>Coffee Oreo Shake:<br>-Vanilla ice-cream 3 scoops<br>-Doodh (Milk) Â¾ Cup <br>-Instant coffee 1 tsp<br>-Oreo biscuits 7-8<br><br>Direction:<br>For Coffee Ganache:<br>-In bowl,add chocolate,instant coffee and tetra pack and microwave for 1 minute,mix well until smooth.<br>Coffee Oreo Shake:<br>-In blender,add vanilla ice-cream,milk,instant coffee,oreo biscuits and blend until well combined.<br>-Decorate glass with coffee ganache,brownie crumbs,bunties,pour oreo & coffe shake,add vanilla ice-cream and garnish with wafer sticks and chocolate sauce.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Ingredients:<br>Coffee Ganache:<br>-Chocolate 200 gms<br>-Instant coffee 1 tsp <br>-Tetra pack cream 1 cup <br>Coffee Oreo Shake:<br>-Vanilla ice-cream 3 scoops<br>-Doodh (Milk) Â¾ Cup <br>-Instant coffee 1 tsp<br>-Oreo biscuits 7-8<br><br>Directions:<br>For Coffee ganache:<br>-Bowl mein chocolate,instant coffee aur tetra pack cream dal ker 1 minute kliya microwave ker lein aur smooth hunay tak ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>Coffee Oreo Shake:<br>-Blender mein vanilla ice-cream,doodh,instant coffe aur oreo biscuits dal ker ache tarhan blend ker lein.<br>-Glass ko coffee ganache,bread crumbs and bunties laga ker decorate ker lein,oreo & coffe shake,vanilla ice-cream dal dein aur wafer sticks aur chocosalte sause sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'op5sCQW-mXY','','active','','2017-07-21 13:10:28','Monster Shakes ','','Monster Shakes\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nBrownie & Peanut-Butter Shake:\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Chocolate ice-cream 3 scoops\r\n-Doodh (Milk) Â¾ Cup \r\n-Peanut butter 2 tbs \r\n-Brownies 2 \r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-In blender,add chocolate ice-cream scoops,milk,peanut butter,bro',14,'youtube',''),(477,'Finger Fish with tzatziki sauce Recipe ','<p>This is a tried and tested Fish finger recipe. We used kingfish for this which is known as Surmai in Urdu.&nbsp;</p><p>And to go with it we also made Tzatziki sauce which is pronounced as Zatziki sauce. <br>Give it a try and you will definitely love this recipe. <br>A tip for you is that you can freese the fish fingers for a few days but not more. Use think breadcrumbs for the nice exterior texture. <br><br>If you dont want to deep fry then just simply bake it. <br><br><br>Recipe by Maria Mubeen<br><br><br>Fish Fingers with Tzatziki Sauce Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>- Fish Fingers Surmaee (Kingfish) or any of your choice Â½ kg <br>- Turmeric 1 tsp<br>- Vinegar 1 tbs<br>- Salt 1 Â½ tsp Or to taste<br>- Black Pepper 1 tsp <br>- Egg 2<br>- Flour 1 Cup<br>- Bread Crumbs 1 Â½ Cup<br>- Oregano 1 tsp<br>- Lemon Zest 1 tbs<br>- Oil for Deep Fry<br>Tzatziki Sauce:<br>- Yogurt 1 cup<br>- Lemon Juice 1 tbs<br>- Cucumber medium shredded<br>- Salt Â½ tsp<br>- Fresh Dill 1 tsp<br><br>Directions:<br>- Wash fish fingers and add vinegar & turmeric in it and leave for 15 mins. Wash the fish fingers again and put it in a strainer so they become dry. <br>- Now prepare the coatings for fish. <br>- Beat the eggs in a bowl. Take flour in another bowl.<br>- In third bowl, add Salt, Black Pepper, Oregano and lemon Zest in Bread Crumbs mix well and set aside. <br>- Now coat fish fingers in Flour first then dip them in beaten eggs and lastly coat with Bread Crumbs. Repeat the process for all and put them in freezer for 15 mins. <br>- Heat the oil in pan and keeping the flame medium. Fry the Fish Fingers. <br>- Fish fingers can be baked in a preheated oven at 200C for 15-20 mins. <br>Tzatziki Sauce:<br>- For Tzatziki sauce, Hang the yogurt in cheese cloth or any fine cloth for 20 mins so the water drain out from yogurt. <br>- Squeeze shredded cucumber to take out excess water.<br>- Add lemon juice, salt, shredded cucumber and dill in yogurt. Mix well and chill the sauce. <br>- Serve with Fish Fingers<br><br>Fish Fingers with Tzatziki Sauce Recipe in Urdu<br><br>Ingredients:<br>- Fish Fingers Surmaee (Kingfish) or any of your choice Â½ kg<br>- Haldi 1 tsp<br>- Sirka 1 tbs<br>- Namak 1 Â½ tsp Or to taste<br>- Kali Mirch Powder 1 tsp <br>- Anday 2<br>- Maida 1 Cup<br>- Bread Crumbs 1 Â½ Cup<br>- Oregano 1 tsp<br>- Lemon zest 1 tbs<br>- Oil Deep Fry ke liye<br>Tzatziki Sauce:<br>- Dahi 1 cup<br>- Lemon juice 1 tbs<br>- Kheera medium shredded<br>- Namak Â½ tsp<br>- Soya 1 tsp<br><br>Directions:<br>- Fish fingers ko dho kar sirka aur haldi laga kar 15 min rakhein phir ek dafa aur dho kar strainer main daal dein take uska saara pani nikal jaye and dry hojaye. <br>- Fish ki coating tyar karein. <br>- 1 bowl main 2 andey beat karlein. Dosre bowl main maida nikal lain. <br>- Teesre bowl main bread crumbs lain aur namak, kali mirch, oregano, lemon zest shamil Karke mix karlain. <br>- Ab fish ko maide main dust karein phir anday main dip karein aur akhir main bread crumbs main coat karke rakhein. Saare pieces aise coat karlain. Ab coated fish fingers ko 15 min ke liye freezer main rakh dein. <br>- Karhai main oil garam karke medium heat pe Fish fingers ko Fry karlein. <br>- Fish fingers ko preheated oven main @ 200 C pe 15-20 mins ke liye bake bhi kiya jasakta hai.<br>Tzatziki Sauce: <br>- Dahi ko bareek kapray ya cheese cloth main 20 mins ke liye latka dain. Is se uska sara pani nikal jayega. <br>- Shredded kheera ko squeeze karain take zaid paani nikal jaye.<br>- Ab is main lemon juice, namak, kadukash kheera aur soya shamil kar ke schi tarah mix karlein. Sauce tayar hai.<br>- Fish Fingers ke sath serve karein.</p>','',26,'21wQLz9zytg','','active','','2017-07-21 13:11:26','Finger Fish with tzatziki sauce Recipe ','','This is a tried and tested Fish finger recipe. We used kingfish for this which is known as Surmai in Urdu. \r\nAnd to go with it we also made Tzatziki sauce which is pronounced as Zatziki sauce. \r\nGive it a try and you will definitely love this recipe. \r\nA ',7,'youtube',''),(478,'Crispy Fried Fish with Tartar Sauce','<p>Crispy Fried Fish Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>Marination:<br>-Leemo ka rus (Lemon juice) 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ tsp<br>-Kali mirch (Black pepper) Crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Boneless fish biscuits Â½ kg<br>Coating:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 cup<br>-Sirka (Vinegar) 1 tbs<br>-Ande (Eggs) 2<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup<br>-Cornflour 1 & Â½ tsp <br>-Chawal ka aata (Rice flour) 2 tsp<br>-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Dried oregano 1 tsp<br>-Paprika powder 1 tsp<br>-Chicken powder 1 tsp<br>-Lehsan powder (Garlic powder) 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp<br>-Oil for frying <br><br>Tartar Sauce:<br>-Mayonnaise Â½ cup<br>-Pickled cucumber 1 tbs <br>-Pickled jalapenos 1 tbs <br>-Hara pyaz (Green onion) chopped 1 tbs <br>-Parsley or dhania (Green coriander) Chopped Â½ tbs<br>-Worcestershire sauce Â¼ tsp<br>-Yellow mustard 1 tsp<br>-Hot pepper sauce Â½ tsp <br>-Leemo ka rus (Lemon juice) 1 tsp <br><br>Direction:<br>-In bowl,add lemon juice,salt,sugar and black pepper crushed,mix well.<br>-Add boneless fish biscuits,mix it and marinate for 15-20 minutes.<br>-In milk,add vinegar,mix and leave for 5-10 minutes.Butter milk is ready is ready to use.<br>-In bowl,beat eggs,add butter milk,mix well and set aside.<br>-In separate bowl, add all-purpose flour,corn flour,rice flour,white pepper powder,dried oregano,paprika powder,chicken powder,garlic powder and salt, mix well and set aside.<br>-Now dip marinated fish biscuits in egg mixture then coat in flour mixture,again dip in egg mixture and coat in flour mixture and deep fry until golden on medium low flame.<br>-Crispy fried fish is ready, serve with tartar sauce.<br>-For Tartar sauce, in bowl add mayonnaise, pickled cucumber,pickled jalapenos,green onion (chopped),parsley or green coriander (chopped),worcestershire sauce,mustard paste,hot pepper sauce and lemon juice,mix well<br>-Tartar sauce is ready.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Marination:<br>-Leemo ka rus (Lemon juice) 1 tbs<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp<br>-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ tsp<br>-Kali mirch (Black pepper) Crushed Â½ tsp<br>-Boneless fish biscuits Â½ kg<br>Coating:<br>-Doodh (Milk) 1 cup<br>-Sirka (Vinegar) 1 tbs<br>-Ande (Eggs) 2<br>-Maida (All-purpose flour) 1 Cup<br>-Cornflour 1 & Â½ tsp <br>-Chawal ka aata (Rice flour) 2 tsp<br>-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Dried oregano 1 tsp<br>-Paprika powder 1 tsp<br>-Chicken powder 1 tsp<br>-Lehsan powder (Garlic powder) 1 tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp<br>-Oil for frying <br><br>Tartar Sauce:<br>-Mayonnaise Â½ cup<br>-Pickled cucumber 1 tbs <br>-Pickled jalapenos 1 tbs <br>-Hara pyaz (Green onion) chopped 1 tbs <br>-Parsley or dhania (Green coriander) Chopped Â½ tbs<br>-Worcestershire sauce Â¼ tsp<br>-Yellow mustard 1 tsp<br>-Hot pepper sauce Â½ tsp <br>-Leemo ka rus (Lemon juice) 1 tsp <br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein leemo ka rus,namak,cheeni aur kali mirch crushed dal ker mix kerlein.<br>-Boneless fish biscuits dal mix karein aur 15-20 minute kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Doodh mein sirka dal ker mix karein aur 5-10 minute kliya chor dein.Butter milk use kerna ka liya tayyar hai.<br>-Bowl mein ande dal ker beat karein,butter milk shamil ker k ache tarhan mix ker lein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Alag bowl mein,maida,corn flour,chawal ka aata,safed mirch powder,dried oregano,paprika powder,chicken powder,lehsan powder aur namak dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Ab marinated fish biscuits ko egg mixture mein dip karein phir flour mixture mein coat karein phir dubara egg mixture mein dip ker ka flour mixtrure mein coat ker lein aur halki darmiyani ancch per sunhairi hunay tak deep fry ker lein.<br>-Crispy fried fish tayyar hai,tartar sauce ka saath serve karein.<br>-Tartar sauce kliya,bowl mein mayonnaise,pickled cucumber,pickled jalapenos,hara pyaz (chopped),parsley or hara dhania (chopped),worcestershire sauce,mustard paste,hot pepper sauce aur lemmo ka rus dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Tartar sauce tayyar hai.</p>','',26,'q6HBsWN9Jus','','active','','2017-07-21 13:12:21','Crispy Fried Fish with Tartar Sauce','','Crispy Fried Fish Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nMarination:\r\n-Leemo ka rus (Lemon juice) 1 tbs\r\n-Namak (Salt) Â¼ tsp\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) Â½ tsp\r\n-Kali mirch (Black pepper) Crushed Â½ tsp\r\n-Boneless fish biscuits Â½ kg\r\nCoating:\r\n-Doodh (Milk) 1 cup\r\n-S',9,'youtube',''),(479,'Machli ka Salan (Fish Curry) ','<p>Fish Curry (Machli ka salan)</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br><br>Fish Marinade:<br>Yogurt 1 & Â½ cup<br>Red chili powder 1 & Â½ tbs<br>Turmeric powder Â½ tsp<br>Coriander powder 1 & Â½ tbs<br>Ginger garlic paste 2 tbs<br>Salt 2tsp or to taste<br>Lemon juice 2-3 tbs<br>Fish (Surmai) 1 kg<br><br>Fish Gravy:<br>Oil Â¾ cup<br>Fenugreek seeds Â½ tsp<br>Nigella seeds 1 tsp<br>Mustard seeds 1 tsp<br>Fennel seeds 1 tsp (crushed)<br>Curry leaves 15-20 leaves<br>Onion 3 medium (finely chopped)<br>Water 1-2 cups<br>Whole spice powder 1 tsp<br>Fresh coriander (chopped) for garnishing <br><br>Directions:<br>Fish Marinade:<br>-Wash fish properly with water.<br>-In a bowl, add yogurt, red chili powder, turmeric powder, coriander powder, ginger garlic paste, salt and lemon juice; mix well.<br>-Add fish and give it a good mix.<br>-Marinate fish for 1-2 hours.<br><br>Fish Gravy:<br>-In pot, heat oil and add fenugreek seeds, nigella seeds, mustard seeds, fennel seeds and curry leaves, sautÃ© for a minute.<br>-Add onion (finely chopped) and fry until light golden.<br>-Now add marinated fish and cook on a high flame for 5-7 minutes or until oil appears on surface.<br>-Add water, cover and cook on medium low flame for 10-15 minutes.<br>-Lastly add whole spice powder and fresh coriander (chopped) and simmer for 2-3 minutes.<br>-Fish curry is ready.<br><br><br><br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br><br>Fish Marinade:<br>Dahi1 & Â½ cup<br>Lal mirch 1 & Â½ tbs<br>Haldee powder Â½ tsp<br>Dhania powder 1 & Â½ tbs<br>Adrak lehsan paste 2 tbs<br>Namak 2tsp or hasb e zaiqa<br>Lemmo ka rus 2-3 tbs<br>Machli (Surmai) 1 kg<br><br>Fish Gravy:<br>Oil Â¾ cup<br>Meethi dana Â½ tsp<br>Kalonji 1 tsp<br>Rai dana 1 tsp<br>Saunf 1 tsp (crushed)<br>Kari pata 15-20 leaves<br>Pyaz 3 medium (finely chopped)<br>Pani 2 cups<br>Garam masala powder 1 tsp<br>Hara dhania (chopped) for garnishing <br><br>Directions:<br>For Fish marination:<br>-Bowl mein dahi, lal mirch powder, haldee powder, dhania powder, adrak lehsan paste, namak aur lemmo ka rus dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Machli shamil karein aur ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-1-2 hours keliya marinate ker lein.<br><br>For Gravy:<br>-Pot mein oil garam karein,meethi dana, kalonji,rai dana,saunf aur kari pata dal ker ek minute kliya saute ker lein.<br>-Pyaz (finely chopped) dal ker halki sunhairi hunay tak fry ker lein.<br>-Ab is mein marinated machli dal ker tez ancch per 5-7 minutes ya oil upper anay tak paka lein.<br>-Pani shamil karein,dhak ker darmiyani ancch per 10-15 minutes kliya paka lein.<br>-Akhir mein garam masala powder aur hara dhania (chopped) dal ker 2-3 mins kliya dum per rakh dein.<br>-Machli ka salan tayyar hai.</p>','',26,'8ocFDQqLWyE','','active','','2017-07-21 13:13:40','Machli ka Salan (Fish Curry) ','','Fish Curry (Machli ka salan)\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n\r\nFish Marinade:\r\nYogurt 1 & Â½ cup\r\nRed chili powder 1 & Â½ tbs\r\nTurmeric powder Â½ tsp\r\nCoriander powder 1 & Â½ tbs\r\nGinger garlic paste 2 tbs\r\nSalt 2tsp or to taste\r\nLemon juice 2-3 tbs\r',7,'youtube',''),(480,'Fish fry with masala (Fried Fish) ','<p>Fish Fry with masala Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>1. Kasuri methi (fenugreek leaves) 1 tbs <br>2. Zeera (cumin seeds) roasted & crushed 1 & Â½ tsp <br>3. Dhania (coriander seeds) roasted & crushed 2 tsp <br>4. Ajwain (carom seeds) crushed Â½ tsp <br>5. Red chili flakes 1 tbs<br>6. Garam masala powder (whole spice powder) 1 tsp <br>7. Haldee (turmeric) Â½ tsp <br>8. Namak (salt) 1 & Â½ tsp <br>9. Lehsan (garlic) crushed Â½ tbs <br>10. Lemon juice 2-3 tbs <br><br>Masala<br>â€¢ Oil 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Pyaz (onion) chopped 1 <br>â€¢ Tamatar (tomatoes) chopped 2<br>â€¢ Lehsan (garlic) crushed 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Hari mirch (green chilies) chopped 2-3 <br>â€¢ Namak (salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Fish masala Â½ tbs or to taste<br>â€¢ Hara dhania (coriander leaves) handful <br>â€¢ Oil 2-3 tbs <br><br>Directions:<br>â€¢ In a bowl add 1-10 ingredients and mix well. Fish Masala is ready.<br>â€¢ Wash fish properly and apply fish masala and marinate for 2 hours.<br>â€¢ To make masala, heat oil and add chopped vegetables and saute, add salt, Â½ tbs of prepared fish masala and mix well until tomatoes are cooked, add chopped coriander and dish out.<br>â€¢ Heat oil and fry marinated fish, both sides until done (6-8 mins each side).<br>â€¢ Serve with prepared masala<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>1. Kasuri methi (fenugreek leaves) 1 tbs <br>2. Zeera (cumin seeds) roasted & crushed 1 & Â½ tsp <br>3. Dhania (coriander seeds) roasted & crushed 2 tsp <br>4. Ajwain (carom seeds) crushed Â½ tsp <br>5. Red chili flakes 1 tbs<br>6. Garam masala powder (whole spice powder) 1 tsp <br>7. Haldee (turmeric) Â½ tsp <br>8. Namak (salt) 1 & Â½ tsp <br>9. Lehsan (garlic) crushed Â½ tbs <br>10. Lemon juice 2-3 tbs <br><br>Masala<br>â€¢ Oil 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Pyaz (onion) chopped 1 <br>â€¢ Tamatar (tomatoes) chopped 2<br>â€¢ Lehsan (garlic) crushed 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Hari mirch (green chilies) chopped 2-3 <br>â€¢ Namak (salt) Â½ tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Fish masala Â½ tbs or to taste<br>â€¢ Hara dhania (coriander leaves) handful <br>â€¢ Oil 2-3 tbs<br><br>Directions:<br>â€¢ Bowl mein 1-10 tak tamam ajza dal dein aur mix ker lein,fish masala tayyar hai.<br>â€¢ Fish ko ache tarhan dho lein aur fish masala laga ker 2 hour kliya marinate ker lein.<br>â€¢ Masala banana liya,oil garam ker k tamam chopped vegetables dal ker saute ker lein,,namak aur fish masala shamil karein aur tamatar pak Janay tak paka lein,hara dhania chopped dal ker dish out kerlein.<br>â€¢ Oil garam karein aur marinated fish dono taraf sa fry ker lein (6-8 mins each side).<br>â€¢ Prepared masala k saath serve karein.</p>','',26,'H_cXmLuccIs','','active','','2017-07-21 13:15:06','Fish fry with masala (Fried Fish) ','','Fish Fry with masala Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n1. Kasuri methi (fenugreek leaves) 1 tbs \r\n2. Zeera (cumin seeds) roasted & crushed 1 & Â½ tsp \r\n3. Dhania (coriander seeds) roasted & crushed 2 tsp \r\n4. Ajwain (carom seeds) crushed Â½ tsp \r\n5. Red',11,'youtube',''),(481,'Fish Biryani Recipe','<p>Fish Biryani</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>For Spices powder:<br>-Kali mirch sabut (Black pepper corns) Â½ tsp<br>-Laung (Cloves) 4-5 <br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3<br>-Badiyan ka phool (Star anise) 1<br>-Saunf (Fennel seeds) 1 tsp<br>-Dhaniya (Coriander seeds) 1 tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) 1 tsp<br>-Dar chini (Cinnamon stick) 1<br><br>For marinating Fish:<br>-Machli (Fish) King fish/Surmai Â½ kg<br>-Namak (Salt) 1-2 pinch<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ cup<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tbs or to taste<br>-Lemmo ka rus (Lemon juice) 1-2 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tbs or to taste<br>-Ground spices<br>-Machli (fish) king fish/surmai Â½ kg<br><br>For Rice:<br>-Paani (Water) 1 liter<br>-Tez pat (Bay leaves) 2<br>-Badi elaichi (Black cardamom) 2<br>-Badiyan ka phool (Star anise)<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tbs or to taste<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) Â½ tsp<br>-Dar chini (Cinnamon stick) 1<br>-Chawal (Rice) soaked 2 cups<br><br>For Layering:<br>-Ghee Â½ cup<br>-Marinated fish<br>-Boiled rice <br>-Pyaz (Onion) fried Â¼ cup<br>-Hara dhaniya (Green coriander) 2 tbs<br>-Podina (Mint) 2 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) 2-3<br>-Doodh (Milk) Â½ cup <br>-Jaiful & javatri powder (nutmeg & mace powder) Â½ tsp<br><br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Zarda ka rang (Food color) Â¼ tsp<br><br>Direction:<br>-In frying pan,add black pepper corns,cloves,green cardamom,star anise,fennel seeds,coriander seeds,cumin seeds and cinnamon stick,roast until light brown and grind to make a coarse spices powder.<br>-Take fish and apply salt evenly. Leave it for 10-15 minutes and wash properly.<br>-In bowl,add yogurt,red chili powder,lemon juice,ginger garlic paste,turmeric powder and ground spices, mix well.<br>-Now add fish, give it a good mix and marinate for 1-2 hours.<br>-In water, add bay leaves,green cardamom,star anise,salt,cumin seeds and cinnamon stick, bring it to boil.<br>-Add rice and cook until Â¾ th done,strain and set aside.<br>-In pot,heat ghee,add marinated fish and cook on a low flame for 6-8 minutes.<br>-When fish is done,add boiled rice,fried onion,green coriander,mint and green chili.<br>-In milk,add nutmeg & mace powder,whole spice powder and food color,mix well.<br>-Now add milk mixture,cover and steam cook for 15-20 minutes.<br>-Fish biryani is ready.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>For Spices powder:<br>-Kali mirch sabut (Black pepper corns) Â½ tsp<br>-Laung (Cloves) 4-5 <br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3<br>-Badiyan ka phool (Star anise) 1<br>-Saunf (Fennel seeds) 1 tsp<br>-Dhaniya (Coriander seeds) 1 tsp<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) 1 tsp<br>-Dar chini (Cinnamon stick) 1<br><br>For marinating Fish:<br>-Machli (Fish) King fish/Surmai Â½ kg<br>-Namak (Salt) 1-2 pinch<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ cup<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) Â½ tbs or to taste<br>-Lemmo ka rus (Lemon juice) 1-2 tbs<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tbs or to taste<br>-Ground spices<br>-Machli (fish) king fish/surmai Â½ kg<br><br>For Rice:<br>-Paani (Water) 1 liter<br>-Tez pat (Bay leaves) 2<br>-Badi elaichi (Black cardamom) 2<br>-Badiyan ka phool (Star anise)<br>-Namak (Salt) Â½ tbs or to taste<br>-Zeera (Cumin seeds) Â½ tsp<br>-Dar chini (Cinnamon stick) 1<br>-Chawal (Rice) soaked 2 cups<br><br>For Layering:<br>-Ghee Â½ cup<br>-Marinated fish<br>-Boiled rice <br>-Pyaz (Onion) fried Â¼ cup<br>-Hara dhaniya (Green coriander) 2 tbs<br>-Podina (Mint) 2 tbs<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) 2-3<br>-Doodh (Milk) Â½ cup <br>-Jaiful & javatri powder (nutmeg & mace powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Zarda ka rang (Food color) Â¼ tsp<br><br>Direction:<br>-Frying pan mein sabut kali mirch,laung,hari elaichi,badiyan ka phool,saunf,dhaniya,zeera aur dar chini dal ker light brown hunay tak roast ker lein,grind ker k powder bana lein.<br>-Machli per namak chirak ker 10-15 minute kliya rakh dein aur ache tarhan pani sa dho lein.<br>-Bowl mein dahi,lal mirch powder,leemo ka rus,adrak lehsan paste,haldee powder aur grinded spices dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Ab is mein machli shamil ker k ache tarhan mix karein aur 1-2 hours kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Pani mein tez pat,hari elaichi,badiyan ka phool,namak,zeera aur dar chini dal ker ubal lein.<br>-Chawal shamil ker k Â¾ th pak janay tak paka lein,strain ker k side per rakh dein.<br>-Pot mein ghee garam ker k marinated fish shamil karein aur halki ancch per 6-8 minute kliya paka lein.<br>-Jab machi pak jaye tou boiled rice,fried pyaz,hara dhaniya,podina aur hari mich dal dein.<br>-Doodh mein jaiful & javatri powder,garam masala powder aur zarda ka rang dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Ab doodh ka mixture dal ker,dhak ker 15-20 minute kliya steam cook ker lein.<br>-Fish biryani tayyar hai.</p>','',26,'igD00IUAluQ','','active','','2017-07-21 13:19:58','Fish Biryani Recipe','','Fish Biryani\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nFor Spices powder:\r\n-Kali mirch sabut (Black pepper corns) Â½ tsp\r\n-Laung (Cloves) 4-5 \r\n-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3\r\n-Badiyan ka phool (Star anise) 1\r\n-Saunf (Fennel seeds) 1 tsp\r\n-Dhaniya (Coriander',11,'youtube',''),(482,'Chelo Kabab Recipe','<p>Chelo Kebab with Butter Rice Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Chelo Kebab:<br>Ingredients:<br>-Chicken qeema (Chicken mince) Â½ kg<br>-Pyaz (Onion) grated 2 (Remove excess water)<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Paprika powder 1 tsp<br>-Darchini powder (Cinnamon powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Lemon juice Â½ tbs<br>-Ghee 1 tbs<br>-Bread crumbs 1-2 tbs<br>-Oil as required<br>-Pyaz (onion) slices <br>-Tomatoes (tomatoes) slices <br><br>Directions:<br>-In bowl,add chicken mince,onion,ginger garlic paste,paprika powder,cinnamon powder,salt,black pepper powder,lemon juice,ghee,bread crumbs and mix well,cover and marinate for 1-2 hours.<br>-Take a mixture and hook kebabs on flat skewers.<br>-On griddle,add oil and grill/panfry kebabs on medium low flame.<br>-On the same griddle,fry tomatoes and onion.<br>-Serve chelo kebabs with butter rice,onion and tomatoes.<br><br>Butter Rice:<br>Ingredients:<br>-Pani (Water) 2 tbs<br>-Zafran (Saffron) powder or strands Â½ tsp (optional)<br>-Makhan (Butter) 1/3 Cup or as required<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup<br>-Chawal (Rice) 1 & Â½ Cups (boiled with 1 tsp salt)<br><br>Directions:<br>-Dissolve saffron powder or strands in water and mix well and soak for 10 minutes.<br>-In pot,add butter,water and let it melt,add boiled rice and mix gently<br>-Add saffron on top of the rice,cover and put it on low flame for 5-8 minutes.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Chelo Kebab:<br>Ajza:<br>-Chicken qeema (Chicken mince) Â½ kg<br>-Pyaz (Onion) grated 2 (Remove excess water)<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Paprika powder 1 tsp<br>-Darchini powder (Cinnamon powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Lemon juice Â½ tbs<br>-Ghee 1 tbs<br>-Bread crumbs 1-2 tbs<br>-Oil as required<br>-Pyaz (onion) slices <br>-Tomatoes (tomatoes) slices <br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein chicken qeema,pyaz,adrak lehsan paste,paprika powder,darchini powder,namak,kali mirch powder,lemon juice,ghee aur bread crumbs dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein,dhak ker 1-2 hours kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Mixture ka kebabs bana ker flat skewers per laga lein.<br>-Tawa per oil dal dein aur kebabs ko halki darmiyani ancch per panfry/grill ker lein.<br>-Us he tawa per tamatar aur pyaz ko bhi fry ker lein.<br>-Chelo kebabs ko butter rice,pyaz aur tamatar ka saath serve karein.<br><br>Butter Rice:<br>Ajza:<br>-Pani (Water) 2 tbs<br>-Zafran (Saffron) powder or strands Â½ tsp (optional)<br>-Makhan (Butter) 1/3 Cup or as required<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup<br>-Chawal (Rice) 1 & Â½ Cups (boiled with 1 tsp salt)<br><br>Directions:<br>-Zafran powder or strands ko pani mein dissolve karein aur 10 minutes kliya soak ker lein.<br>-Pot mein makhan aur pani dal ker melt ker lein,boiled chawal dal ker gently mix ker lein.<br>-Chawal ka upper zafran dal dein,dhak ker 5-8 minutes kliya halki ancch per rakh dein.</p>','',26,'pM-xLbzng78','','active','','2017-07-21 13:20:51','Chelo Kabab Recipe','','Chelo Kebab with Butter Rice Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nChelo Kebab:\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Chicken qeema (Chicken mince) Â½ kg\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) grated 2 (Remove excess water)\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs\r\n-Paprika powder 1 tsp\r\n-Darchini powder (Ci',8,'youtube',''),(483,'Quick and easy Hummus Recipe','<p>Hummus Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients:<br>Tahini paste:<br>â€¢ Sesame seeds 1 cup <br>â€¢ Olive oil Â¼ cup<br>Hummus:<br>â€¢ Tahini paste (already prepared)<br>â€¢ Chickpeas boiled 2 & Â½ cups<br>â€¢ Olive oil Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Garlic cloves chopped 4-5 <br>â€¢ Lemon juice 2-3 tbs<br>â€¢ Salt 1 tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Water 1-2 tbs <br>Garnish:<br>â€¢ Olive oil 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Paprika Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Olive 1-2 <br><br>Directions:<br>To prepare Tahini paste, toast sesame seed in a dry pan for 3-4 min on a low flame until seeds are fragrant and change color (donâ€™t over toast them to brown) we need very light brown color.<br>Add toasted seed in a blender and add Â¼ cup olive and blend well until it becomes a creamy paste. Â½ cup of Tahini paste is ready which you can keep in refrigerator in an airtight jar for a month. <br>To prepare hummus, in tahini paste add hummus ingredients gradually and blend. <br>Blend well and scrap side in between and again blend. Keep repeating until it is creamy and well mixed. Hummus is ready. Add water according to your desired consistency. We added 2 tablespoons of water.<br>Now dish out hummus, make well with a spoon and drizzle olive oil and paprika. Add 1-2 black or green olive for garnish.<br>You can refrigerate hummus in an airtight container for up to a week. <br><br>Hummus Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Tahini paste:<br>â€¢ Till 1 cup <br>â€¢ Zaiton ka tel Â¼ cup<br>Hummus:<br>â€¢ Tahini paste (already prepared)<br>â€¢ Chole boiled 2 & Â½ cups<br>â€¢ Zaiton ka tel Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Lehsan ke jawe chopped 4-5 <br>â€¢ Lemon juice 2-3 tbs<br>â€¢ Namak 1 tsp or to taste<br>â€¢ Pani 1-2 tbs <br>Garnish:<br>â€¢ Olive oil 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Paprika Â½ tsp<br>â€¢ Zaiton (Sabut) 1-2 <br><br>Directions:<br>Tahini paste tayar karne keliye, 1 cup til ko pan main halki aanch toast kar lain 3-4 min jab tak ke un se khushboo aane lage aur color halka sa brown hojaye. Buht ziada toast nahi karna hai.<br>Toast kiye hue till blender main shamil karain aur Â¼ cup zaitoon ka tel shamil Karen aur tab tak blend karain jab tak creamy paste na ban jaye. Â½ ya us se thori ziada tahini paste tayar hai. Aap tahini paste ko 1 month tak air tight container main fridge main rakh sakte hain.<br>Hummus banane keliye, tayar shuda tahini paste main hummus ke ajza eke k karke shamil Karen aur blend Karen. <br>Blend karne ke doraan sides ko rubber spatula se scrap karte rahen aur blend Karen jab tak ke har ajza sahi se mix ho kar ek creamy paste ban jaye. Pani apni marzi ke hisab se shamil Karen. Is recipe main humne 2 tablespoon pani shamil kia hai. Namak bhi apne taste ke hisaab se shamil Karen. <br>Ab tayar hummus ko bowl main nikalen, chamach ki madad se phela kar beech main jaga banaye aur thora sa olive oil aur paprika chirak den. <br>Hummus ko air tight container main fridge main ek hafte tak rakha jasakta hai.</p>','',26,'5yK4kNoeWbo','','active','','2017-07-21 13:23:24','Quick and easy Hummus Recipe','','Hummus Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nTahini paste:\r\nâ€¢ Sesame seeds 1 cup \r\nâ€¢ Olive oil Â¼ cup\r\nHummus:\r\nâ€¢ Tahini paste (already prepared)\r\nâ€¢ Chickpeas boiled 2 & Â½ cups\r\nâ€¢ Olive oil Â½ cup\r\nâ€¢ Garlic cloves chopped 4-5 \r\nâ€¢ Lemon juice ',13,'youtube',''),(484,'Tempura with prawns  onions rings and more recipe','<p>Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients for Tempura Batter:<br>- Flour 1 cup<br>- Corn Flour 2 tbsp<br>- Black pepper Â½ tsp <br>- Salt 1 tsp<br>- Egg 1<br>- Iced cold soda water Â¾ to 1 cup<br><br>- Oil for deep frying<br>- Corn flour for coating Â½ cup<br>- Prawns 200 gms<br>- Mix vegetables (Onion/French beans/Cauliflower/Carrots/Capsicum/ Brinjal or any of your choice<br><br>Directions:<br>- In a bowl add flour, corn flour, and salt, black pepper and mix well. Add egg and mix. Add chilled soda water gradually. Donâ€™t overmix the batter, it will have small lumps. <br>- Keep the oil for frying on medium heat.<br>- Coat vegetables in corn flour and then in batter and deep fry. Repeat procedure for prawns.<br>- Fry till light golden. <br>- Serve with sauce of your choice. <br><br>Tips:<br>Tempura batter should be light and have a crisp coating that doesn\'t absorb oil when fried. To achieve that result you need to keep following tips in mind:<br>â€¢ Don\'t overmix your batter. If you over mixed it batter will become heavy. <br>â€¢ Use only chilled soda water. You can replace soda water with ice cold water but result will be slightly different.<br>â€¢ Preparing the batter ahead of time is not recommended. Mix the batter just before frying.<br>â€¢ Maintain a consistent temperature, if the temperature is too low, the batter will absorb oil and won\'t crisp up; too high, and it will burn.<br>â€¢ If you are frying both seafood and vegetables, try to fry vegetables first, then fry seafood.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ingredients for Tempura Batter:<br>- Maida1 cup<br>- Corn Flour 2 tbsp<br>- Kali mirch powder Â½ tsp <br>- Namak 1 tsp<br>- Anda 1<br>- Iced cold soda water Â¾ to 1 cup<br><br>- Oil for deep frying<br>- Corn flour for coating Â½ cup<br>- Prawns 200 gms<br>- Mix vegetables (Pyaz/Binees ki phalli/Band ghobi/Gajar/Shimla mirch/ Bengan or any of your choice)<br><br>Directions:<br>-Bowl mein maida,corn flour,namak aur kali mirch powder dal ker mix kerlein.Anda shamil karein aur mix kerlein.Ab is mein chilled soda water ahista ahista shamil karein.Batter ko bohat ziyada mix nahi kerna hai.<br>-Oil ko darmiyani ancch per garam kerlein.<br>-Ab vegetables ko corn flour aur batter mein coat karein aur deep fry kerlein.Yehe tareeka prawns kliya bhi istamal karein.<br>-Halka sunhairi hunay tak fry karein.<br>-Apni pasand ki sauce k saath serve karein.<br><br>Tips:<br>â€¢ Batter ko bohat ziyada mix nahi kerna hai,ziyada mixing sa batter heavy ho jayga.<br>â€¢ Surf chilled soda water istamal karein,app is ki jagha thanda pani bhi istamal ker saktya han magar result thora different hoga.<br>â€¢ Batter ko surf fry kerna sa pehla banayein.<br>â€¢ Agar oil ka temperature bohat kum hoga tou batter oil absorb ker lega aur agar bohat ziyada huwa tou jal jayega.<br>â€¢ Fry kerna kliya pehla vegetables aur phr seafood fry karein.</p>','',26,'587lN7WTKYQ','','active','','2017-07-21 13:24:47','Tempura with prawns, onions rings and more recipe','','Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients for Tempura Batter:\r\n- Flour 1 cup\r\n- Corn Flour 2 tbsp\r\n- Black pepper Â½ tsp \r\n- Salt 1 tsp\r\n- Egg 1\r\n- Iced cold soda water Â¾ to 1 cup\r\n\r\n- Oil for deep frying\r\n- Corn flour for coating Â½ cup\r\n- Prawns 200 gms\r\n- Mix',10,'youtube',''),(485,'Matar Qeema Recipe','<p>Matar Qeema</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>-Oil 2-3 tbs<br>-Sabut garam masala (Whole spices) Â½ tbs <br>-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 3-4<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper corns) 10-12<br>-Badi elaichi (Black cardamom) 1<br>-Laung (Cloves) 5-6<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Sliced 2<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs <br>-Beef qeema (Beef mince) hand-chopped Â½ kg <br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 tsp <br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp <br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp <br>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) Sliced 2-3<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as required<br>-Matar (Peas) 250 gms <br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) 1 tsp <br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander) for garnish<br>-Podina (Mint leaves) for garnish<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) for garnish<br><br>Directions:<br>-In pot,add oil,whole spices,onion and ginger garlic paste,fry until light brown.<br>-Add beef mince and mix well for 4-5 minutes.<br>-Add coriander powder,salt,turmeric powder and red chili powder,mix well.<br>-Add tomatoes,mix,cover and cook until tomatoes are soft.<br>-Add water and peas,mix well,cover & cook for 10-12 minutes or until peas are done.<br>-Add whole spice powder,green coriander and mint leaves,mix well.<br>-Garnish with green coriander and green chilies.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Oil 2-3 tbs<br>-Sabut garam masala (Whole spices) Â½ tbs <br>-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 3-4<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper corns) 10-12<br>-Badi elaichi (Black cardamom) 1<br>-Laung (Cloves) 5-6<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Sliced 2<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs <br>-Beef qeema (Beef mince) hand-chopped Â½ kg <br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 1 tsp <br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â½ tsp <br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp <br>-Tamatar (Tomatoes) Sliced 2-3<br>-Pani (Water) Â½ Cup or as required<br>-Matar (Peas) 250 gms <br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) 1 tsp <br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander) for garnish<br>-Podina (Mint leaves) for garnish<br>-Hari mirch (Green chilies) for garnish<br><br>Directions:<br>-Pot mein oil,sabut garam masala,pyaz aur adrak lehsan paste dal ker light brown hunay tak fry ker lein.<br>-Beef qeema dal ker 4-5 minute kliya mix ker lein.<br>-Dhania powder,namak,haldee powder aur lal mirch powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Tamatar dal ker mix karein aur dhak ker tamatar naram hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Pani aur matar dal ker mix karein,dhak ker 10-12 minute ya matar gul janay tak paka lein.<br>-Garam masala powder,hara dhania aur podina dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Hara dhania aur hari mirch sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'HxiTOxtHWZw','','active','','2017-07-21 13:26:17','Matar Qeema Recipe','','Matar Qeema\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Oil 2-3 tbs\r\n-Sabut garam masala (Whole spices) Â½ tbs \r\n-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 3-4\r\n-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper corns) 10-12\r\n-Badi elaichi (Black cardamom) 1\r\n-Laung (Cloves) 5-6\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) ',8,'youtube',''),(486,'Achar gosht Recipe','<p>Ingredients:&nbsp;</p><p>- Achar Gosht Masala:<br>â€¢ Salt 1 & Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Red Chili Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Fennel Seeds Crushed Â½ Tbs<br>â€¢ Chili Flakes 1 Tsp<br>â€¢ Fenugreek Seeds Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Turmeric 1 Tsp<br>â€¢ Whole Spice Powder Â½ Tbs<br>â€¢ Coriander Seeds Crushed Â½ Tbs<br>â€¢ Nigella Seeds Crushed Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Cumin Seeds Crushed Â½ Tbs<br>- Lemon Juice 1 Tbs<br>- Yogurt 1 & Â½ Cup<br>- Ginger Garlic Paste 1 Tbs<br>- Beef 1/2 Kg<br>- Green Chilies 5-6 <br>- Oil Â½ Cup <br>- Tomatoes Grinded Large 2 <br>- Water Â½ Cup Or As Required<br><br>Directions:<br>In a bowl, add all dry spices to make Achar Gosht masala. In a small bowl, take lemon juice and add 1 tbs of achar gosht masala and set aside for green chilies filling.<br>Slit and deseed green chilies and fill with the mixture of lemon and masala. Set aside.<br>In remaining achar gosht masala add yogurt, ginger garlic and mix well. Add meat, mix well and marinate for 1-2 hours.<br>In a pan, heat oil and add grinded tomatoes and fry on high flame for 2 mins, add marinated meat and fry for 2-3 mins. Add Â½ cup water and cover and cook for 25 mins or until meat is tender. Add water if required. Now fry cook until oil separates. Add masala filled chilies and cover and let them simmer for 4-5 mins on low flame.<br>Achar Gosht is ready to serve.<br><br>Achar Gosht Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza: <br>- Achar Gosht Masala:<br>â€¢ Namak 1 & Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Lal Mirch Powder Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Saunf Crushed Â½ Tbs<br>â€¢ Lal Mirch Kuti Huee 1 Tsp<br>â€¢ Methi Dana Kuta Hua Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Haldee 1 Tsp<br>â€¢ Garam Masala Powder Â½ Tbs<br>â€¢ Dhania Crushed Â½ Tbs<br>â€¢ Kalonji Crushed Â½ Tsp<br>â€¢ Zeera Crushed Â½ Tbs<br>- Lemon Juice 1 Tbs<br>- Dahi 1 & Â½ Cup<br>- Adrak Lehsan Paste 1 Tbs<br>- Beef 1/2 Kg<br>- Hari Mirch Moti 5-6 <br>- Oil Â½ Cup <br>- Tamatar Pisse Hue Large 2 <br>- Pani Â½ Cup Or As Required<br><br>Banane ka Tareeka:<br>Ek bowl main sare sokhay masalay ko aik sath mix karain ab iss tyar achar gosht masay may say 1 tbs masalah nikal lain aur lemaon juice may mix kar lain aur aik side per rakh lain.<br>Mirch ko beech main cut laga ke beej nikal len aur lemon+masala se bhar lain.<br>Ab baqi masalay main dahi, adrak lehsan mix karain sath gosht bhi shamil kar ke mix karain aur 2 hours marinate karne rakh dain.<br>Ab aik karhai main oil garam kar lain aur pisse hue tamatar shamil karke tez aanch par 2 min bhoonen. Phir marinate hua gosht shamil kar ke 2-3 min bhoonlen. Pani shamil karke dhak den aur gosht gal jane tak pakayen. Gosht gal jane ke baad achi tarah usko bhoon lain yahan tak ke oil alaihda hojaye.<br>Ab masala bhari mirchen shamil kar ke 4-5 minute halki anch per paka lain. <br>Mazedar Achar gohat tayar hai.</p>','',26,'8MxtSEJ_Koc','','active','','2017-07-21 13:40:08','Achar gosht Recipe','','Ingredients: \r\n- Achar Gosht Masala:\r\nâ€¢ Salt 1 & Â½ Tsp\r\nâ€¢ Red Chili Â½ Tsp\r\nâ€¢ Fennel Seeds Crushed Â½ Tbs\r\nâ€¢ Chili Flakes 1 Tsp\r\nâ€¢ Fenugreek Seeds Â½ Tsp\r\nâ€¢ Turmeric 1 Tsp\r\nâ€¢ Whole Spice Powder Â½ Tbs\r\nâ€¢ Coriander Seeds Crushed Â½ Tbs\r\nâ€',8,'youtube',''),(487,'Aloo Ghosht (Delhi Style) ','<p>Aloo Gosht (Delhi Style)</p><p><br>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>-Oil Â½ cup<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Sliced 3<br>-Oil 3-4 tbs <br>-Beef/Mutton Â½ kg<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Kashmiri lal mirch (Kashmiri red chili) 1 tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 2 tsp<br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 4-5<br>-Laung (Cloves) 4-5<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Paani (Water) 2 cups or as required<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ cup<br>-Pyaz (onion) Fried & grinded<br>-Aalo (Potatoes) Medium 3-4 <br>-Paani (Water) 1 cup or as required<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Elaichi powder (Cardamom powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Jaifal & javatri powder (Nutmeg & mace powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Kewra essence Â½ tsp<br>-Hara dhaniya (Green coriander) Chopped<br>-Adrak (Ginger) Julienne<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) 3-4<br><br>Directions:<br>-In pot,add oil and onion,fry till brown,grind fried onion and set aside. <br>-In pot,add oil,beef and fry for 1-2 minutes.<br>-Add ginger garlic and mix well.<br>-Add kashmiri red chili,turmeric powder,salt,coriander powder,green cardamom,cloves and red chili powder,mix well and add water,bring it to boil.<br>-Cover and let it cook until meat is Â¾ done.<br>-Add yogurt and cook until water dries and oil separates.<br>-Now add onion (fried & grinded) and mix well.<br>-Add potatoes and water,mix it,cover and cook till potatoes are tender and meat is done.<br>-Add whole spice powder, cardamom powder,nutmeg & mace powder,kewra essence,green coriander, ginger (julienne) and green chili.<br>-Cover and put it on simmer for 1-2 minutes.<br>-Delhi wala aalo gosht is ready to serve.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br>Ajza:<br>-Oil Â½ cup<br>-Pyaz (Onion) Sliced 3<br>-Oil 3-4 tbs <br>-Beef/Mutton Â½ kg<br>-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs<br>-Kashmiri lal mirch (Kashmiri red chili) 1 tsp<br>-Haldee powder (Turmeric powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Dhania powder (Coriander powder) 2 tsp<br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 4-5<br>-Laung (Cloves) 4-5<br>-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp or to taste<br>-Paani (Water) 2 cups or as required<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Â½ cup<br>-Pyaz (onion) Fried & grinded<br>-Aalo (Potatoes) Medium 3-4 <br>-Paani (Water) 1 cup or as required<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Elaichi powder (Cardamom powder) Â½ tsp<br>-Jaifal & javatri powder (Nutmeg & mace powder) Â¼ tsp<br>-Kewra essence Â½ tsp<br>-Hara dhaniya (Green coriander) Chopped<br>-Adrak (Ginger) Julienne<br>-Hari mirch (Green chili) 3-4<br><br>Directions:<br>-Pot mein oil aur pyaz dal ker brown hunay tak fry ker lein,fried pyaz ko grind karein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Pot mein oil aur beef dal ker 1-2 minute kliya fry ker lein.<br>-Adrak lehsan paste dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Kashmiri lal mirch,haldee powder,namak,dhania powder,hari elaichi,laung aur lal mirch powder dal ker mix karein,paani shamil ker k ubal anay tak paka lein.<br>-Dhak ker gosht Â¾ done hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Dahi shamil karein aur paani sukh janay aur oil alag hunay tak paka lein.<br>-Ab is mein pyaz (fried & grinded) dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Aalo aur paani dal ker mix karein,dhak ker aalo aur gosht gul janay tak paka lein.<br>-Garam masala powder,elaichi powder,jaifal & javatri powder,kewra essence,hara dhania (chopped),adrak (julienne) aur hari mirch shamil ker lein.<br>-Dhak ker dum per 1-2 minute kliya rakh dein.<br>-Delhi wala aalo gosht tayyar hai.</p>','',26,'cbzmggwKZbw','','active','','2017-07-21 13:40:49','Aloo Ghosht (Delhi Style) ','','Aloo Gosht (Delhi Style)\r\n\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Oil Â½ cup\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) Sliced 3\r\n-Oil 3-4 tbs \r\n-Beef/Mutton Â½ kg\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs\r\n-Kashmiri lal mirch (Kashmiri red chili) 1 tsp\r\n-Haldee powder (Turmer',13,'youtube',''),(488,'Mutton Rogan Josh','<p>Mutton Roghan Josh</p><p>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>-Mutton 1 kg<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp <br>-Badi elaichi (Black cardamom) 2<br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3-4 <br>-Saunf (Fennel seeds) 2 tbs <br>-Laung (Cloves) 6-8<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Drained Â½ cup<br>-Kashmiri lal mirch powder (Kashmiri red chili powder) 1 tbs <br>-Adrak powder (Ginger powder) 1 tsp<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Sarson ka tail (Mustard oil) Â½ Cup or as desired<br>-Darchini (Cinnamon sticks) 2 <br>-Tez paat (Bay leaves) 2 <br>-Pani (Water) 2-3 Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) as required<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) 1 tsp<br>-Ghee 1 tbs (Optional)<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander)<br><br>Directions:<br>-In mutton,add salt,mix well and marinate for 1-2 hour.<br>-In spice mixer,add black cardamom,green cardamom,fennel seeds,cloves and coarsely grind spices.<br>-In yogurt,add kashimiri red chili powder,ginger powder,black pepper powder and 1 tbs ground spices, mix well and set aside.<br>-In pot,add mustard oil,cinnamon sticks,bay leaves and marinated mutton,mix well for 10-12 minutes.<br>-Add remaining ground spices and mix well.<br>-Gradually add spiced yogurt and mix well on low flame.<br>-Add remaining spiced yogurt and mix well for 10-15 minutes.<br>-Add water,cover and cook for 1 hour or until meat is tender.<br>-Adjust salt in the gravy,add whole spice powder and ghee,cover and let it simmer for 4-5 minutes.<br>-Garnish with green coriander.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>-Mutton 1 kg<br>-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp <br>-Badi elaichi (Black cardamom) 2<br>-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3-4 <br>-Saunf (Fennel seeds) 2 tbs <br>-Laung (Cloves) 6-8<br>-Dahi (Yogurt) Drained Â½ cup<br>-Kashmiri lal mirch powder (Kashmiri red chili powder) 1 tbs <br>-Adrak powder (Ginger powder) 1 tsp<br>-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp<br>-Sarson ka tail (Mustard oil) Â½ Cup or as desired<br>-Darchini (Cinnamon sticks) 2 <br>-Tez paat (Bay leaves) 2 <br>-Pani (Water) 2-3 Cups<br>-Namak (Salt) as required<br>-Garam masala powder (Whole spice powder) 1 tsp<br>-Ghee 1 tbs (Optional)<br>-Hara dhania (Green coriander)<br><br>Directions:<br>-Mutton mein namak dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur 1-2 hour kliya marinate ker lein.<br>-Spice mixer mein badi elaichi,hari elaichi,saunf aur laung dal ker grind ker lein.<br>-Dahi mein kashmiri lal mirch powder,adrak powder,kali mirch powder aur 1 tbs ground spices dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur side pee rakh dein.<br>-Pot mein sarson ka tail,darchini,tez paat aur marinated mutton dal ker 10-12 minute kliya mix ker lein.<br>-Baqi bacha huway ground spices dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Thora thora ker ka spiced dahi dal ker halki ancch per mix kertay jayein.<br>-Baqi bache hoye spiced dahi dal ker 10-15 minute kliya mix ker lein.<br>-Pani shamil karein,dhak ker 1 hour ya gosht gul janay tak paka lein.<br>-Agar zaroorat ho tou gravy mein namak dal dein,garam masala powder aur ghee dal ker dhak ker 4-5 minute kliya dum per rakh dein.<br>-Hara dhania sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'b-W4cg0q_58','','active','','2017-07-21 13:41:27','Mutton Rogan Josh','','Mutton Roghan Josh\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Mutton 1 kg\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp \r\n-Badi elaichi (Black cardamom) 2\r\n-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3-4 \r\n-Saunf (Fennel seeds) 2 tbs \r\n-Laung (Cloves) 6-8\r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) Drained Â½ cup\r\n-Kashmiri ',11,'youtube',''),(489,'Mutton Kunna Recipe with Kunnah masala spice mix ','<p><br>Mutton Kunna<br>Recipe in English:<br><br>Ingredients:<br>Kunna:<br>-Ghee/oil Â½ cup<br>-Mutton Â½ kg <br>-Onion 1 medium (sliced)<br>-Ginger garlic paste 1 tbs<br>-Red chili powder Â½ tbs<br>-Deghi lal mirch Â½ tsp<br>-Turmeric powder Â¼ tsp<br>-Corinader powder Â½ tsp<br>-Cumin seeds Â½ tsp<br>-Salt 1 & Â½ tsp or to taste <br>-Water Â½ liter <br>-Yogurt Â¼ cup<br>-Flour Â½ or 1 tbs or as required<br>-Kunna special spices <br>-Water 1 cup<br>-Ginger as required (julienne)<br><br>Kunna special spices:<br>-Caraway seeds 1 tsp (roasted and crushed)<br>-Whole spice powder Â½ tsp<br>-Star anise powder 1 pinch<br>-Nutmeg 1 pinch<br>-Green cardamom powder 1 pinch<br>-Mace powder 1 pinch<br><br>Directions:<br>-In handi,heat ghee and add meat,onion,ginger garlic paste,red chili powder,deghi lal mirch,turmeric powder,coriander powder,,cumin seeds,salt and water,mix well.<br>-Cover and cook on medium low flame until meat tender and oil separates.(approx. 1hour)<br>-In small bowl,add caraway seeds (roasted and crushed),whole spice powder,star anise(powder),nutmeg powder,green cardamom powder and mace powder and mix it,kunna special spices is ready.<br>-Now add yogurt and cook on high flame for 2-3 minutes.<br>-Dissolve flour in water and add it in handi and mix it.<br>-Add 1cup water and give it a good mix.<br>-Now add kunna special spices, ginger (julienne), mix it.<br>-Cover and put it on simmer for 6-8 minutes until oil comes on surface.<br>-Kunna is ready, garnish with ginger (julienne).<br><br><br><br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br><br>Ajza:<br>Kunna:<br>-Ghee/oil Â½ cup<br>-Mutton Â½ kg <br>-Pyaz 1 medium (sliced)<br>-Adrak lehsan paste 1 tbs<br>-Lal mirch powder Â½ tbs<br>-Deghi lal mirch Â½ tsp<br>-Haldee powder Â¼ tsp<br>-Dhania powder Â½ tsp<br>-Zeera Â½ tsp<br>-Namak 1 & Â½ tsp or to taste <br>-Pani Â½ liter <br>-Dahi Â¼ cup<br>-Maida Â½ or 1 tbs or as required<br>-Kunna special spices <br>-Pani 1 cup<br>-Adrak hasb e zaroorat (julienne)<br><br>Kunna special spices:<br>-Shahi zeera 1 tsp (roasted and crushed)<br>-Garam masala powder Â½ tsp<br>-Badiyan ka phool powder 1 pinch<br>-Jailfal powder 1 pinch<br>-Hari elaichi powder 1 pinch<br>-Javitri powder 1 pinch<br><br>Directions:<br>-Handi mein ghee garam ker k mutton,pyaz,adrak lehsan paste,lal mirch powder,deghi lal mirch,haldee powder,dhania powder,zeera,namak aur pani dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Dhak ker halki darmiyani ancch per ghost gul janay aur oil alag ho janay taka paka lein.(approx. 1hour)<br>-Chotay bowl mein kala zeera/shahi zeera (roasted and crushed),garam masala powder,badiyan ka phool (powder),jaifal powder,hari elaichi powder,javitri powder dal ker mix ker lein,kunna special spices tayyar hai.<br>-Ab dahi shamil karein aur tez ancch per 2-3 minutes kliya paka lein.<br>-Maida ko pani mein dissolve ker lein aur handi mein shamil ker k mix ker lein.<br>-1 cup pani shamil ker k ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-Ab kunna special spices,adrak (julienne) dal ker mix ker lein.<br>-Dhak ker 6-8 minutes kliya dum per rakh dein oil alag hunay tak.<br>-Kunna tayyar hai, ginger (julienne) sa garnish karein.</p>','',26,'XQFXb5O9RHM','','active','','2017-07-21 13:42:52','Mutton Kunna Recipe with Kunnah masala spice mix ','','\r\nMutton Kunna\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nKunna:\r\n-Ghee/oil Â½ cup\r\n-Mutton Â½ kg \r\n-Onion 1 medium (sliced)\r\n-Ginger garlic paste 1 tbs\r\n-Red chili powder Â½ tbs\r\n-Deghi lal mirch Â½ tsp\r\n-Turmeric powder Â¼ tsp\r\n-Corinader powder Â½ tsp\r\n-Cumi',11,'youtube',''),(490,'Perfect Beef Nihari ','<p>Beef Nihari Recipe in English:</p><p><br>Ingredients<br>Special nihari masala<br>â€¢ Dhania sabit (coriander) 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Saunf (fennel seeds) 4 tbs<br>â€¢ Tez pata (bay leaves) 2<br>â€¢ Kali mirch sabit (black pepper) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Long (cloves) 1 tbs <br>â€¢ Jaifil (nutmeg) small piece <br>â€¢ Javitri (mace) small piece <br>â€¢ Kala zeera (black cumin) Â½ tbs<br>â€¢ Zeera (cumin seeds) 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Badi elaichi (black cardamom) 4 <br>â€¢ Elaichi (green cardamom) 4<br>â€¢ Long pepper (peepli) 2 sticks<br>â€¢ Sonth (dried ginger) small piece 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Badiyan ke phool (star anise) 2<br>â€¢ Daarchini (cinnamon sticks) 2<br>â€¢ Namak (salt) 1 Â½ tbs or to taste<br>â€¢ Lal mirch (red chili) powder 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Dhania (coriander) powder 2 tbs<br>â€¢ Haldi (turmeric) 1 tsp<br>â€¢ Kahsmiri mirch powder 1tbs<br>Nihari :<br>â€¢ Oil Â½ cup<br>â€¢ Beef bong 1 kg + bones Â½ kg <br>â€¢ Adrak (ginger) paste 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Lehsan (garlic) paste 1 tbs<br>â€¢ Atta (whole wheat flour) 1/3 cup <br>â€¢ Water 1 cup<br>â€¢ Special nihari masala 100 gms<br>â€¢ Pani (water) 2 ltr (2-3 inches above ingredients) <br>â€¢ Flour mixture<br>â€¢ Atta (flour) 4 tbs + pani (water) Â½ cup (add if required)<br>Tarri: <br>â€¢ Oil 2 cup<br>â€¢ Kashmiri lal mirch 2 tbs<br>Garnish:<br>â€¢ Adrak (ginger) finely chopped<br>â€¢ Hari mirch (green chilies)<br>â€¢ Hara dhania (coriander leaves)<br>â€¢ Lemon juice<br><br>Directions:<br>â€¢ To make special Nihari masala, add all whole ingredients in the blender and grind them finely. Add remaining spices and shake well, Special nihari masala is ready.. Make Nihari masala ahead of time and store it in airtight jar. <br>â€¢ To make Nihari, heat oil in pressure cooker and add beef and bones and fry for 2-3 mins. Add ginger garlic and fry on high flame for 1-2 mins. Add Â¾ cup of nihari masala and mix well. Add 2 liters of water and bring it to boil. Make sure you add enough water to dip all the ingredients. In a separate bowl dissolve 1/3 cup flour in 1 cup water and add to nihari and boil for 2-3 minutes. Now close pressure cooker and cook for 60-70 minutes. <br>â€¢ To prepare tarri, heat oil in a pan and add Kashmiri lal mirch mix for 30 seconds and dish out. Set aside. <br>â€¢ Turn off flame and open pressure cooker. Follow pressure cooker safety guidelines. Check meat and consistency of gravy. If required, dissolve flour in water and add to nihari and cook until desired consistency. <br>â€¢ Nihari is ready. Tarri can be added directly to the pan or serve with nihari. <br>â€¢ To serve, add nihari in a bowl, pour tarri, garnish with julienne cut ginger, chopped green chilies, lemon and chopped coriander.<br>â€¢ Originally nihari is not prepared in pressure cooker. If someone doesnâ€™t wish to use pressure cooker, follow same process and after adding water and few boil, lower the flame and let it cook for 5-6 hour until meat is very tender. Once its done, follow the last step of nihari.<br><br>Recipe in Urdu:<br>Directions:<br>-Special nihari masala banana kliya,blender mein saray masalay dal ker girnd ker lein aur jar mein nikal lein,ab is mein baqi bachay hoye masalay shamil karein aur shake ker lein.<br>-Special nihari masala tayyar hai.<br>-Alag bowl mein 1/3 cup atta pani mein mix kerlein aur side per rakh dein.Flour mixture tayyar hai.<br>-Nihari banana kliya,pressure cooker mein oil garam karein,beef aur bones shamil ker k 2-3 mins kliya fry ker lein.<br>-Adrak paste,lehsan paste dal ker tez ancch per 1-2 mins kliya fry ker lein.<br>- Â¾ cup nihari masala shamil ker k ache tarhan mix ker lein.<br>-2 liters pani aur flour mixture shamil ker k mix karein aur ubal anay tak paka lein.2-3 minutes kliya paka lein.Pressure cooker ko dhak dein aur 60-70 minutes kliya paka lein.<br>-Tarri (nihari oil) banana kliya pan mein oil garam karein aur kashmiri lal mirch dal ker 30 seconds kliya fry karein aur side per rakh dein.<br>-Chulha bund ker dein aur pressure cooker khol dein.Pressur cooker ki safety guideline ko follow karein.<br>-Meat ko check ker lein aur gravy ki consistency dekh lein.Flame on karein,agar zaroorat ho tou pani mein atta mix ker k shamil karein aur garha ho janay tak paka lein.<br>-Nihari tayyar hai.</p>','',26,'mZOXDAvMCM4','','active','','2017-07-21 13:43:41','Perfect Beef Nihari ','','Beef Nihari Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients\r\nSpecial nihari masala\r\nâ€¢ Dhania sabit (coriander) 2 tbs\r\nâ€¢ Saunf (fennel seeds) 4 tbs\r\nâ€¢ Tez pata (bay leaves) 2\r\nâ€¢ Kali mirch sabit (black pepper) 1 tbs\r\nâ€¢ Long (cloves) 1 tbs \r\nâ€¢ Jaifil (nutmeg)',11,'youtube',''),(491,'Cream Roll Recipe With Homemade Dough','<p>Cream Roll Recipe With Homemade Dough&nbsp;</p>','',26,'wjfoshrGz_g','','active','','2017-07-22 07:34:31','Cream Roll Recipe With Homemade Dough','','Cream Roll Recipe With Homemade Dough ',11,'youtube',''),(492,'CREAM PUFF OR CHOCOLATE ECLAIRS','<p>CREAM PUFF OR CHOCOLATE ECLAIRS</p>','',26,'P-j7zkbTCXc','','active','','2017-07-22 07:35:10','CREAM PUFF OR CHOCOLATE ECLAIRS','','CREAM PUFF OR CHOCOLATE ECLAIRS',10,'youtube',''),(493,'COCONUT MACAROONS','<p>COCONUT MACAROONS</p>','',26,'jMcONK-JL2g','','active','','2017-07-22 07:40:02','COCONUT MACAROONS','','COCONUT MACAROONS',7,'youtube',''),(494,'MARSHMALLOWS (homemade)','<p>MARSHMALLOWS (homemade)</p>','',26,'V1BYk3N9EUU','','active','','2017-07-22 07:42:22','MARSHMALLOWS (homemade)','','MARSHMALLOWS (homemade)',12,'youtube',''),(495,'TURKISH DELIGHT',