,0,'youtube',''),(1147,'Lemonade 4 Refreshing ways - Recipes by Food Fusion','Refresh yourself this summer with these 4 refreshing Lemonade recipes. Coconut, pineapple, watermelon and mint. So what is your favorite summer drink? \r\n\r\nLemonade 4-ways\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nPineapple Lemonade:\r\n-Pineapple slices 3-4\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) ½ Cup or to taste\r\n-Pineapple juice ½ Cup\r\n-Lemon juice 3-4 tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) 3-4 Cups \r\n-Ice cubes\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-In blender,add pineapple slices,sugar,pineapple juice,lemon juice,water and blend until well combined.\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nCoconut Lemonade:\r\n-Coconut small chunks 8-10\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 3-4 tbs or to taste\r\n-Lemon juice 2 tbs\r\n-Coconut water 3 Cups\r\n-Ice cubes\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-In blender,add coconut chunks,sugar,lemon juice,coconut water and blend until well combined.\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nMint Lemonade:\r\n-Podina (Mint leaves) 1 Cup\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) ½ Cup or to taste\r\n-Lemon juice ½ Cup\r\n-Pani (Water) 3-4 Cups\r\n-Ice cubes\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-In blender,add mint leaves,sugar,lemon juice,water and blend until well combined.\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nWatermelon Lemonade:\r\n-Watermelon 2 Cups \r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 4 tbs or to taste\r\n-Lemon juice 3-4 Tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) 2 Cups\r\n-Ice cubes\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-In blender,add watermelon,sugar,lemon juice,water and blend until well combined.\r\n-Strain & serve!\r\n\r\nRecipe in Urdu:\r\n\r\nAjza:\r\nPineapple Lemonade:\r\n-Pineapple slices 3-4\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) ½ Cup or to taste\r\n-Pineapple juice ½ Cup\r\n-Lemon juice 3-4 tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) 3-4 Cups \r\n-Ice cubes\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-Blender mein pineapple slices,cheeni,pineapple juice,lemon juice aur pani dal ker ache tarhan blend ker lein.\r\n\r\nAjza:\r\nCoconut Lemonade:\r\n-Coconut small chunks 8-10\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 3-4 tbs or to taste\r\n-Lemon juice 2 tbs\r\n-Coconut water 3 Cups\r\n-Ice cubes\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-Blender mein coconut chunks,cheeni,lemon juice aur coconut water dal ker ache tarhan blend ker lein.\r\n\r\nAjza:\r\nMint Lemonade:\r\n-Podina (Mint leaves) 1 Cup\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) ½ Cup or to taste\r\n-Lemon juice ½ Cup\r\n-Pani (Water) 3-4 Cups\r\n-Ice cubes\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-Blender mein podina,cheeni,lemon juice aur pani dal ker ache tarhan blend ker lein.\r\n\r\nAjza:\r\nWatermelon Lemonade:\r\n-Watermelon 2 Cups \r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 4 tbs or to taste\r\n-Lemon juice 3-4 Tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) 2 Cups\r\n-Ice cubes\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-Blender mein watermelon,cheeni,lemon juice aur pani dal ker dal ker ache tarhan blend ker lein.\r\n-Strain ker ka serve karein!','                        ',26,'c7j_C134CgQ','                        ','active','','2018-04-28 15:47:32','Lemonade 4 Refreshing ways - Recipes by Food Fusion','                        ','Lemonade 4 Refreshing ways - Recipes by Food Fusion      ',0,'youtube',''),(1148,'Sizzling Chicken Manchurian by Food Fusion','Mouth watering resturant style sizzling chicken manchurian recipe you would always remember. Video Includes special chinese red chilli paste to add that special touch to your chinese dishes. #HappyCookingToYou\r\n\r\nWritten Recipe: https://goo.gl/5w6Lgf\r\nAlso try chinese fried rice: https://goo.gl/we5Hru\r\n\r\nSizzling Chicken Manchurian Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nChinese Red Chili Paste:\r\n-Lehsan (Garlic) cloves ½ Cup\r\n-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) ½ Cup\r\n-Tomato ketchup 4 tbs\r\n-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) 1 pinch \r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 pinch \r\n-Pani (Water) ½ Cup or as required\r\n-Oil 1 Cup\r\nSizzling Manchurian:\r\n-Chicken boneless cubes 250 gms \r\n-Corn flour 1 tbs\r\n-Anda (Egg) beaten ½ \r\n-Namak (Salt) ½ tsp or to taste\r\n-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) 1 pinch \r\n-Cooking oil for frying \r\n-Cooking oil 2 tbs\r\n-Lehsan (Garlic) chopped 1 tsp\r\n-Tomato ketchup 4 tbs\r\n-Lemon juice 1 tbs\r\n-Sirka (Vinegar) 1 & ½ tbs\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) 1 tbs\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste\r\n-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) ¼ tsp\r\n-Chicken powder ½ tsp\r\n-Prepared chinese red chili pasta 2 tbs or to taste\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) cubes ½ Cup\r\n-Gajar (Carrot) slices ¼ Cup\r\n-Shimla mirch (Capsicum) cubes ½ Cup\r\n-Adrak (Ginger) julienne 1 tbs\r\n-Tamatar (Tomato) cubes ½ Cup\r\n-Hara dhania (Fresh coriander) chopped 1 tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) ½ Cup or as required \r\n-Corn flour 1 tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) 1-2 tbs \r\n-Makhan (Butter) \r\n\r\nDirections:\r\nFor Chinese Red Chili Paste:\r\n-In chopper,add garlic,chop well & set aside.\r\n-In bowl,add red chili powder,tomato ketchup,white pepper powder,salt and water,mix well & set aside.\r\n-In wok,add oil,chopped garlic and fry until golden brown.\r\n-Now add prepared red chili paste,mix well and cook until oil separates (3-4 minutes) & set aside.\r\n-Can be store in air tight container for up to 1 month on shelf.\r\nFor Sizzling Manchurian:\r\n-In bowl,add chicken boneless cubes,corn flour,egg,salt,white pepper powder and mix well.\r\n-In wok,heat cooking oil and fry chicken until light golden & set aside.\r\n-In wok,add cooking oil,garlic and mix well.\r\n-Add fried chicken cubes and mix well.\r\n-Add tomato ketchup,lemon juice and mix well.\r\n-Add vinegar,sugar,salt,white pepper powder,chicken powder and mix well.\r\n-Add 2 tbs of prepared chinese red chili paste and mix well.\r\n-Add onion,carrot,capsicum,ginger,tomato,fresh coriander and mix well.\r\n-Add water and mix well.\r\n-In water,add corn flour and mix well.\r\n-Gradually add dissolve corn flour and cook until sauce thickens.\r\n-On sizzling plate,add butter and let it melt,add chicken manchurian and serve with fried rice.\r\n\r\nRecipe in Urdu:\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\nFor Chinese Red Chili Paste:\r\n-Chopper mein lehsan dal ker ache tarhan chop ker lein & side per rakh dein.\r\n-Bowl mein lal mirch powder,tomato ketchup,safed mirch powder,namak aur pani dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein & side per rakh dein.\r\n-Karhai mein oil aur chopped lehsan dal dein aur golden brown hunay tak fry ker lein.\r\n-Ab tayyar red chili paste dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur oil alag hunay tak paka lein (3-4 minutes) & side per rakh dein.\r\n-Air tight container mein dal ker 1 month tak store ker saktay han (on shelf). \r\nFor Sizzling Manchurian:\r\n-Bowl mein chicken boneless cubes,corn flour,anda,namak aur safed mirch powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Karhai mein cooking oil dal dein aur chicken ko light golden hunay tak fry ker lein & side per rakh dein.\r\n-Karhai mein cooking oil aur lehsan dal ker ache tarhan mix karein.\r\n-Fried chicken cubes dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Tomato ketchup aur lemon juice dal ker ache tarhan mix karein.\r\n-Sirka,cheeni,namak,safed mirch powder aur chicken powder dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-2 tbs tayyar chinese red chili paste dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Pyaz,gajar,shimla mirch,adrak,tamatar aur hara dhania dal ker ache tarhan mix karein.\r\n-Pani shamil karein aur ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Pani mein corn flour dal ker ache tarhan mix karein.\r\n-Thora thora ker ka dissolve corn flour shamil kertay jayein aur sauce garha hunay tak paka lein.\r\n-Sizzling plate mein makhan dal ker melt karein,chicken manchurian dal dein aur fried rice ka saath serve karein.','                        ',26,'sN230boxq4Y','                        ','active','','2018-04-28 15:48:36','Sizzling Chicken Manchurian by Food Fusion','                        ','Sizzling Chicken Manchurian by Food Fusion\r\n      ',0,'youtube',''),(1149,'Make & Freeze Ramzan Recipes By Food Fusion','                    Here are some selected recipes that you can make in advance and freeze just in time for ramzan. This ramzan is going to be hot and no one wants to spend too much time in the kitchen. Just trying to make cooking fun for you all #HappyCookingToYou    ','                        ',26,'dRNBYQvkv50','                        ','active','','2018-04-28 15:49:31','Make & Freeze Ramzan Recipes By Food Fusion','                        ','Make & Freeze Ramzan Recipes By Food Fusion',0,'youtube',''),(1150,'| MOUCHI PRANK | By Nadir Ali In | P4 Pakao | 2018','| MOUCHI PRANK | By Nadir Ali In | P4 Pakao | 2018\r\n','                        ',27,'gS0NyFNHs94','                        ','active','','2018-04-28 16:05:46','| MOUCHI PRANK | By Nadir Ali In | P4 Pakao | 2018','                        ','| MOUCHI PRANK | By Nadir Ali In | P4 Pakao | 2018\r\n',0,'youtube',''),(1151,'| ANDAY WALA PRANK | By Ahmed Khan In | P4 Pakao | 2018','| ANDAY WALA PRANK | By Ahmed Khan In | P4 Pakao | 2018\r\n','                        ',27,'gYKcTjSfmgk','                        ','active','','2018-04-28 16:09:15','| ANDAY WALA PRANK | By Ahmed Khan In | P4 Pakao | 2018','                        ','| ANDAY WALA PRANK | By Ahmed Khan In | P4 Pakao | 2018 ',0,'youtube',''),(1152,'| RISHTA REJECTION PRANK | By Nadir Ali In | P4 Pakao | 2018','| RISHTA REJECTION PRANK | By Nadir Ali In | P4 Pakao | 2018\r\n','                        ',27,'3SNiRHk6RpI','                        ','active','','2018-04-28 16:13:23','| RISHTA REJECTION PRANK | By Nadir Ali In | P4 Pakao | 2018','                        ','| RISHTA REJECTION PRANK | By Nadir Ali In | P4 Pakao | 2018',0,'youtube',''),(1153,'| CHIRYA GHAR PRANK | By Nadir Ali & Asim Sanata In | P4 Pakao | 2018','| CHIRYA GHAR PRANK | By Nadir Ali & Asim Sanata In | P4 Pakao | 2018\r\n','                        ',27,'eKhHcNs1MkA','                        ','active','','2018-04-28 16:21:22','| CHIRYA GHAR PRANK | By Nadir Ali & Asim Sanata In | P4 Pakao | 2018','                        ','| CHIRYA GHAR PRANK | By Nadir Ali & Asim Sanata In | P4 Pakao | 2018',0,'youtube',''),(1154,'| Bijli Chor Prank | By Nadir Ali And Team In | P4 Pakao | 2018','| Bijli Chor Prank | By Nadir Ali And Team In | P4 Pakao | 2018','                        ',27,'4buTs9Ku1fE','                        ','active','','2018-04-28 16:30:54','| Bijli Chor Prank | By Nadir Ali And Team In | P4 Pakao | 2018','                        ','| Bijli Chor Prank | By Nadir Ali And Team In | P4 Pakao | 2018',0,'youtube',''),(1155,'Shahi White Chicken Recipe By Food Fusion','Here is one of the best Shahi white chicken recipe for you. Give it a try and enjoy with family. #HappyCookingToYou\r\n\r\n\r\nShahi White Chicken Recipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Kaju (Cashew nuts) soaked 10\r\n-Badam (Almonds) soaked & peeled 10\r\n-Pani (Water) 1 tbs or as required \r\n-Pyaz (Onion) 1 medium & Lehsan (Garlic) 3 cloves (boiled for 2-3 minutes)\r\n-Pani (Water) 1 tbs or as required \r\n-Makhan (Butter) 2 tbs\r\n-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 1\r\n-Laung (Cloves) 4\r\n-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3\r\n-Tez paat (Bay leaves) 2\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chilies) chopped 2\r\n-Pani (Water) 1 Cup or as required \r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) whisked ½ Cup (room temperature) \r\n-Baisan (Gram flour) roasted 1 tbs\r\n-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp or to taste\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste\r\n-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) ½ tsp\r\n-Oil ¼ Cup\r\n-Chicken boneless cubes ½ kg\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 2\r\n-Pani (Water) ½ Cup or as required \r\n-Adark (Ginger) julienne \r\n-Hara dhania (Fresh coriander) \r\n-Cream \r\n-Adark (Ginger) julienne \r\n-Hara dhania (Fresh coriander) \r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-In spice mixer,add cashew nuts,almonds and water,blend well & set aside.\r\n-In blender jar,add boiled onion and garlic,water and blend well & set aside.\r\n-In wok,add butter and let it melt,add cinnamon stick,cloves,green cardamom,bay leaves and mix well.\r\n-Add green chilies and mix well.\r\n-Add grinded onion mixture,mix well and cook for 5 minutes.\r\n-Add cashew+almond paste,mix well and cook for 2-3 minutes.\r\n-Add water,mix well and bring it to boil,cook for 2-3 minutes and take out in a bowl.\r\n-In yogurt,add gram flour,black pepper powder,salt,white pepper powder and whisk well.\r\n-In the same pot,add oil,chicken and mix well until changes color.\r\n-Add ginger garlic paste,mix well and fry until light golden.\r\n-Add green chilies and mix well.\r\n-Now add spiced yogurt and mix well for 2 minutes.\r\n-Cover and cook on low flame for 5 minutes then cook on high flame until oil separates.\r\n-Remove bay leaves from onion mixture,add it in pot and mix well.\r\n-Add water,mix well and cook for 2-3 minutes.\r\n-Add ginger and fresh coriander.\r\n-Garnish with cream,ginger,fresh coriander & serve.\r\n\r\nRecipe in Urdu:\r\n\r\nAjza:\r\n-Kaju (Cashew nuts) soaked 10\r\n-Badam (Almonds) soaked & peeled 10\r\n-Pani (Water) 1 tbs or as required \r\n-Pyaz (Onion) 1 medium & Lehsan (Garlic) 3 cloves (boiled for 2-3 minutes)\r\n-Pani (Water) 1 tbs or as required \r\n-Makhan (Butter) 2 tbs\r\n-Darchini (Cinnamon stick) 1\r\n-Laung (Cloves) 4\r\n-Hari elaichi (Green cardamom) 3\r\n-Tez paat (Bay leaves) 2\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chilies) chopped 2\r\n-Pani (Water) 1 Cup or as required \r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) whisked ½ Cup (room temperature)\r\n-Baisan (Gram flour) roasted 1 tbs\r\n-Kali mirch powder (Black pepper powder) 1 tsp or to taste\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp or to taste\r\n-Safed mirch powder (White pepper powder) ½ tsp\r\n-Oil ¼ Cup\r\n-Chicken boneless cubes ½ kg\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste (Ginger garlic paste) 1 tbs\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 2\r\n-Pani (Water) ½ Cup or as required \r\n-Adark (Ginger) julienne \r\n-Hara dhania (Fresh coriander) \r\n-Cream \r\n-Adark (Ginger) julienne \r\n-Hara dhania (Fresh coriander) \r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-Spice mixer mein kaju,badam aur pani dal ker ache tarhan blend ker lein & side per rakh dein.\r\n-Blender jar mein boiled pyaz,lehsan aur pani dal ker ache tarhan blend ker lein & side per rakh dein.\r\n-Karhai mein makhan dal ker melt karein,darchini,laung,hari elaichi aur tez paat dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Hari mirch dal ker ache tarhan mix karein.\r\n-Grinded pyaz mixture ko dal ker ache tarhan karein aur 5 minutes kliya paka lein.\r\n-Kaju+badam paste dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur 2-3 minutes kliya paka lein.\r\n-Pani dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur ubal anay ka bad 2-3 minutes kliya paka lein aur bowl mein nikal lein.\r\n-Dahi mein baisan,kali mirch powder,namak aur safed mirch powder dal ker ache tarhan whisk ker lein.\r\n-Us he pot mein oil aur chicken dal dein aur rang tabdeel hunay tak ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Adrak lehsan paste dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur light golden hunay tak fry ker lein.\r\n-Hari mirch dal ker mix karein.\r\n-Ab spiced dahi dal ker 2 minutes kliya ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Dhak dein aur halki ancch per 5 minutes kliya paka lein phir tez ancch per oil alag hunay tak paka lein.\r\n-Pyaz mixture mein sa tez paat nikal lein aur pot mein dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Pani dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur 2-3 minutes kliya paka lein.\r\n-Hara dhania aur adrak dal dein.\r\n-Cream,adrak aur hara dhania sa garnish ker ka serve karein.','                        ',26,'liVj6yPsSI4','                        ','active','','2018-04-29 15:03:59','Shahi White Chicken Recipe By Food Fusion','                        ','Shahi White Chicken Recipe By Food Fusion\r\n ',0,'youtube',''),(1156,'If Your Phone Was Human | MangoBaaz','What if your phone was as moody and difficult to deal with like some of your friends?! Would you ever want to upgrade your friend? Like and Share this video with all phone addicts and friends :)','                        ',128,'wG9l3mOQ4Pg','                        ','active','','2018-04-30 14:29:50','If Your Phone Was Human | MangoBaaz','                        ','If Your Phone Was Human | MangoBaaz\r\n ',0,'youtube',''),(1157,'If Your Phone Was Human | MangoBaaz','What if your phone was as moody and difficult to deal with like some of your friends?! Would you ever want to upgrade your friend? Like and Share this video with all phone addicts and friends :)','                        ',128,'wG9l3mOQ4Pg','                        ','active','','2018-04-30 14:29:51','If Your Phone Was Human | MangoBaaz','                        ','If Your Phone Was Human | MangoBaaz\r\n ',0,'youtube',''),(1160,'Maa Sadqey Episode #73 HUM TV Drama 2 May 2018','\r\n#HumTv #Drama #MaaSadqey\r\nWatch Maa Sadqey Episode #73 Full HD - Maa Sadqey is the latest drama serial by Hum TV and Hum TV Dramas are well-known for its quality in Pakistani Drama & Entertainment production. Today Hum TV is broadcasting the Episode #73 of Maa Sadqey. Maa Sadqey Episode #73 Full in HD Quality 2 May 2018 at Hum TV official YouTube channel. Enjoy official Hum Tv Pakistani Drama with best dramatic scene, sound and surprise.\r\n\r\nHUM Network Presents Maa Sadqey\r\n\r\nStarring\r\nFaiq Khan, Zainab Ahmed, Syed Yorguc Tipu Shareef, Ayesha Gul, Amna Wajahat, Ayesha Khan, Fahima Faisal Awan, Abdul Rehman, Falak Shehzad, Khushi Maheen, and others\r\n\r\nDirected By\r\nHaseeb Ali\r\n\r\nWritten By\r\nJahanzeb Qamar','                        ',132,'7jsSqcQrfSA','                        ','active','','2018-05-06 11:36:45','Maa Sadqey Episode #73 HUM TV Drama 2 May 2018','                        ','Maa Sadqey Episode #73 HUM TV Drama 2 May 2018 ',0,'youtube',''),(1161,'Maa Sadqey Episode #74 HUM TV Drama 3 May 2018','\r\n#HumTv #Drama #MaaSadqey\r\nWatch Maa Sadqey Episode #74 Full HD - Maa Sadqey is the latest drama serial by Hum TV and Hum TV Dramas are well-known for its quality in Pakistani Drama & Entertainment production. Today Hum TV is broadcasting the Episode #74 of Maa Sadqey. Maa Sadqey Episode #74 Full in HD Quality 3 May 2018 at Hum TV official YouTube channel. Enjoy official Hum Tv Pakistani Drama with best dramatic scene, sound and surprise.\r\n\r\nHUM Network Presents Maa Sadqey\r\n\r\nStarring\r\nFaiq Khan, Zainab Ahmed, Syed Yorguc Tipu Shareef, Ayesha Gul, Amna Wajahat, Ayesha Khan, Fahima Faisal Awan, Abdul Rehman, Falak Shehzad, Khushi Maheen, and others\r\n\r\nDirected By\r\nHaseeb Ali\r\n\r\nWritten By\r\nJahanzeb Qamar','                        ',132,'VPTBV5wGvkQ','                        ','active','','2018-05-06 11:38:07','Maa Sadqey Episode #74 HUM TV Drama 3 May 2018','                        ','Maa Sadqey Episode #74 HUM TV Drama 3 May 2018',0,'youtube',''),(1162,'Maa Sadqey Episode #75 HUM TV Drama 4 May 2018','\r\n#HumTv #Drama #MaaSadqey\r\nWatch Maa Sadqey Episode #75 Full HD - Maa Sadqey is the latest drama serial by Hum TV and Hum TV Dramas are well-known for its quality in Pakistani Drama & Entertainment production. Today Hum TV is broadcasting the Episode #75 of Maa Sadqey. Maa Sadqey Episode #75 Full in HD Quality 4 May 2018 at Hum TV official YouTube channel. Enjoy official Hum Tv Pakistani Drama with best dramatic scene, sound and surprise.\r\n\r\nHUM Network Presents Maa Sadqey\r\n\r\nStarring\r\nFaiq Khan, Zainab Ahmed, Syed Yorguc Tipu Shareef, Ayesha Gul, Amna Wajahat, Ayesha Khan, Fahima Faisal Awan, Abdul Rehman, Falak Shehzad, Khushi Maheen, and others\r\n\r\nDirected By\r\nHaseeb Ali\r\n\r\nWritten By\r\nJahanzeb Qamar   ','                        ',132,'bglOvVv6qIc','                        ','active','','2018-05-06 11:38:34','Maa Sadqey Episode #75 HUM TV Drama 4 May 2018','                        ','Maa Sadqey Episode #75 HUM TV Drama 4 May 2018',0,'youtube',''),(1166,'Homemade Samosa Patti and Roll Patti recipes by Food Fusion (Ramzan Recipe)','Homemade Samosa & Roll Patti \r\n\r\nRecipe in English:\r\nIngredients:\r\n-Safed atta (White flour) sifted 1 & ½ Cups\r\n-Namak (Salt) ¼ tsp \r\n-Oil 2 tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) ½ Cup or as required \r\n-Cooking oil for frying \r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-In bowl,add white flour,salt,oil and mix well.\r\n-Gradually add water and knead until soft dough is formed.\r\n-Cover and let it rest for 30 minutes. \r\n-Knead dough again with oil,sprinkle flour on working surface and roll out dough with the help of rolling pin.\r\n-Now cut the dough with cutter,grease with oil and sprinkle flour on 3 rolled dough.\r\n-On one rolled dough,place other rolled dough over it (makes 4 layers in this way) and roll out with the help of the rolling pin.\r\n-Heat griddle and cook on low flame for 30 seconds each side then separates the 4 layers & let it cool down.\r\n-Cut it in roll and samosa patti size with cutter and can be freeze in zip lock bag for up to 3 weeks.\r\n-Cut the remaining edges with cutter.\r\n-In wok,heat cooking oil and fry until golden & crispy.\r\n\r\nRecipe in Urdu:\r\n\r\nAjza:\r\n-Safed atta (White flour) sifted 1 & ½ Cups\r\n-Namak (Salt) ¼ tsp \r\n-Oil 2 tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) ½ Cup or as required \r\n-Cooking oil for frying \r\n\r\nDirections:\r\n-Bowl mein safed atta,namak aur oil dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Thora thora ker ka pani shamil karein aur ghond ker naram dough tayyar ker lein.\r\n-Dhak ker 30 minutes kliya rakh dein.\r\n-Dough ko dubara oil laga ker ghond lein aur working surface per atta chirak ker dough ko rolling pin ki madad sa bail lein.\r\n-Dough ko cutter ki madad sa cut ker lein aur oil sa grease ker lein aur 3 rolled dough per atta chirak dein.\r\n-Ek rolled dough per baqi tamam rolled dough rakh dein (4 layers bana lein) aur rolling pin ki madad sa bail lein.\r\n-Tawa garam karein aur halki ancch per 30 seconds kliya dono sides sa paka lein phir 4 layers ko alag alag ker lein & thanda ker lein.\r\n-Roll aur samosa patti ka sizes mein cutter ki madad sa cut ker lein aur zip lock bag mein rakh ker 3 weeks kliya freeze ker saktay han.\r\n-Baqi remaining edges ko cutter sa cut ker lein.\r\n-Karhai mein cooking oil garam karein aur golden & crispy hunay tak fry ker lein.','                        ',26,'qXj7y2eJrBI','                        ','active','','2018-05-08 14:19:18','Homemade Samosa Patti and Roll Patti recipes by Food Fusion (Ramzan Recipe)','                        ','Homemade Samosa Patti and Roll Patti recipes by Food Fusion (Ramzan Recipe)',0,'youtube',''),(1167,'Katori Chaat Recipe By Food Fusion (Ramzan Recipes)','Katori Chaat\r\nRecipe in English:\r\n\r\nIngredients:\r\nPrepare Dough:\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) sifted 2 Cups\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp\r\n-Oil 2 & ½ tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) lukewarm ½ Cup or as required\r\n-Oil for frying\r\nPrepare Meethi Chutney:\r\n-Imli pulp (Tamarind pulp) 1 Cup\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) ¾ Cup or to taste\r\n-Sonth (Dried ginger powder) 1 tsp\r\n-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp or to taste\r\n-Saunf (Fennel seeds) powdered 1 tsp\r\n-Lal mirch (Red chili) crushed ½ tsp\r\n-Namak (Salt) ¼ tsp or to taste\r\nPrepare Green Chutney:\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 2-3 \r\n-Lemon juice 1 tbs\r\n-Namak (Salt) ¼ tsp or to taste\r\n-Podina (Mint leaves) ½ Cup\r\n-Hara dhania (Fresh coriander) ½ Cup\r\n-Pani (Water) 2-3 tbs or as required \r\nPrepare Chaat:\r\n-Chanay (Chickpeas) boiled 1 Cup\r\n-Aloo (Potatoes) boiled & cubes 2 medium \r\n-Hari moong daal (Green lentil gram) soaked & boiled 1 Cup\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) chopped 1 medium \r\n-Tamatar (Tomato) deseeded & cubes 1 medium \r\n-Hari mirch (Green chili) chopped 1-2 \r\n-Namak (Salt) to taste\r\n-Chaat masala to taste\r\nAssembling:\r\n-Prepared katori\r\n-Chaat\r\n-Green Chutney\r\n-Meethi chutney\r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) whisked\r\n-Meethi chutney\r\n-Lal mirch (Red chili) crushed \r\n-Chaat masala\r\n-Nimco sev\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\nFor Dough:\r\n-In bowl,add all-purpose flour,salt,oil and mix well.\r\n-Gradually add water,mix well and knead until dough is formed and let it rest for 15 minutes.\r\n-Take a small dough,make a ball and roll out with the help of rolling pin and prick with fork (makes 8).\r\n-On inverted small bowl (1 x 3.5 inch),place rolled dough and press the edges and cut with the help of the knife.\r\n-In wok,heat oil and fry katori wrapped with dough until golden & crispy and remove small bowl with the help of the tong (makes 10-12).\r\nFor Meethi chutney:\r\n-In frying pan,add tamarind pulp,sugar and mix well.\r\n-Add dried ginger powder,red chili powder,fennel seeds,red chili crushed and salt,mix well and cook for 2 minutes & set aside.\r\nFor Green chutney:\r\n-In ginder,add green chilies,lemon juice,salt,mint leaves,fresh coriander and water,grind well & set aside.\r\nFor Chaat:\r\n-In bowl,add chickpeas,potatoes,green lentil gram,onion,tomato,green chilies,salt,chaat masala and mix well.\r\nAssembling:\r\n-On prepared katori,add chaat,green chutney,meethi chutney,yogurt,meethi chutney,red chili crushed, chaat masala,nimco sev & serve.\r\n\r\nRecipe in Urdu:\r\n\r\nAjza:\r\nPrepare Dough:\r\n-Maida (All-purpose flour) sifted 2 Cups\r\n-Namak (Salt) 1 tsp\r\n-Oil 2 & ½ tbs\r\n-Pani (Water) lukewarm ½ Cup or as required\r\n-Oil for frying\r\nPrepare Meethi Chutney:\r\n-Imli pulp (Tamarind pulp) 1 Cup\r\n-Cheeni (Sugar) ¾ Cup or to taste\r\n-Sonth (Dried ginger powder) 1 tsp\r\n-Lal mirch powder (Red chili powder) 1 tsp or to taste\r\n-Saunf (Fennel seeds) powdered 1 tsp\r\n-Lal mirch (Red chili) crushed ½ tsp\r\n-Namak (Salt) ¼ tsp or to taste\r\nPrepare Green Chutney:\r\n-Hari mirch (Green chilies) 2-3 \r\n-Lemon juice 1 tbs\r\n-Namak (Salt) ¼ tsp or to taste\r\n-Podina (Mint leaves) ½ Cup\r\n-Hara dhania (Fresh coriander) ½ Cup\r\n-Pani (Water) 2-3 tbs or as required \r\nPrepare Chaat:\r\n-Chanay (Chickpeas) boiled 1 Cup\r\n-Aloo (Potatoes) boiled & cubes 2 medium \r\n-Hari moong daal (Green lentil gram) soaked & boiled 1 Cup\r\n-Pyaz (Onion) chopped 1 medium \r\n-Tamatar (Tomato) deseeded & cubes 1 medium \r\n-Hari mirch (Green chili) chopped 1-2 \r\n-Namak (Salt) to taste\r\n-Chaat masala to taste\r\nAssembling:\r\n-Prepared katori\r\n-Chaat\r\n-Green Chutney\r\n-Meethi chutney\r\n-Dahi (Yogurt) whisked\r\n-Meethi chutney\r\n-Lal mirch (Red chili) crushed \r\n-Chaat masala\r\n-Nimco sev\r\n\r\nDirections:\r\nFor Dough:\r\n-Bowl mein maida,namak aur oil dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Thora thora ker ka pani shamil karein aur ghond ker dough tayyar ker lein aur 15 minutes kliya rakh dein.\r\n-Chota dough lein aur ball bana lein aur rolling pin ki madad sa bail lein aur fork sa prick ker lein (makes 8).\r\n-Chotay inverted bowl (1 x 3.5 inch) mein rolled dough rakh dein aur edges ko press ker ka knife ki madad sa cut ker lein.\r\n-Karhai mein oil garam karein aur katori wrapped dough ko golden & crispy hunay tak fry ker lein aur chotay bowl ko tang ki madad sa bahir nikal lein (makes 10-12).\r\nFor Meethi chutney:\r\n-Frying pan mein imli pulp aur cheeni dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\n-Sonth,lal mirch powder,saunf,lal mirch crushed aur namak dal ker ache tarhan mix karein aur 2 minutes kliya paka lein & side per rakh dein.\r\nFor Green chutney:\r\n-Grinder mein hari mirch,lemon juice,namak,podina,hara dhania aur pani dal ker ache tarhan grind ker lein & side per rakh dein.\r\nFor Chaat:\r\n-Bowl mein chanay,aloo,hari moong daal,pyaz,tamatar,hari mirch,namak aur chaat masala dal ker ache tarhan mix ker lein.\r\nAssembling:\r\n-Tayyar katori mein chaat,hari chutney,meethi chutney,dahi,meethi chutney,lal mirch crushed, chaat masala aur nimco sev dal ker serve karein.','                        ',26,'m9a4j4QMDm4','                        ','active','','2018-05-08 14:22:44','Katori Chaat Recipe By Food Fusion (Ramzan Recipes)','                        ','Katori Chaat Recipe By Food Fusion (Ramzan Recipes)        ',0,'youtube',''),(1168,'4 must try desserts on Eid. Recipes By Food Fusion','Here are 4 Must try Eid dessert recipes. Make them and enjoy this Eid with your friends & Family. ','                        ',26,'f3POsIEqU4I','                        ','active','','2018-05-08 14:23:26','4 must try desserts on Eid. Recipes By Food Fusion','                        ','4 must try desserts on Eid. Recipes By Food Fusion  ',0,'youtube',''),(1169,'Ramazan Special - Chand Mubarak | MangoBaaz','Shaitan ki kahani khatam! Sab ko chand mubarak ho! \r\n\r\nAur ramazan bhi mubarak ~~ \r\n','                        ',128,'WJdJhpmJtkc','           